(*Amplitude Completion*)

Begin["ConstructiveDiagrams`"];

CompleteFactorization::usage = "CompleteFactorization[amplitudes, channels, model] constructs a bounded linear correction from the supplied diagram expressions and sewn channel expressions, solving all physical residues simultaneously. It accepts ordinary amplitude pairs, a prepared-expression report, or an expression. CorrectionBasis supplies correction directions; Automatic uses the input and channel expressions, not a universal amplitude ansatz. ChannelReferences -> Automatic constructs bounded alternative reference continuations, checking each on its selected cut. Without declared exchange symmetry, automatic completion first tries externally reduced whole physical-reference channels and grouped pole-bearing input terms, then falls back to literal input and channel terms within the same term and time limits. Explicit pole-free input terms are retained, not added as cancellation directions in the first attempt. ChannelReferences -> None keeps only the literal correction space. Recorded preparation references are tried when available. Failed independent validation samples supply further exact equations, up to MaxRefinements -> 3, with fresh subsequent validation. Only proven algebraically zero or exactly linearly dependent directions are removed without reducing the correction span; other residue-preserving directions remain available to CompleteHighEnergy. These sampled checks are not a generic analytic reconstruction or uniqueness proof. ReturnDetails -> False is the default: successful completion returns only the updated amplitude. ReturnDetails -> True retains the candidate, correction, affine family, CorrectionSpace, ChannelContinuations, RefinementHistory and validation, and takes precedence over Output. Output -> \"Details\" remains available for existing code. Unresolved completion normally returns a concise Failure[\"IncompleteAmplitude\", ...], without an unchecked candidate or embedded report. ParameterRules -> Automatic uses the supplied model's variables and dependent functions; an explicit rule list overrides selected parameters. Numerical substitutions affect the checks and fitting only, not the returned symbolic amplitude. No new interactions are inferred.";
CompleteFactorization::args = "Expected amplitude pairs or an expression, ordinary factorization channels, a model and valid bounded-completion options.";
CompleteFactorization::usage = CompleteFactorization::usage <>
  " RandomSeed -> Automatic chooses a time-based seed once for the complete stage, including its retries. Details records the resolved RandomSeed; an explicit integer retains reproducible sample choices. The default Output -> Amplitude returns {externalMassRules, expression}, containing only Mass[externalLeg] replacements and no internal-shell assumptions. Pass this pair directly to PrepareAmplitudes, CompleteHighEnergy or CheckAmplitudes. Output -> Expression requests the bare expression; detailed reports keep their separate Amplitude and ExternalMassRules fields.";
CompleteFactorization::usage = CompleteFactorization::usage <>
  " AlternativeChannels -> {} optionally supplies original or alternative compact channel rows. Only after automatic completion fails are their selected residues checked against the supplied channels and their correction directions tried within the remaining term and time budgets. The supplied channels remain the targets for fitting and independent validation; alternatives never replace them. AlternativeChannelFallback in the details records the checks and result.";
CompleteFactorization::usage = CompleteFactorization::usage <>
  " InputReweighting -> Automatic first tries a single fitted coefficient on the pole-bearing input, then on a candidate that retains one copy of exact signed terms shared across separate diagram records. Explicit additive terms without PropDen denominators retain their original multiplicity. These are proposed corrections, not identities for summing diagrams; every original physical-channel obligation must pass fresh coherent-spin and parameter validation. The attempts share at most one fifth of the remaining stage time, capped at 30 seconds. InputReweighting -> None disables them; explicit CorrectionBasis and ChannelReferences -> None retain their existing behavior. InputFitAttempts in details records coefficients, overlap counts and validation. No normalization is fitted by CheckAmplitudes or its Feynman comparison.";
CompleteFactorization::usage = CompleteFactorization::usage <>
  " ChannelCompanions -> Automatic tries a small source-derived space before the larger channel spaces. Eligible two-leg cuts contain one declared massless leg and an equal-mass anchor/exchange. After selected-cut source normalization, group by chain momentum-insertion count and peel the emitted leg from typed lower-amplitude composites while protecting the selected propagator. Peeling is a proposed correction, not an identity; only a full independently validated all-channel fit is accepted. Explicit regular input is retained, pure pole-free new directions are rejected, and all propagators must belong to the original physical target catalog. The attempts share one third of the remaining stage time, capped at 60 seconds, with at most 15 seconds for construction. ChannelCompanions -> None disables this attempt. RepresentativeSelection -> Automatic uses exact bounded coefficient cancellations to choose a simpler point in a validated free family, preserving all directions and all explicit regular coefficients. None retains the original particular point. Final cleanup accepts only whole-expression improvements. These cosmetic choices share the existing two-second post-validation budget. Details expose ChannelCompanions, ChannelCompanionFit and RepresentativeSelection with coordinate offsets.";
CompleteFactorization::usage = CompleteFactorization::usage <>
  " Pass detailed PrepareAmplitudes reports for either input, including the channel argument, to retain preparation provenance. Original channel rows remain the residue targets; simplified rows and their fixed-reference remainders supply corrections. PreparationRemainders -> Automatic tries bounded grouped preparation corrections after inexpensive input reweighting and before larger channel spaces. Ordinary pair virtuality identities expose factors without putting any assembled propagator on shell. Exact compatibility probes can reject a space early but never certify success; all original channels and held-out spin/parameter tests remain required. The attempt shares at most one fifth of the remaining stage clock, capped at 12 seconds, with at most four seconds for construction. Unsuccessful spaces leave the existing fallbacks intact. Retained common-reference sums may be tried as a final bounded continuation fallback; reference changes are not assumed to be off-cut identities. PreparationRemainders -> None disables these attempts. Explicit CorrectionBasis and ChannelReferences -> None retain their literal behavior. Details expose PreparationRemainders, PreparationRemainderFit, PreparationReferenceAttempts and ChannelPreparation. Ordinary preparation pairs and channel rows do not contain hidden history or a cache.";
CompleteFactorization::usage = CompleteFactorization::usage <>
  " PolePreference has the same choices as PrepareAmplitudes and ConstructAmplitude. Automatic inherits the requested choice from detailed preparation reports; an explicit choice overrides it. AllPhysical first tries a bounded space whose kinematic denominators are only supplied physical propagators. AllSpurious favors other-massless-leg reference continuations; Cyclic and ReverseCyclic retain their orientations; Mixed admits both physical and spurious choices; Xi and IndependentXi favor their corresponding external-reference prescription. None disables the preferred-space attempt. This is a representation preference, not a guarantee or a weaker check: every original target, zero-residue obligation, coherent spin component and independent validation remains required. All fitted correction freedom is retained for CompleteHighEnergy. No independent regular interaction is added, and explicit regular input stays fixed. The attempt reserves at most half the remaining stage clock, capped at 90 seconds, with at most 15 seconds for construction. Insufficient or timed-out preferred spaces leave the existing fallbacks available. PreferredPoleSpace and PreferredPoleFit retain the attempt outcome. CompleteHighEnergy preserves the recorded preference.";
CompleteFactorization::usage = CompleteFactorization::usage <>
  " BoseSymmetryGroups -> Automatic and FermionSymmetryGroups -> Automatic identify identical external states using the supplied model's twice-spin, masses, species and helicity. Even twice-spin uses symmetric permutations; odd twice-spin uses their parity signs. Electron and positron groups remain separate. ExternalParticles -> Automatic inherits ordered names retained in preparation reports. Pass ExternalParticles -> particles to PrepareAmplitudes or completion when compact pairs have lost the process names. Without names, only unambiguous model-and-spinor-state matches are projected; equal masses alone never identify a species. Opposite helicities, different fixed spin states, and color-stripped colored states are not merged automatically. Explicit disjoint groups remain supported and must be correct for the process. Each empty group option disables only that particle statistic; set both to {} to disable all exchange projection. The seed and correction directions are projected over the combined group, preserving every original residue target and the existing diagram and sewing signs. Automatic uses a bounded exact subgroup when the full combined group exceeds order 120; ExchangeSymmetry details expose detected and used groups, requested and used orders, FullGroupUsed, source and diagnostics. BoseSymmetry and FermionSymmetry give separate summaries. Completion combines available compact, literal and certified selected-cut-prepared channel terms before projection. Exact formal linear dependencies may be removed by sparse reduction within a 60-second budget; unfinished pruning retains the full space. MaxCorrectionTerms applies after projection and pruning. CorrectionSpaceCandidates records the available space sizes. Symmetry-union CorrectionSpace names begin with Bose for bosons only, Fermion for fermions only, and Exchange for both; SelectedChannelSpace records its selected-cut checks. Each intermediate source-space construction may grow with group order, capped at 4096 directions unless a larger MaxCorrectionTerms was requested. High-energy completion inherits the used exchange constraints from a detailed factorization report, including for newly generated correction directions. No successful reconstruction is claimed until every original target and the full fitted family pass independent validation.";

Begin["ConstructiveDiagrams`Private`"];

completionBoseCycles[group_List, image_List] := Module[
  {mapping = AssociationThread[group, image], remaining = group, cycles = {}, cycle, current},
  While[remaining =!= {},
    current = First[remaining]; cycle = {};
    While[!MemberQ[cycle, current],
      AppendTo[cycle, current]; current = Lookup[mapping, current]];
    remaining = Complement[remaining, cycle];
    If[Length[cycle] > 1, AppendTo[cycles, cycle]]];
  cycles
];

(* Infer exchangeable external states without treating equal masses as species.
   This reads homogeneous spinor weights without expanding the expression. *)
completionExternalSpinWeights[expression_, rules_List] := Module[
  {labels = Sort[Cases[rules, HoldPattern[Mass[i_Integer] -> _] :> i]],
   zero, walk, spinorWeight, unknown = Missing["ExternalSpinWeight"]},
  zero = ConstantArray[0, Length[labels]];
  spinorWeight[s_Spinor] := Module[{parts = List @@ s, position, label, weight, result = zero},
    position = FirstPosition[parts, "Angle" | "Square", Missing["Type"]];
    If[MissingQ[position] || First[position] >= Length[parts], Return[unknown]];
    position = First[position]; label = parts[[position + 1]];
    If[!MemberQ[labels, label] || !MemberQ[{"Spin", "Helicity"}, First[parts]], Return[zero]];
    weight = If[TrueQ[(Mass[label] /. rules) === 0],
      If[parts[[position]] === "Angle", 1, -1], 1];
    result[[First[FirstPosition[labels, label]]]] = weight; result];
  walk[s_Spinor] := spinorWeight[s];
  walk[value_Plus] := Module[{terms = Select[List @@ value, # =!= 0 &], weights},
    weights = DeleteDuplicates[walk /@ terms];
    If[Length[weights] === 1, First[weights], unknown]];
  walk[value_Times] := Module[{weights = walk /@ (List @@ value)},
    If[AnyTrue[weights, MissingQ], unknown, Total[weights]]];
  walk[Power[base_, power_Integer]] := With[{weight = walk[base]},
    If[MissingQ[weight], unknown, power weight]];
  walk[value : (_SpinorChain | _SpinorChainReduced | _SpinorProduct)] := Module[
    {weights = walk /@ (List @@ value)},
    If[AnyTrue[weights, MissingQ], unknown, Total[weights]]];
  walk[value_] := If[FreeQ[value, _Spinor | _SpinorHat | _xFactor], zero, unknown];
  If[expression === 0, unknown, walk[expression]]
];

(* Keep the spin-state multiset separately in every additive term. Counting
   distinct indices alone loses projections and ignores powers. *)
completionBoseSpinState[expression_, label_Integer] := Module[
  {walk, endpoint, unknown = Missing["ExternalSpinState"]},
  endpoint[s_Spinor] := Module[{parts = List @@ s, position, variance, indices},
    position = FirstPosition[parts, "Angle" | "Square", Missing["Type"]];
    If[MissingQ[position] || First[position] >= Length[parts], Return[unknown]];
    position = First[position];
    If[parts[[position + 1]] =!= label || First[parts] =!= "Spin", Return[0]];
    variance = Take[parts, {2, position - 1}];
    indices = Drop[parts, position + 1] /.
      ConstructiveDiagrams`VectorSpinIndex[_, slot_] :>
        ConstructiveDiagrams`VectorSpinIndex[0, slot];
    completionFixedSpinState[variance, indices]];
  walk[s_Spinor] := endpoint[s];
  walk[value_Plus] := Module[{states = DeleteDuplicates[walk /@ (List @@ value)]},
    If[Length[states] === 1, First[states], unknown]];
  walk[value : (_Times | _SpinorChain | _SpinorChainReduced | _SpinorProduct)] :=
    Module[{states = walk /@ (List @@ value)},
      If[AnyTrue[states, MissingQ], unknown, Total[states]]];
  walk[Power[base_, power_Integer]] := With[{state = walk[base]},
    If[MissingQ[state], unknown, power state]];
  walk[value_] := If[FreeQ[value, _Spinor | _SpinorHat | _xFactor], 0, unknown];
  walk[expression]
];

completionInferBoseGroups[normalized_Association, model_List, particles_: Automatic] := Module[
  {rules = normalized["ExternalMassRules"], expression = normalized["Expression"],
   labels, weights, evidence, declared = particles, names, rows, candidates,
   mass, weight, boson, particle, state, legs = {}, keys = {}, diagnostics = {}, groups,
   color, row, source},
  labels = Sort[Cases[rules, HoldPattern[Mass[i_Integer] -> _] :> i]];
  If[declared === Automatic, declared = Lookup[normalized, "ExternalParticles", Automatic]];
  If[declared =!= Automatic,
    declared = preparationExternalParticleNames[declared, rules, model];
    If[FailureQ[declared], Return[declared]]];
  evidence = expression;
  If[expression === 0,
    evidence = SelectFirst[Lookup[Lookup[normalized, "Targets", {}], "StateSum", {}],
      # =!= 0 &, 0]];
  weights = completionExternalSpinWeights[evidence, rules];
  source = If[ListQ[declared], "ExternalParticles", "ModelAndExternalSpinWeights"];
  Do[
    mass = Mass[label] /. rules;
    weight = If[ListQ[weights], weights[[index]], Missing["ExternalSpinWeight"]];
    rows = Select[model[[1]], residueExactZero[#[[6]] - mass] &&
      If[ListQ[declared], MemberQ[#[[{2, 3}]], declared[[index]]],
        IntegerQ[weight] && #[[5]] === Abs[weight]] &];
    candidates = DeleteDuplicates[Flatten[Function[r,
      names = DeleteDuplicates[r[[{2, 3}]]];
      If[mass === 0 && IntegerQ[weight] && weight =!= 0,
        Select[names, !StringEndsQ[#, {".+", ".-"}] ||
          StringEndsQ[#, If[weight < 0, ".+", ".-"]] &], names]] /@ rows]];
    If[ListQ[declared], candidates = Intersection[candidates, {declared[[index]]}]];
    particle = If[Length[candidates] === 1, First[candidates], Missing["AmbiguousParticle"]];
    row = If[MissingQ[particle], Missing["Particle"],
      SelectFirst[rows, MemberQ[#[[{2, 3}]], particle] &, Missing["Particle"]]];
    boson = ListQ[row] && IntegerQ[row[[5]]] && EvenQ[row[[5]]];
    color = If[ListQ[row] && Length[row] >= 8, row[[8]], 1];
    state = Which[
      !TrueQ[boson], Missing["NotBoson"],
      mass === 0 && row[[5]] =!= 0,
        If[IntegerQ[weight], weight, If[StringEndsQ[ToString[particle], ".+"], -row[[5]],
          If[StringEndsQ[ToString[particle], ".-"], row[[5]], Missing["Helicity"]]]],
      row[[5]] =!= 0 && (!IntegerQ[weight] || Abs[weight] =!= row[[5]]),
        Missing["ExternalSpinState"],
      True, completionBoseSpinState[evidence, label]];
    If[Length[candidates] =!= 1,
      AppendTo[diagnostics, "External leg " <> ToString[label] <>
        " has no unique species and external state; no exchange symmetry was assumed for it."]];
    If[TrueQ[boson] && MissingQ[state],
      AppendTo[diagnostics, "The external spin state of leg " <> ToString[label] <>
        " could not be established consistently; no exchange symmetry was assumed for it."]];
    If[TrueQ[boson] && color =!= 1,
      AppendTo[diagnostics, "Colored external leg " <> ToString[label] <>
        " was left unprojected because color-stripped amplitudes need not be Bose symmetric."]];
    AppendTo[legs, <|"Label" -> label, "SpinWeight" -> weight,
      "Candidates" -> candidates, "Particle" -> particle, "Boson" -> boson|>];
    AppendTo[keys, If[TrueQ[boson] && color === 1 && !MissingQ[state],
      {particle, state}, Missing["NotExchangeable", label]]],
    {index, Length[labels]}, {label, {labels[[index]]}}];
  groups = Select[GatherBy[Range[Length[labels]], keys[[#]] &],
    Length[#] > 1 && !MissingQ[keys[[First[#]]]] &];
  <|"Groups" -> (labels[[#]] & /@ groups),
    "ExternalParticles" -> Lookup[legs, "Particle", {}], "Legs" -> legs,
    "Diagnostics" -> DeleteDuplicates[diagnostics], "Source" -> source|>
];

(* Infer fermion statistics from the model, not from bracket orientation or
   equal masses. Ambiguous species remain unprojected unless a user supplies
   an explicit exchange group. Numeric fixed-spin components must agree. *)
completionInferFermionGroups[normalized_Association, model_List, particles_: Automatic] := Module[
  {rules = normalized["ExternalMassRules"], expression = normalized["Expression"],
   labels, weights, evidence, declared = particles, names, rows, candidates, expectedMasses,
   mass, weight, fermion, particle, state, spin, spins, colors, color,
   legs = {}, keys = {}, diagnostics = {}, groups, source},
  labels = Sort[Cases[rules, HoldPattern[Mass[i_Integer] -> _] :> i]];
  If[declared === Automatic, declared = Lookup[normalized, "ExternalParticles", Automatic]];
  If[declared =!= Automatic,
    (* Compact amplitude records may use nonconsecutive external labels. The
       ordered names still correspond to the sorted declared mass labels. *)
    If[labels === Range[Length[labels]],
      declared = preparationExternalParticleNames[declared, rules, model],
      If[!ListQ[declared] || Length[declared] =!= Length[labels] || !AllTrue[declared, StringQ],
        declared = Failure["InvalidExternalParticles", <|"MessageTemplate" ->
          "ExternalParticles must contain one ordered name for each declared external label."|>],
        expectedMasses = physicalParticleMass[#, model[[1]]] & /@ declared;
        If[AnyTrue[expectedMasses, MissingQ] || !And @@ MapThread[residueExactZero[#1 - #2] &,
            {expectedMasses, (Mass /@ labels) /. rules}],
          declared = Failure["InconsistentExternalParticleMasses", <|"MessageTemplate" ->
            "ExternalParticles must identify model particles with the declared external masses."|>]]]];
    If[FailureQ[declared], Return[declared]]];
  evidence = expression;
  If[expression === 0,
    evidence = SelectFirst[Lookup[Lookup[normalized, "Targets", {}], "StateSum", {}], # =!= 0 &, 0]];
  weights = completionExternalSpinWeights[evidence, rules];
  source = If[ListQ[declared], "ExternalParticles", "ModelAndExternalSpinWeights"];
  Do[
    mass = Mass[label] /. rules;
    weight = If[ListQ[weights], weights[[index]], Missing["ExternalSpinWeight"]];
    rows = Select[model[[1]], residueExactZero[#[[6]] - mass] &&
      If[ListQ[declared], MemberQ[#[[{2, 3}]], declared[[index]]],
        IntegerQ[weight] && #[[5]] === Abs[weight]] &];
    candidates = DeleteDuplicates[Flatten[Function[r,
      names = DeleteDuplicates[r[[{2, 3}]]];
      If[mass === 0 && IntegerQ[weight] && weight =!= 0,
        Select[names, !StringEndsQ[#, {".+", ".-"}] ||
          StringEndsQ[#, If[weight < 0, ".+", ".-"]] &], names]] /@ rows]];
    If[ListQ[declared], candidates = Intersection[candidates, {declared[[index]]}]];
    particle = If[Length[candidates] === 1, First[candidates], Missing["AmbiguousParticle"]];
    spins = DeleteDuplicates[#[[5]] & /@ rows];
    spin = If[Length[spins] === 1, First[spins], Missing["AmbiguousSpin"]];
    fermion = rows =!= {} && AllTrue[rows, IntegerQ[#[[5]]] && OddQ[#[[5]]] &];
    colors = DeleteDuplicates[If[Length[#] >= 8, #[[8]], 1] & /@ rows];
    color = If[Length[colors] === 1, First[colors], Missing["AmbiguousColor"]];
    state = Which[
      !TrueQ[fermion], Missing["NotFermion"],
      mass === 0,
        If[IntegerQ[weight], weight, If[StringEndsQ[ToString[particle], ".+"], -spin,
          If[StringEndsQ[ToString[particle], ".-"], spin, Missing["Helicity"]]]],
      !IntegerQ[spin] || !IntegerQ[weight] || Abs[weight] =!= spin,
        Missing["ExternalSpinState"],
      True, completionBoseSpinState[evidence, label]];
    If[Length[candidates] =!= 1,
      AppendTo[diagnostics, "External leg " <> ToString[label] <>
        " has no unique species and external state; no fermion exchange symmetry was assumed for it."]];
    If[TrueQ[fermion] && MissingQ[state],
      AppendTo[diagnostics, "The external spin state of leg " <> ToString[label] <>
        " could not be established consistently; no fermion exchange symmetry was assumed for it."]];
    If[TrueQ[fermion] && color =!= 1,
      AppendTo[diagnostics, "Colored external leg " <> ToString[label] <>
        " was left unprojected because color-stripped amplitudes need not be fermion antisymmetric."]];
    AppendTo[legs, <|"Label" -> label, "SpinWeight" -> weight, "Spin2" -> spin,
      "Candidates" -> candidates, "Particle" -> particle, "Fermion" -> fermion,
      "State" -> state, "Color" -> color|>];
    AppendTo[keys, If[TrueQ[fermion] && color === 1 && Length[candidates] === 1 && !MissingQ[state],
      {particle, state}, Missing["NotExchangeable", label]]],
    {index, Length[labels]}, {label, {labels[[index]]}}];
  groups = Select[GatherBy[Range[Length[labels]], keys[[#]] &],
    Length[#] > 1 && !MissingQ[keys[[First[#]]]] &];
  <|"Groups" -> (labels[[#]] & /@ groups),
    "ExternalParticles" -> Lookup[legs, "Particle", {}], "Legs" -> legs,
    "Diagnostics" -> DeleteDuplicates[diagnostics], "Source" -> source|>
];

completionAutomaticBosePlan[normalized_Association, model_List, particles_: Automatic] := Module[
  {inferred = completionInferBoseGroups[normalized, model, particles], groups = {},
   order = 1, remaining, count, plan},
  If[FailureQ[inferred], Return[inferred]];
  (* A bounded subgroup is still a valid exact symmetry. Do not fail a large
     process merely because its full permutation group exceeds the work cap. *)
  Do[remaining = group;
    While[Length[remaining] >= 2,
      count = Min[Length[remaining], 5];
      While[count >= 2 && order Factorial[count] > 120, count--];
      If[count < 2, Break[]];
      AppendTo[groups, Take[remaining, count]]; order *= Factorial[count];
      remaining = Drop[remaining, count]], {group, inferred["Groups"]}];
  plan = completionBosePlan[groups, normalized["ExternalMassRules"]];
  Join[plan, <|"Automatic" -> True, "DetectedGroups" -> inferred["Groups"],
    "ExternalParticles" -> inferred["ExternalParticles"], "Source" -> inferred["Source"],
    "Diagnostics" -> Join[inferred["Diagnostics"], If[groups === inferred["Groups"], {},
      {"An exact subgroup was used to keep permutation work within order 120."}]]|>]
];

completionBosePlan[groups_, externalMassRules_List] := Module[
  {labels, masses, order, perGroup},
  If[!ListQ[groups] || !AllTrue[groups,
      ListQ[#] && Length[#] >= 2 && AllTrue[#, IntegerQ[#] && # > 0 &] &&
        DuplicateFreeQ[#] &] || !DuplicateFreeQ[Flatten[groups]],
    Return[Failure["InvalidBoseSymmetry", <|"Reason" ->
      "Bose symmetry groups must be disjoint lists of at least two distinct positive external labels."|>]]];
  labels = Cases[externalMassRules, HoldPattern[Mass[label_Integer] -> _] :> label];
  If[!SubsetQ[labels, Flatten[groups]],
    Return[Failure["InvalidBoseSymmetry", <|"Reason" ->
      "Every Bose symmetry label must have a declared external mass."|>]]];
  If[AnyTrue[groups, Function[group,
      masses = Mass /@ group /. externalMassRules;
      Length[DeleteDuplicates[masses]] =!= 1]],
    Return[Failure["InvalidBoseSymmetry", <|"Reason" ->
      "The declared external masses must agree within each Bose symmetry group."|>]]];
  order = Times @@ (Factorial[Length[#]] & /@ groups);
  If[order > 120,
    Return[Failure["BoseSymmetryLimit", <|"Reason" ->
      "The requested Bose permutation group exceeds the supported order of 120.",
      "Order" -> order, "MaximumOrder" -> 120|>]]];
  perGroup = Function[group, completionBoseCycles[group, #] & /@ Permutations[group]] /@ groups;
  <|"Groups" -> groups, "Order" -> order,
    "Permutations" -> If[groups === {}, {{}}, Flatten[#, 1] & /@ Tuples[perGroup]]|>
];

(* A fermion transposition contributes -1 in addition to any signs produced
   by ordinary bracket identities. Cycles are relative permutations, so this
   character is independent of label values or the group's written order. *)
completionFermionCharacter[cycles_List] := Times @@ ((-1)^(Length[#] - 1) & /@ cycles);

completionExplicitFermionGroupsQ[groups_List, inferred_Association] := Module[
  {legs = inferred["Legs"], selected, candidates, states},
  AllTrue[groups, Function[group,
    selected = Map[Function[label, SelectFirst[legs,
      Function[leg, leg["Label"] === label], Missing["Leg"]]], group];
    If[!AllTrue[selected, AssociationQ] || !AllTrue[selected, TrueQ[#["Fermion"]] &], False,
      candidates = Fold[Intersection, Lookup[First[selected], "Candidates", {}],
        Lookup[Rest[selected], "Candidates", {}]];
      states = Lookup[selected, "State", Missing["State"]];
      candidates =!= {} && !AnyTrue[states, MissingQ] && Length[DeleteDuplicates[states]] === 1]
  ]]
];

completionExchangePlan[normalized_Association, model_List, boseOption_, fermionOption_,
    particles_: Automatic] := Module[
  {rules = normalized["ExternalMassRules"], boseAutomatic = boseOption === Automatic,
   fermiAutomatic = fermionOption === Automatic, boseInfo, fermiInfo, explicitBose, explicitFermi,
   usedBose, usedFermi, allGroups, fixed, order, remaining, count, perGroup, tuples,
   permutations, signs, diagnostics = {}, names, source, retainAutomatic,
   automaticGroups, reserved, requestedGroups, requestedOrder},
  boseInfo = If[boseAutomatic, completionInferBoseGroups[normalized, model, particles],
    <|"Groups" -> boseOption, "Diagnostics" -> {}, "Source" -> "Explicit", "ExternalParticles" -> {}|>];
  If[FailureQ[boseInfo], Return[boseInfo]];
  fermiInfo = If[fermiAutomatic || fermionOption =!= {},
    completionInferFermionGroups[normalized, model, particles],
    <|"Groups" -> {}, "Diagnostics" -> {}, "Source" -> "Explicit", "ExternalParticles" -> {}, "Legs" -> {}|>];
  If[FailureQ[fermiInfo], Return[fermiInfo]];
  explicitBose = If[boseAutomatic, {}, boseOption];
  explicitFermi = If[fermiAutomatic, {}, fermionOption];
  fixed = completionBosePlan[If[ListQ[explicitBose] && ListQ[explicitFermi],
    Join[explicitBose, explicitFermi], $Failed], rules];
  If[FailureQ[fixed],
    If[explicitFermi === {}, Return[fixed]];
    Return[Failure[If[fixed[[1]] === "BoseSymmetryLimit", "ExchangeSymmetryLimit", "InvalidExchangeSymmetry"],
      Join[fixed[[2]], <|"Reason" -> StringReplace[
        Lookup[fixed[[2]], "Reason", "Invalid exchange groups."], "Bose" -> "Exchange"]|>]]]];
  If[!completionExplicitFermionGroupsQ[explicitFermi, fermiInfo],
    Return[Failure["InvalidFermionSymmetry", <|"Reason" ->
      "Fermion groups must identify compatible odd-spin species, helicities and fixed spin states. Supply ExternalParticles when species are ambiguous."|>]]];
  usedBose = explicitBose; usedFermi = explicitFermi; order = fixed["Order"];
  retainAutomatic[group_List, statistic_, reserve_Integer] := (
    remaining = Complement[group, Flatten[Join[usedBose, usedFermi]]];
    While[Length[remaining] >= 2,
      count = Min[Length[remaining], 5];
      While[count >= 2 && order Factorial[count] 2^reserve > 120, count--];
      If[count < 2, Break[]];
      If[statistic === "Fermion", AppendTo[usedFermi, Take[remaining, count]],
        AppendTo[usedBose, Take[remaining, count]]];
      order *= Factorial[count]; remaining = Drop[remaining, count]]);
  (* Keep room for at least one exchange in every remaining detected group
     whenever that combined minimum fits. A large early group must not consume
     the whole budget and hide an independent boson or fermion symmetry. *)
  automaticGroups = Join[
    If[fermiAutomatic, ({"Fermion", #} & /@ fermiInfo["Groups"]), {}],
    If[boseAutomatic, ({"Boson", #} & /@ boseInfo["Groups"]), {}]];
  automaticGroups = Select[automaticGroups,
    Length[Complement[Last[#], Flatten[Join[usedBose, usedFermi]]]] >= 2 &];
  Do[
    reserved = Min[Length[automaticGroups] - i,
      Max[0, IntegerLength[Quotient[120, order], 2] - 2]];
    retainAutomatic[automaticGroups[[i, 2]], automaticGroups[[i, 1]], reserved],
    {i, Length[automaticGroups]}];
  requestedGroups = Join[If[boseAutomatic, boseInfo["Groups"], explicitBose],
    If[fermiAutomatic, fermiInfo["Groups"], explicitFermi]];
  requestedOrder = Times @@ (Factorial[Length[#]] & /@ requestedGroups);
  allGroups = Join[usedBose, usedFermi];
  perGroup = MapIndexed[Function[{group, position},
    Function[image, With[{cycles = completionBoseCycles[group, image]},
      <|"Cycles" -> cycles, "Sign" -> If[First[position] <= Length[usedBose], 1,
        completionFermionCharacter[cycles]]|>]] /@ Permutations[group]], allGroups];
  tuples = If[allGroups === {}, {{}}, Tuples[perGroup]];
  permutations = (Flatten[Lookup[#, "Cycles", {}], 1] &) /@ tuples;
  signs = (Times @@ Lookup[#, "Sign", {}] &) /@ tuples;
  diagnostics = DeleteDuplicates[Join[boseInfo["Diagnostics"], fermiInfo["Diagnostics"],
    If[boseAutomatic && usedBose =!= boseInfo["Groups"] ||
        fermiAutomatic && usedFermi =!= fermiInfo["Groups"],
      {"An exact exchange subgroup was used to keep combined Bose and fermion permutation work within order 120."}, {}]]];
  names = If[Lookup[fermiInfo, "ExternalParticles", {}] =!= {}, fermiInfo["ExternalParticles"],
    Lookup[boseInfo, "ExternalParticles", {}]];
  source = If[boseAutomatic || fermiAutomatic, If[ListQ[particles] ||
    ListQ[Lookup[normalized, "ExternalParticles", Automatic]], "ExternalParticles", "ModelAndExternalSpinWeights"], "Explicit"];
  <|"Groups" -> allGroups, "BoseGroups" -> usedBose, "FermionGroups" -> usedFermi,
    "DetectedBoseGroups" -> boseInfo["Groups"], "DetectedFermionGroups" -> fermiInfo["Groups"],
    "Order" -> order, "RequestedOrder" -> requestedOrder, "MaximumOrder" -> 120,
    "FullGroupUsed" -> (usedBose === If[boseAutomatic, boseInfo["Groups"], explicitBose] &&
      usedFermi === If[fermiAutomatic, fermiInfo["Groups"], explicitFermi]),
    "Permutations" -> permutations, "Signs" -> signs,
    "Automatic" -> (boseAutomatic || fermiAutomatic), "BoseAutomatic" -> boseAutomatic,
    "FermionAutomatic" -> fermiAutomatic, "ExternalParticles" -> names,
    "Source" -> source, "Diagnostics" -> diagnostics|>
];

completionBoseCycle[expression_, cycle_List] := Module[
  {mapping = AssociationThread[cycle, RotateLeft[cycle]], index, result},
  index[Multiparticle[parts___]] := Multiparticle @@ (index /@ {parts});
  index[label_] := Lookup[mapping, label, label];
  result = PermuteParticles[expression, cycle];
  (* The public permutation already preserves Xi IDs and explicit spin projections. *)
  result = result /. {
    SpinorHat[kind:("Spin"|"Helicity"|"Zeta"), type:("Angle"|"Square"), label_, rest___] :>
      SpinorHat[kind, type, index[label], rest],
    SpinorHat[kind:("Spin"|"Helicity"|"Zeta"), variance_, type:("Angle"|"Square"), label_, rest___] :>
      SpinorHat[kind, variance, type, index[label], rest],
    MomHat[label_] :> MomHat[index[label]], MomQ[label_] :> MomQ[index[label]],
    (head:(MomProdHat1|MomProdHat2|MomProdHat12))[a_, b_] :> head[index[a], index[b]],
    MandelstahmHat[parts___] :> MandelstahmHat @@ (index /@ {parts})};
  result /. {
    ConstructiveDiagrams`VectorSpinIndex[label_, slot_] :>
      ConstructiveDiagrams`VectorSpinIndex[index[label], slot],
    ConstructiveDiagrams`ColorIndex[label_] :> ConstructiveDiagrams`ColorIndex[index[label]]}
];

completionBoseProject[expression_, plan_Association] := Module[{permutations = plan["Permutations"], signs},
  signs = Lookup[plan, "Signs", ConstantArray[1, Length[permutations]]];
  Total[MapThread[#1 Fold[completionBoseCycle, expression, #2] &, {signs, permutations}]]/plan["Order"]
];

completionModelQ[model_] := MatchQ[model, {_List, _List, _List, _List}] &&
  AllTrue[model[[1]], ListQ[#] && Length[#] >= 6 &];

(* Statistics-specific details retain the earlier Bose report shape. The
   combined plan controls the actual projection and its shared work cap. *)
completionExchangeDetails[plan_Association, statistic_String] := Module[
  {fermion = statistic === "Fermion", groups, detected, automatic},
  groups = Lookup[plan, If[fermion, "FermionGroups", "BoseGroups"], {}];
  detected = Lookup[plan, If[fermion, "DetectedFermionGroups", "DetectedBoseGroups"], groups];
  automatic = Lookup[plan, If[fermion, "FermionAutomatic", "BoseAutomatic"], False];
  If[!fermion && !TrueQ[automatic], Return[<|"Groups" -> groups,
    "Order" -> Times @@ (Factorial[Length[#]] & /@ groups)|>]];
  <|"Groups" -> groups, "DetectedGroups" -> detected,
    "Order" -> Times @@ (Factorial[Length[#]] & /@ groups), "Automatic" -> automatic,
    "ExternalParticles" -> Lookup[plan, "ExternalParticles", {}],
    "Source" -> Lookup[plan, "Source", "Explicit"],
    "Diagnostics" -> Lookup[plan, "Diagnostics", {}]|>
];

completionExchangeSpaceName[name_, plan_Association] := If[StringQ[name] &&
    Lookup[plan, "FermionGroups", {}] =!= {},
  StringReplace[name, StartOfString ~~ "Bose" ->
    If[Lookup[plan, "BoseGroups", {}] === {}, "Fermion", "Exchange"]], name];

(* Completion families carry their used groups explicitly. Rebuild only the
   group action, not the physical residue targets or inferred spin states. *)
completionInheritedExchangePlan[normalized_Association, model_List] := Module[
  {saved = Lookup[normalized, "ExchangeSymmetry", <||>], bose, fermion, plan, fermionLabels, signs},
  bose = Lookup[saved, "BoseGroups", Lookup[Lookup[normalized, "BoseSymmetry", <||>], "Groups", {}]];
  fermion = Lookup[saved, "FermionGroups", Lookup[Lookup[normalized, "FermionSymmetry", <||>], "Groups", {}]];
  plan = completionBosePlan[If[ListQ[bose] && ListQ[fermion], Join[bose, fermion], $Failed],
    normalized["ExternalMassRules"]];
  If[FailureQ[plan], Return[plan]];
  (* These groups were validated for the process before factorization. The
     completed expression may be zero, so it need not expose its spin states
     again. Reconstruct the signed action from the retained used groups. *)
  fermionLabels = Flatten[fermion];
  signs = Map[Function[cycles, completionFermionCharacter[
    Select[cycles, MemberQ[fermionLabels, First[#]] &]]], plan["Permutations"]];
  Join[plan, <|"BoseGroups" -> bose, "FermionGroups" -> fermion, "Signs" -> signs|>,
    KeyTake[saved, {"Automatic", "BoseAutomatic", "FermionAutomatic",
      "DetectedBoseGroups", "DetectedFermionGroups", "Source", "Diagnostics", "ExternalParticles",
      "RequestedOrder", "MaximumOrder", "FullGroupUsed"}]]
];

completionExchangeBasis[basis_List, plan_Association, rules_List] := If[
  Lookup[plan, "Order", 1] === 1, DeleteDuplicates[basis],
  DeleteDuplicates[Select[Map[Function[direction,
    canonicalChains[residueCanonicalPropagators[completionBoseProject[direction, plan],
      Cases[rules, HoldPattern[Mass[i_Integer] -> _] :> i]]]], basis],
    !TrueQ[residueExactZero[#]] &]]];

completionParameterRulesQ[rules_] := ListQ[rules] && AllTrue[rules,
  MatchQ[#, _Rule] && (modelParameterKeyQ[First[#]] || StringQ[First[#]]) &&
    residueFiniteQ[Last[#]] && !residueUnmappedQ[Last[#]] &];

(* Lightweight estimates only. No expansion, candidate enumeration, numerical
   sampling, model mutation or kinematic/on-shell assumptions occur here. *)
amplitudeResourceMetrics[input_, channelInput_: {}, process_: Automatic,
    basisDirections_: Automatic] := Module[
  {items, channelRows, expression, externalRules = {}, externalLegs = {},
   n = 0, masses = {}, largest = 1, retained = 0, actualBasis = 0, pairQ, itemExpression,
   compactChannelQ, massByLeg, spinors, spinorData, kindPosition, leg, tail,
   coherentLegs = {}, vectorLegs = {}, coherentComponents, channelExpressions, sourceRecords,
   spinDegree, degrees, coherentDegrees},
  pairQ[value_] := ListQ[value] && Length[value] === 2 && ListQ[First[value]] &&
    AllTrue[First[value], MatchQ[#, _Rule] &];
  itemExpression[value_] := If[ListQ[value] && Length[value] >= 2, Last[value], value];
  compactChannelQ[row_] := Module[{count, cut},
    If[!ListQ[row] || Length[row] < 7 || !MatchQ[row[[-3]], Multiparticle[__Integer]], Return[False]];
    count = Length[row] - 3; cut = List @@ row[[-3]];
    DuplicateFreeQ[cut] && 2 <= Length[cut] <= count - 2 &&
      AllTrue[cut, 1 <= # <= count &]
  ];
  items = Which[
    AssociationQ[input] && ListQ[Lookup[input, "PreparedAmplitudes", None]], input["PreparedAmplitudes"],
    pairQ[input], {input},
    ListQ[input] && AllTrue[input, ListQ], input,
    True, {}];
  expression = Which[
    AssociationQ[input] && KeyExistsQ[input, "Amplitude"], input["Amplitude"],
    AssociationQ[input] && KeyExistsQ[input, "Expression"], input["Expression"],
    items =!= {}, Total[itemExpression /@ items],
    True, input];
  channelRows = Which[
    AssociationQ[channelInput] && ListQ[Lookup[channelInput, "OriginalAmplitudes", None]],
      channelInput["OriginalAmplitudes"],
    AssociationQ[channelInput] && ListQ[Lookup[channelInput, "Targets", None]], channelInput["Targets"],
    ListQ[channelInput], channelInput,
    True, {}];
  externalRules = Which[
    AssociationQ[input] && ListQ[Lookup[input, "ExternalMassRules", None]], input["ExternalMassRules"],
    items =!= {} && pairQ[First[items]], First[First[items]],
    AssociationQ[channelInput] && ListQ[Lookup[channelInput, "ExternalMassRules", None]],
      channelInput["ExternalMassRules"],
    True, {}];
  externalLegs = Sort[DeleteDuplicates[Cases[externalRules,
    HoldPattern[Mass[leg_Integer] -> _] :> leg]]];
  n = Which[
    ListQ[process] && AllTrue[process, StringQ], Length[process],
    externalLegs =!= {}, Length[externalLegs],
    channelRows =!= {} && AssociationQ[First[channelRows]], Length[Lookup[First[channelRows], "ExternalLegs", {}]],
    channelRows =!= {} && compactChannelQ[First[channelRows]],
      Length[First[channelRows]] - 3,
    True, 4];
  masses = If[externalLegs =!= {}, (Mass /@ externalLegs) /. externalRules,
    If[channelRows =!= {} && compactChannelQ[First[channelRows]] && Length[First[channelRows]] === n + 3,
      Take[First[channelRows], n], {}]];
  largest = If[items === {}, LeafCount[expression], Max[1, Max[LeafCount[itemExpression[#]] & /@ items]]];
  If[AssociationQ[input],
    retained = Length[Replace[Lookup[input, "RemainingBasis", {}], Except[_List] -> {}]];
    actualBasis = Length[Replace[Lookup[input, "CorrectionBasis", {}], Except[_List] -> {}]]];
  If[IntegerQ[basisDirections] && basisDirections >= 0, actualBasis = basisDirections];
  (* Count source flags directly. Whole-record deduplication fingerprints
     unrelated derivation histories and can dominate a lightweight estimate.
     An explicit prepared-channel report overrides stale inherited records. *)
  sourceRecords = Join[
    If[AssociationQ[input], Replace[Lookup[input,"RemainderData",{}],Except[_List]->{}],{}],
    If[AssociationQ[channelInput],Replace[Lookup[channelInput,"RemainderData",{}],Except[_List]->{}],
      If[AssociationQ[input],Replace[Lookup[input,"ChannelRemainderData",{}],Except[_List]->{}],{}]]];
  sourceRecords = Count[sourceRecords, record_Association /;
    TrueQ[Lookup[record, "HasInternalConditions", False]]];
  massByLeg = AssociationThread[If[externalLegs =!= {}, externalLegs, Range[Length[masses]]], masses];
  channelExpressions = Map[Function[row, Which[
    AssociationQ[row], Lookup[row, "StateSum", 0], compactChannelQ[row], Last[row], True, 0]], channelRows];
  spinors = DeleteDuplicates[Cases[{expression, channelExpressions},
    value : (Spinor | SpinorHat)["Spin", ___] :> value, Infinity]];
  Do[
    spinorData = List @@ spinor;
    kindPosition = FirstPosition[spinorData, "Angle" | "Square", Missing["NoKind"]];
    If[MissingQ[kindPosition], Continue[]];
    kindPosition = First[kindPosition];
    If[Length[spinorData] < kindPosition + 1, Continue[]];
    leg = spinorData[[kindPosition + 1]]; tail = Drop[spinorData, kindPosition + 1];
    If[!IntegerQ[leg] || !KeyExistsQ[massByLeg, leg] || TrueQ[massByLeg[leg] === 0], Continue[]];
    Which[
      tail === {}, AppendTo[coherentLegs, leg],
      MatchQ[tail, {VectorSpinIndex[_, 1 | 2]}],
        AppendTo[coherentLegs, leg]; AppendTo[vectorLegs, leg],
      True, Null],
    {spinor, spinors}];
  coherentLegs = DeleteDuplicates[coherentLegs]; vectorLegs = DeleteDuplicates[vectorLegs];
  (* Shorthand massive vector endpoints carry two spinors per external leg,
     even when there is no explicit VectorSpinIndex. Count homogeneous degree
     per massive leg without expanding unrelated massless polynomials. *)
  spinDegree[value_, label_] := Which[
    FreeQ[value, s_Spinor /; rspSpinorLeg[s] === label && First[s] === "Spin"], 0,
    Head[value] === Spinor && rspSpinorLeg[value] === label, 1,
    MemberQ[{Times,SpinorChain,SpinorChainReduced,SpinorProduct},Head[value]],
      With[{ranks = spinDegree[#,label] & /@ List @@ value},
        If[AnyTrue[ranks,MissingQ],Missing["UnknownSpinDegree"],Total[ranks]]],
    Head[value] === Plus, With[{ranks = DeleteDuplicates[spinDegree[#,label] & /@ List @@ value]},
      If[Length[ranks] === 1,First[ranks],Missing["InhomogeneousSpinDegree"]]],
    Head[value] === Power && IntegerQ[value[[2]]], value[[2]] spinDegree[value[[1]],label],
    True, Missing["UnknownSpinDegree"]];
  coherentDegrees = Association @ Table[
    degrees = Select[spinDegree[#,label] & /@ Prepend[channelExpressions,expression],
      IntegerQ[#] && # > 0 &];
    label -> If[degrees === {},If[MemberQ[vectorLegs,label],2,1],Max[degrees]],
    {label,coherentLegs}];
  coherentComponents = Times @@ (1 + Values[coherentDegrees]);
  <|"ExternalParticles" -> Max[4, n], "Items" -> Max[1, Length[items]],
    "Channels" -> Length[channelRows], "ExpressionLeaves" -> LeafCount[expression],
    "LargestItemLeaves" -> largest, "RetainedDirections" -> retained,
    "RetainedSourceRecords" -> sourceRecords,
    "BasisDirections" -> actualBasis,
    (* A conservative tensor-row estimate, not a generic-rank claim. Fresh
       independent validation and adaptive sample feedback remain mandatory. *)
    "CoherentComponents" -> coherentComponents, "CoherentSpinLegs" -> coherentLegs,
    "CoherentSpinDegrees" -> coherentDegrees|>
];

(* Before any diagram exists, the model already supplies the external massive
   spin multiplicities. Fixed-helicity massless states contribute one row. *)
amplitudeConstructionResourceMetrics[process_List, model_List] := Module[
  {metrics = amplitudeResourceMetrics[{}, {}, process], specifications = {},
   rows, states, valid = True, massiveLegs, degrees},
  If[!completionModelQ[model] || !AllTrue[process, StringQ], Return[metrics]];
  Do[
    rows = Select[model[[1]], ListQ[#] && Length[#] >= 6 &&
      MemberQ[#[[{2, 3}]], particle] &];
    states = DeleteDuplicates[#[[{5, 6}]] & /@ rows];
    If[Length[states] =!= 1 || !IntegerQ[states[[1, 1]]] || states[[1, 1]] < 0,
      valid = False; Break[]];
    AppendTo[specifications, First[states]], {particle, process}];
  If[!valid, Return[metrics]];
  massiveLegs = Select[Range[Length[process]], specifications[[#, 1]] > 0 &&
      specifications[[#, 2]] =!= 0 &];
  degrees = AssociationThread[massiveLegs, specifications[[massiveLegs, 1]]];
  Join[metrics, <|"CoherentComponents" -> Times @@ (1 + Values[degrees]),
    "CoherentSpinLegs" -> massiveLegs, "CoherentSpinDegrees" -> degrees,
    "ResourceSpinSource" -> "ModelMassiveExternalStates"|>]
];

(* Measure only expression slots read by the retained-source generators.
   Channel preparation is authoritative over stale input channel provenance.
   Do not hash, expand or traverse unrelated derivation histories. *)
completionHERetainedSourceMetrics[input_,channels_] := Module[
  {diagramRecords,channelRecords,slotLeaves=<||>,slotCounts=<||>,recordSlots,add,continuations},
  diagramRecords=If[AssociationQ[input],Replace[Lookup[input,"RemainderData",{}],Except[_List]->{}],{}];
  channelRecords=If[AssociationQ[channels],Replace[Lookup[channels,"RemainderData",{}],Except[_List]->{}],
    If[AssociationQ[input],Replace[Lookup[input,"ChannelRemainderData",{}],Except[_List]->{}],{}]];
  add[key_,value_] := If[!MissingQ[value],
    AssociateTo[slotLeaves,key->(Lookup[slotLeaves,key,0]+LeafCount[value])];
    AssociateTo[slotCounts,key->(Lookup[slotCounts,key,0]+1)]];
  recordSlots[record_,diagram_] := Module[{internal},
    If[!AssociationQ[record],Return[]];
    internal=TrueQ[Lookup[record,"HasInternalConditions",False]] &&
      !MissingQ[Lookup[record,"ShellRemainder",Missing["NoShellDifference"]]];
    If[internal,Do[add[key,Lookup[record,key,Missing["NoSourceSlot"]]],
      {key,{"ShellRemainder","FixedReferenceExpression","ReferenceInputExpression"}}]];
    (* The common-reference proposal reads one Xi continuation per diagram;
       channel alternatives are read only when no original reference input
       overrides them, matching completionHESourceRemainders. *)
    If[TrueQ[diagram] || internal && MissingQ[Lookup[record,"ReferenceInputExpression",Missing[]]] &&
        !MissingQ[Lookup[record,"FixedReferenceExpression",Missing[]]],
      continuations=Select[Replace[Lookup[record,"ReferenceContinuations",{}],Except[_List]->{}],
        AssociationQ[#] && Lookup[#,"Mode",None]==="Xi" && KeyExistsQ[#,"Expression"]&];
      If[TrueQ[diagram],continuations=Take[continuations,UpTo[1]]];
      Do[add["XiReferenceContinuation",continuation["Expression"]],{continuation,continuations}]]];
  Scan[recordSlots[#,True]&,diagramRecords];Scan[recordSlots[#,False]&,channelRecords];
  <|"RetainedSourceExpressionLeaves"->Total[Values[slotLeaves]],
    "RetainedSourceExpressionSlots"->Total[Values[slotCounts]],
    "RetainedSourceSlotLeaves"->slotLeaves,"RetainedSourceSlotCounts"->slotCounts,
    "RetainedSourceMetricScope"->"ConsumedShellAndReferenceSlotsWithoutDerivationHistory"|>
];

(* High-energy work operates on the retained affine family, not only its
   displayed fixed representative. Measure that supplied family, directions
   and available generated-source inputs before resolving the stage clock. *)
completionHighEnergyResourceMetrics[input_, channels_: {}, correctionBasis_: Automatic] := Module[
  {center = amplitudeResourceMetrics[input, channels], metrics, view = input,
   family = Missing["NoRetainedFamily"], remaining = {}, explicit = {},
   familyLeaves = 0, directionLeaves, explicitLeaves, largest, freeCount = 0,
   sourceMetrics,sourceWeight},
  If[AssociationQ[input],
    If[KeyExistsQ[input, "FamilyAmplitude"] && !MissingQ[input["FamilyAmplitude"]],
      family = input["FamilyAmplitude"]; familyLeaves = LeafCount[family];
      view = Join[input, <|"Amplitude" -> family|>]];
    remaining = Replace[Lookup[input, "RemainingBasis", {}], Except[_List] -> {}];
    freeCount = Length[Replace[Lookup[input, "FreeParameters", {}], Except[_List] -> {}]]];
  If[ListQ[correctionBasis], explicit = correctionBasis];
  metrics = If[MissingQ[family], center, amplitudeResourceMetrics[view, channels]];
  directionLeaves = Total[LeafCount /@ remaining];
  explicitLeaves = Total[LeafCount /@ explicit];
  sourceMetrics=If[correctionBasis===Automatic,completionHERetainedSourceMetrics[input,channels],
    <|"RetainedSourceExpressionLeaves"->0,"RetainedSourceExpressionSlots"->0,
      "RetainedSourceSlotLeaves"-><||>,"RetainedSourceSlotCounts"-><||>,
      "RetainedSourceMetricScope"->"ExplicitCorrectionBasisDisablesAutomaticSourceGeneration"|>];
  sourceWeight=Max[1,Ceiling[Lookup[metrics,"CoherentComponents",1]/4]];
  largest = Max[1, center["LargestItemLeaves"], metrics["LargestItemLeaves"], familyLeaves,
    Sequence @@ (LeafCount /@ remaining), Sequence @@ (LeafCount /@ explicit)];
  Join[metrics, <|"ExpressionLeaves" -> Max[center["ExpressionLeaves"], metrics["ExpressionLeaves"]],
    "LargestItemLeaves" -> largest,
    "RetainedDirections" -> Max[center["RetainedDirections"], Length[remaining], freeCount],
    "BasisDirections" -> If[ListQ[correctionBasis], Length[explicit], metrics["BasisDirections"]],
    "FixedCenterExpressionLeaves" -> center["ExpressionLeaves"],
    "RetainedFamilyExpressionLeaves" -> familyLeaves,
    "RetainedDirectionLeaves" -> directionLeaves,
    "ExplicitCorrectionBasisLeaves" -> explicitLeaves,
    "RetainedSourceCoherentWeight"->sourceWeight,
    "RetainedSourceWorkLeaves"->sourceWeight sourceMetrics["RetainedSourceExpressionLeaves"],
    "ResourceExpressionSource" -> If[MissingQ[family], "InputExpression", "RetainedAffineFamily"]|>,sourceMetrics]
];

(* Resolve the factorization clock from available source expression slots
   before catalog construction or fitting. A short displayed center can seed
   hundreds of coupled columns. The multiplier follows actual massive spin
   components and the unchanged model-consistent parameter assignments. *)
completionFactorizationResourceMetrics[input_,channelInput_,model_,requested_Association, forceSourceAdmission_:False] := Module[
  {basis=Lookup[requested,"CorrectionBasis",Automatic],metrics,degrees,eligible,
   rawRows,preparedRows,expressionLeaves,channelLeaves,preparedLeaves,sourceMetrics,
   sourceLeaves=0,sourceSlots=0,basisLeaves=0,sets={},assignmentCount=1,
   coherentWeight=1,assignmentWeight=1,weighted=0,sourceScope},
  metrics=amplitudeResourceMetrics[input,channelInput,
    Lookup[requested,"ExternalParticles",Automatic],If[ListQ[basis],Length[basis],Automatic]];
  degrees=Values[Lookup[metrics,"CoherentSpinDegrees",<||>]];
  (* Higher-point tensors with two massive spin-one legs already require
     nine coherent components. Include their consumed continuation sources
     while retaining the established four-point and spin-half policies. *)
  eligible=TrueQ[forceSourceAdmission] || AnyTrue[degrees,#>=2&] &&
    (Lookup[metrics,"CoherentComponents",1]>=27 ||
      Lookup[metrics,"ExternalParticles",4]>=5 && Lookup[metrics,"CoherentComponents",1]>=9);
  If[!eligible,Return[Join[metrics,<|"FactorizationSourceWorkAdmitted"->False,
    "FactorizationSourceWorkLeaves"->0,
    "FactorizationSourceMetricScope"->"EstablishedSmallOrDegreeOneOnlyTensorPolicy"|>]]];
  rawRows=Which[AssociationQ[channelInput],Replace[Lookup[channelInput,"OriginalAmplitudes",{}],Except[_List]->{}],
    ListQ[channelInput],channelInput,True,{}];
  preparedRows=If[AssociationQ[channelInput],Replace[Lookup[channelInput,"PreparedAmplitudes",{}],Except[_List]->{}],{}];
  expressionLeaves[rows_List]:=Total[Map[Function[row,Which[
    AssociationQ[row] && KeyExistsQ[row,"StateSum"],LeafCount[row["StateSum"]],
    ListQ[row] && Length[row]>=2 && Last[row]=!=0,LeafCount[Last[row]],True,0]],rows]];
  channelLeaves=expressionLeaves[rawRows];preparedLeaves=0;
  If[basis===Automatic,
    preparedLeaves=expressionLeaves[preparedRows];
    sourceMetrics=completionHERetainedSourceMetrics[input,channelInput];
    sourceLeaves=sourceMetrics["RetainedSourceExpressionLeaves"];
    sourceSlots=sourceMetrics["RetainedSourceExpressionSlots"];
    sourceScope="OriginalTargetsPreparedChannelsAndRetainedShellReferenceSlots",
    If[ListQ[basis],basisLeaves=Total[LeafCount/@basis]];
    sourceScope="OriginalTargetsAndExplicitCorrectionBasisWithoutAutomaticSourceSlots"];
  If[completionModelQ[model],
    sets=TimeConstrained[Quiet[Check[completionValidationRuleSets[model,
      Lookup[requested,"ParameterRules",Automatic],
      Lookup[requested,"ValidationParameterRules",Automatic]],{}]],1,{}];
    If[ListQ[sets] && sets=!={},assignmentCount=Length[sets]]];
  coherentWeight=Max[1,Ceiling[Lookup[metrics,"CoherentComponents",1]/4]];
  (* The established spin-half/QED workload has four coherent components
     and two automatic mass assignments. Do not reduce the old allowance
     when the user intentionally restricts parameter validation. *)
  assignmentWeight=Max[1,assignmentCount/2];
  weighted=Ceiling[coherentWeight assignmentWeight
    (channelLeaves+preparedLeaves+sourceLeaves+basisLeaves)];
  Join[metrics,<|"FactorizationSourceWorkAdmitted"->True,
    "FactorizationOriginalChannelLeaves"->channelLeaves,
    "FactorizationPreparedChannelLeaves"->preparedLeaves,
    "FactorizationRetainedSourceLeaves"->sourceLeaves,
    "FactorizationRetainedSourceSlots"->sourceSlots,
    "FactorizationExplicitBasisLeaves"->basisLeaves,
    "FactorizationParameterAssignmentCount"->assignmentCount,
    "FactorizationSourceCoherentWeight"->coherentWeight,
    "FactorizationSourceAssignmentWeight"->assignmentWeight,
    "FactorizationSourceWorkLeaves"->weighted,
    "FactorizationSourceMetricScope"->sourceScope,
    "FactorizationResourceResolutionPhase"->"BeforeCatalogConstructionAndCoreDeadline"|>]
];


(* This diagnostic is consulted only after an unresolved retained-remainder
   fit actually times out. Its one renewed allowance uses the same measured
   source heuristic; it does not change successful small-job defaults. *)
completionFactorizationTimeoutRecovery[input_,channels_,model_,requested_Association,report_] := Module[
  {metrics,resolution,allowance,sourceLeaves,displayLeaves},
  If[Lookup[requested,"TimeConstraint",Automatic]=!=Automatic,
    Return[<|"Eligible"->False,"Reason"->"ExplicitTimeConstraint"|>]];
  If[!AssociationQ[report] || Lookup[report,"Status",None]=!="UNRESOLVED" ||
      Lookup[report,"PreparationRemainderFit",None]=!=Missing["RemainderFitTimeout"],
    Return[<|"Eligible"->False,"Reason"->"NoUnresolvedRetainedFitTimeout"|>]];
  If[Lookup[requested,"CorrectionBasis",Automatic]=!=Automatic,
    Return[<|"Eligible"->False,"Reason"->"ExplicitCorrectionBasis"|>]];
  metrics=completionFactorizationResourceMetrics[input,channels,model,requested,True];
  sourceLeaves=Lookup[metrics,"FactorizationRetainedSourceLeaves",0];
  displayLeaves=Lookup[metrics,"ExpressionLeaves",0];
  If[Lookup[metrics,"ExternalParticles",4]<5 || sourceLeaves<=displayLeaves ||
      Lookup[metrics,"FactorizationRetainedSourceSlots",0]<1,
    Return[<|"Eligible"->False,"Reason"->"NoLargerRetainedHigherPointSourceWork",
      "Metrics"->metrics|>]];
  resolution=amplitudeAutomaticSettings["Factorization",requested,metrics];
  allowance=Lookup[resolution["Settings"],"TimeConstraint",None];
  If[!NumericQ[allowance] || !TrueQ[0<allowance<Infinity],
    Return[<|"Eligible"->False,"Reason"->"NoFiniteSourceAllowance"|>]];
  <|"Eligible"->True,"Reason"->"RetainedRemainderFitTimeout",
    "FailureEvidence"->Missing["RemainderFitTimeout"],
    "TimeConstraint"->allowance,"ResourcePolicy"->resolution["ResourcePolicy"],
    "Scope"->"OneFailureOnlyRenewedAllowanceWithOriginalTargetsAndValidation"|>
];

amplitudeAutomaticFitSamples[metrics_Association] := Max[4,
  Ceiling[6 Max[0, Lookup[metrics, "BasisDirections", 0], Lookup[metrics, "RetainedDirections", 0]]/
    (5 Max[1, Lookup[metrics, "Channels", 0]] Max[1, Lookup[metrics, "CoherentComponents", 1]])]];

amplitudeAutomaticTermCap[metrics_Association] := Module[
  {n = Lookup[metrics, "ExternalParticles", 4], count, initial, ceiling},
  initial = If[n < 6, 128, 256]; ceiling = If[n < 6, 1024, 2048];
  count = Max[initial, Lookup[metrics, "BasisDirections", 0], Lookup[metrics, "RetainedDirections", 0]];
  Min[ceiling, 2^Ceiling[Log[2, Max[1, count]]]]
];

(* Return Settings ready for existing numeric validation. Unspecified unrelated
   settings and explicit values remain byte-for-byte/symbolically unchanged. *)
amplitudeAutomaticSettings[stage_String, requested_Association, metrics_Association] := Module[
  {n = Lookup[metrics, "ExternalParticles", 4], leaves, itemLeaves, channels, retained,
   base, work, time, defaults, autoKeys, resolved, requestedResources, resourceKeys,
   cap, ceiling, basisCount, sourceRecords, tensorWork, postFitReserve},
  leaves = Max[1, Lookup[metrics, "ExpressionLeaves", 1]];
  If[stage === "HighEnergy", leaves = Max[leaves,
      Lookup[metrics, "RetainedDirectionLeaves", 0],
      Lookup[metrics, "RetainedSourceWorkLeaves", 0]] +
    Lookup[metrics, "ExplicitCorrectionBasisLeaves", 0]];
  If[stage==="Factorization",leaves=Max[leaves,Lookup[metrics,"FactorizationSourceWorkLeaves",0]]];
  itemLeaves = Max[1, Lookup[metrics, "LargestItemLeaves", leaves]];
  channels = Max[0, Lookup[metrics, "Channels", 0]];
  retained = Max[0, Lookup[metrics, "RetainedDirections", 0]];
  basisCount = Max[0, Lookup[metrics, "BasisDirections", 0]];
  sourceRecords = Max[0, Lookup[metrics, "RetainedSourceRecords", 0]];
  tensorWork = Min[600, 5 Max[0, Ceiling[Lookup[metrics,"CoherentComponents",1]/4]-1]];
  base = Which[n <= 4, 60, n === 5, 180, True, 600 + 300 (n - 6)];
  work = Min[600, 10 Ceiling[leaves/5000] + 2 channels + 5 Ceiling[retained/32] + tensorWork];
  time = Switch[stage,
    "Construction", Which[n <= 4, 600, n === 5, 1800, True, 7200 + 1800 (n - 6)] + 3 work,
    "Preparation", Min[180, 20 + 10 Max[0, n - 4] + 10 Ceiling[itemLeaves/2500]],
    "Factorization", base + work,
    "HighEnergy", base + work + Min[600, 2 retained + 8 sourceRecords],
    "Checks", Min[900, Max[60, base/2] + work],
    _, base + work];
  (* Chart fitting is not the end of a complete higher-spin calculation.
     Reserve bounded time for exact affine classification and the unchanged
     independent checks before declaring either stage or overall deadlines. *)
  postFitReserve=If[MemberQ[{"Construction","HighEnergy"},stage] &&
      Lookup[metrics,"CoherentComponents",1]>=27 &&
      AnyTrue[Values[Lookup[metrics,"CoherentSpinDegrees",<||>]],TrueQ[#>=2]&],
    Min[900,Max[60,base/2]+tensorWork],0];
  (* The wrapper must also close with its own independent final check after
     the HE child returns. Reserve both phases in the overall clock. *)
  postFitReserve=If[stage==="Construction",2 postFitReserve,postFitReserve];
  time=time+postFitReserve;
  cap = amplitudeAutomaticTermCap[metrics]; ceiling = If[n < 6, 1024, 2048];
  defaults = <|"TimeConstraint" -> time, "MaxCorrectionTerms" -> cap,
    "MaxSteps" -> 0, "Samples" -> amplitudeAutomaticFitSamples[metrics],
    "ValidationSamples" -> 4,
    "MaxRefinements" -> 3 + Min[3, Floor[basisCount/256]],
    "MaxCandidates" -> 64, "MaxReferenceChoices" -> 64|>;
  resourceKeys = Keys[defaults];
  requestedResources = KeyTake[requested, resourceKeys];
  autoKeys = Select[Keys[requestedResources], requestedResources[#] === Automatic &];
  resolved = Join[requested, KeyTake[defaults, autoKeys]];
  <|"Settings" -> resolved,
    "ResourcePolicy" -> <|"Stage" -> stage, "Metrics" -> metrics,
      "Requested" -> requestedResources, "Resolved" -> KeyTake[resolved, resourceKeys],
      "AutomaticOptions" -> autoKeys, "CorrectionTermCeiling" -> ceiling,
      "BasisExceedsAutomaticCeiling" -> (basisCount > ceiling || retained > ceiling),
      "ValidationSamplesReduced" -> False,
      "PostFitReserveEstimate"->postFitReserve,
      "PostFitReserve"->If[MemberQ[autoKeys,"TimeConstraint"],postFitReserve,0],
      "ReserveResolutionPhase"->"BeforeStageAndOverallDeadlines",
      "Scope" -> "LightweightFiniteResourceHeuristicWithUnchangedExplicitOverrides"|>|>
];


(* Resource-only retries use the same original amplitudes and channel targets.
   An explicitly supplied numeric cap or clock is never increased. *)
amplitudeAutomaticFactorization[input_, channelInput_, model_, supplied_List] := Block[{$completionAutomaticCorrectionTermCeiling = None,
  $completionOrdinarySourceClosure = False}, Module[
  {requested = Join[Association[Options[CompleteFactorization]], Association[Reverse[supplied]]],
   resolution, metrics, settings, originalOutput, details, automaticKeys, resolvedSupplied,
   started = AbsoluteTime[],
   budget, remaining, cap, ceiling, report, attempts = {}, needed, diagnostics, retry, next,
   automaticSamples, numericOptions, core, measured, automaticPole, initialPole, poleMode,
   recordedChoices, poleFallbackPending, attemptCap, effectiveCap, bestReport = Missing["NotValidated"],
   bestRank = {Infinity, Infinity}, candidateRank, physicalOnly, normalizedCandidate, rows, requestedPole, annotateOutcome,
   timeoutRecovery = Missing["NotNeeded"], timeoutRecoveryUsed = False, recoveryDecision, recoveryElapsed},
  requested["RandomSeed"] = amplitudeResolveRandomSeed[requested["RandomSeed"]];
  resolvedSupplied = Normal[requested];
  originalOutput = Lookup[requested, "Output", "Amplitude"];
  details = Lookup[requested, "ReturnDetails", False];
  If[Complement[First /@ supplied, First /@ Options[CompleteFactorization]] =!= {} ||
      !MemberQ[{True, False}, details] || !MemberQ[{"Amplitude", "Expression", "Details"}, originalOutput],
    Return[completionFactorizationCore[input, channelInput, model, Sequence @@ resolvedSupplied]]];
  metrics = completionFactorizationResourceMetrics[input,channelInput,model,requested];
  resolution = amplitudeAutomaticSettings["Factorization", requested, metrics];
  settings = resolution["Settings"]; automaticKeys = resolution["ResourcePolicy"]["AutomaticOptions"];
  budget = settings["TimeConstraint"]; cap = settings["MaxCorrectionTerms"];
  ceiling = resolution["ResourcePolicy"]["CorrectionTermCeiling"];
  If[!constructSecondsQ[budget] || !IntegerQ[cap] || cap < 1,
    Return[completionFactorizationCore[input, channelInput, model, Sequence @@ Normal[settings]]]];
  automaticSamples = MemberQ[automaticKeys, "Samples"];
  recordedChoices = Flatten[Function[record, If[AssociationQ[record],
    {Lookup[record, "PolePreference", Automatic],
      Lookup[Lookup[record, "Options", <||>], "PolePreference", Automatic]}, {}]] /@
      {input, channelInput}, 1];
  automaticPole = requested["PolePreference"] === Automatic &&
    requested["CorrectionBasis"] === Automatic && requested["ChannelReferences"] === Automatic &&
    !AnyTrue[recordedChoices, MemberQ[{None, "AllPhysical", "AllSpurious", "Mixed", "Xi",
      "Cyclic", "ReverseCyclic", "IndependentXi"}, #] &];
  initialPole = If[automaticPole, "AllPhysical", requested["PolePreference"]];
  poleMode = initialPole; poleFallbackPending = automaticPole;
  rows = If[AssociationQ[channelInput], channelInput["OriginalAmplitudes"], channelInput];
  requestedPole = completionPolePreference[initialPole, input, channelInput];
  (* Correctness and the requested denominator representation are independent.
     A validated fallback must not silently claim that AllPhysical was achieved. *)
  annotateOutcome[value_] := If[!AssociationQ[value] || !KeyExistsQ[value, "Status"], value,
    Module[{achieved = Lookup[value, "AchievedPhysicalDenominators", Missing["NoCompleteAmplitude"]],
       classified, classificationSeconds, reason = None, result},
      If[value["Status"] === "COMPLETE" && !MemberQ[{True, False}, achieved],
        classificationSeconds = If[budget === Infinity, 2,
          Max[0, Min[2, budget - (AbsoluteTime[] - started)]]];
        achieved = If[classificationSeconds <= 0, Missing["RepresentationClassificationTimeout"],
          TimeConstrained[
            classified = completionNormalizeInput[
              {value["ExternalMassRules"], value["Amplitude"]}, rows, model];
            If[AssociationQ[classified],
              completionPhysicalDenominatorOnlyQ[value["Amplitude"], classified],
              Missing["RepresentationNotEstablished"]], classificationSeconds,
            Missing["RepresentationClassificationTimeout"]]]];
      If[value["Status"] === "COMPLETE" && requestedPole === "AllPhysical" && achieved === False,
        reason = "The validated result still displays denominator factors outside the physical-propagator inventory. A physical-only representation was not established within this completion attempt."];
      result = Join[value, <|"RequestedPolePreference" -> requestedPole,
        "AchievedPhysicalDenominators" -> achieved, "PreferenceFallbackReason" -> reason|>];
      If[StringQ[reason], completionProgress[settings["ProgressFunction"], settings["ProgressReporting"],
        <|"Stage" -> "Factorization representation", "Status" -> "COMPLETE",
          "Operation" -> "Physical-only form not established; retaining the validated result",
          "RequestedPolePreference" -> requestedPole, "AchievedPhysicalDenominators" -> False,
          "PreferenceFallbackReason" -> reason|>]];
      result]];
  If[automaticKeys === {} && !automaticPole,
    Return[annotateOutcome[Block[{$completionAutomaticFitSamples = False},
      completionFactorizationCore[input, channelInput, model, Sequence @@ resolvedSupplied]]]]];
  remaining[] := If[budget === Infinity, Infinity, Max[0, budget - (AbsoluteTime[] - started)]];
  While[True,
    numericOptions = Join[settings, <|"MaxCorrectionTerms" -> cap, "PolePreference" -> poleMode,
      "TimeConstraint" -> Max[0.000001, If[poleFallbackPending,
        Min[remaining[], Max[30, budget/2]], remaining[]]], "ReturnDetails" -> True|>];
    attemptCap = cap;
    report = Block[{$completionAutomaticFitSamples = automaticSamples,
      $completionAutomaticPoleSearch = automaticPole,
      $completionOrdinarySourceClosure = TrueQ[timeoutRecoveryUsed],
      $completionAutomaticCorrectionTermCeiling = If[MemberQ[automaticKeys, "MaxCorrectionTerms"], ceiling, None]},
      completionFactorizationCore[input, channelInput, model, Sequence @@ Normal[numericOptions]]];
    If[!AssociationQ[report], If[AssociationQ[bestReport], Break[], Return[report]]];
    effectiveCap = Lookup[report, "EffectiveMaxCorrectionTerms", cap];
    If[MemberQ[automaticKeys, "MaxCorrectionTerms"] && IntegerQ[effectiveCap] &&
        cap < effectiveCap <= ceiling, cap = effectiveCap];
    (* Once a complete union has been projected and pruned within its cap,
       raw atomization is not an unmet resource demand. A nonclosing fit in
       that adequate space must not trigger an identical larger-cap rebuild. *)
    measured = Max[Prepend[Select[Flatten[Cases[report, data_Association :>
      Values[KeyTake[data, If[Lookup[data, "Status", None] === "AVAILABLE" &&
          TrueQ[Lookup[data, "WithinLimit", False]] &&
          MemberQ[{"PreparedAndReducedPhysicalUnion", "ReducedPhysicalSourceAtoms", "GroupedSelectedPhysicalSources", "StructuredPreparedPhysicalBlocks"},
            Lookup[data, "CandidateMode", None]],
        {"Terms", "ProjectedDirectionCount"},
        {"Terms", "ProjectedDirectionCount", "RawDirectionCount", "OversizedUnionDirections"}]]],
      {0, Infinity}]], IntegerQ[#] && # > 0 &], 0]];
    AppendTo[attempts, <|"Attempt" -> Length[attempts] + 1,
      "MaxCorrectionTerms" -> attemptCap, "EffectiveMaxCorrectionTerms" -> cap,
      "CapChanges" -> Lookup[report, "CapChanges", {}], "PolePreference" -> poleMode,
      "Status" -> Lookup[report, "Status", "UNRESOLVED"],
      "ElapsedTime" -> Lookup[report, "ElapsedTime", Missing["NotRecorded"]],
      "ObservedDirections" -> measured, "CorrectionSpace" -> Lookup[report, "CorrectionSpace", None]|>];
    physicalOnly = False;
    If[report["Status"] === "COMPLETE",
      normalizedCandidate = completionNormalizeInput[
        {report["ExternalMassRules"], report["Amplitude"]}, rows, model];
      physicalOnly = AssociationQ[normalizedCandidate] &&
        completionPhysicalDenominatorOnlyQ[report["Amplitude"], normalizedCandidate];
      report = Join[report, <|"AchievedPhysicalDenominators" -> If[
        AssociationQ[normalizedCandidate], physicalOnly, Missing["RepresentationNotEstablished"]]|>];
      candidateRank = {If[initialPole === "AllPhysical" && !physicalOnly, 1, 0], LeafCount[report["Amplitude"]]};
      If[OrderedQ[{candidateRank, bestRank}], bestReport = report; bestRank = candidateRank];
      If[poleMode =!= "AllPhysical" || physicalOnly, Break[]]];
    diagnostics = StringRiffle[Cases[Lookup[report, "Diagnostics", {}], _String, Infinity], " "];
    retry = !timeoutRecoveryUsed && MemberQ[automaticKeys, "MaxCorrectionTerms"] && cap < ceiling && Length[attempts] < 4 &&
      remaining[] > 1 && (measured > cap || StringContainsQ[diagnostics,
        {"exceeds MaxCorrectionTerms", "exceeds its", "correction space exceeds", "correction-term cap"}]);
    If[TrueQ[retry],
      needed = Max[cap + 1, measured]; next = Min[ceiling, Max[2 cap, 2^Ceiling[Log[2, needed]]]];
      If[next <= cap, Break[]]; cap = next;
      completionProgress[settings["ProgressFunction"], settings["ProgressReporting"],
        <|"Stage" -> "Expanding automatic correction space", "Terms" -> cap,
          "Elapsed" -> AbsoluteTime[] - started|>]; Continue[]];
    If[!timeoutRecoveryUsed && poleFallbackPending && remaining[] > 1,
      poleMode = Automatic; poleFallbackPending = False;
      completionProgress[settings["ProgressFunction"], settings["ProgressReporting"],
        <|"Stage" -> "Trying alternative automatic pole continuations", "Elapsed" -> AbsoluteTime[] - started|>];
      Continue[]];
    If[!timeoutRecoveryUsed && !AssociationQ[bestReport],
      recoveryDecision=completionFactorizationTimeoutRecovery[input,channelInput,model,requested,report];
      If[TrueQ[Lookup[recoveryDecision,"Eligible",False]],
        timeoutRecoveryUsed=True;recoveryElapsed=AbsoluteTime[]-started;
        timeoutRecovery=Join[recoveryDecision,<|"InitialFailedReport"->report,
          "InitialResourcePolicy"->resolution["ResourcePolicy"],
          "InitialTimeConstraint"->budget,"InitialElapsedTime"->recoveryElapsed,
          "RetryTimeConstraint"->recoveryDecision["TimeConstraint"],
          "MaximumCombinedTimeConstraint"->Max[budget,recoveryElapsed]+recoveryDecision["TimeConstraint"],
          "EffectiveMaxCorrectionTerms"->cap,"PriorAdaptiveAttempts"->attempts|>];
        budget=recoveryElapsed+recoveryDecision["TimeConstraint"];poleFallbackPending=False;
        completionProgress[settings["ProgressFunction"],settings["ProgressReporting"],
          <|"Stage"->"Retrying timed-out retained-source factorization",
            "TimeConstraint"->recoveryDecision["TimeConstraint"],"Terms"->cap,
            "Elapsed"->recoveryElapsed|>];
        Continue[]]];
    Break[]
  ];
  If[AssociationQ[bestReport] && (report["Status"] =!= "COMPLETE" ||
      OrderedQ[{bestRank, candidateRank}]), report = bestReport];
  report = Join[report, <|"ResourcePolicy" -> Join[resolution["ResourcePolicy"],
      <|"Resolved" -> Join[resolution["ResourcePolicy"]["Resolved"],
        <|"TimeConstraint" -> budget,"MaxCorrectionTerms" -> cap,
          "Samples" -> Lookup[report, "FitSamples", settings["Samples"]],
          "PolePreference" -> Lookup[report, "PolePreference", poleMode]|>],
      "AutomaticPoleSearch" -> automaticPole|>], "AdaptiveAttempts" -> attempts,
    "EffectiveMaxCorrectionTerms" -> cap,
    "CapChanges" -> Flatten[Lookup[attempts, "CapChanges", {}], 1],
    "ElapsedTime" -> AbsoluteTime[] - started|>];
  If[TrueQ[timeoutRecoveryUsed],
    report=Join[report,<|"AutomaticTimeoutRecovery"->timeoutRecovery|>]];
  report = annotateOutcome[report];
  completionFormat[report, If[TrueQ[details], "Details", originalOutput], False]
]];

(* Carry automatic fitting provenance explicitly into internal retries. A
   separate public call with numeric samples always retains its own setting. *)
completionChildResourceOptions[settings_Association] := If[TrueQ[$completionAutomaticFitSamples],
  Join[settings, <|"Samples" -> Automatic|>], settings];


completionInputExpression[input_] := Which[
  AssociationQ[input] && KeyExistsQ[input, "Amplitude"], input["Amplitude"],
  AssociationQ[input] && KeyExistsQ[input, "PreparedAmplitudes"],
    Total[Last /@ input["PreparedAmplitudes"]],
  MatchQ[input, {_List, _}] && AllTrue[First[input], MatchQ[#, _Rule] &], Last[input],
  ListQ[input] && AllTrue[input, MatchQ[#, {_List, _}] &], Total[Last /@ input],
  True, input];

completionNormalizeInput[input_, channels_List, model_List] := Module[
  {value = input, normalized, extra = <||>},
  If[!completionModelQ[model], Return[Failure["InvalidModel", <||>]]];
  If[AssociationQ[value],
    extra = KeyTake[value, {"OriginalExpression", "FamilyAmplitude", "RemainingBasis",
      "FreeParameters", "CorrectionBasis", "ConstraintData", "DiagramReports",
      "ItemReports", "RemainderData", "ChannelRemainderData", "ExternalParticles", "BoseSymmetry", "FermionSymmetry", "ExchangeSymmetry", "PolePreference"}];
    value = Which[KeyExistsQ[value, "PreparedAmplitudes"], value["PreparedAmplitudes"],
      KeyExistsQ[value, "Amplitude"], value["Amplitude"],
      True, Return[Failure["InvalidCompletionInput", <||>]]];
    If[KeyExistsQ[input, "ExternalMassRules"] && !ListQ[value],
      value = {input["ExternalMassRules"], value}]];
  normalized = residueSimpleInputs[value, channels, model];
  If[!AssociationQ[normalized] || FailureQ[normalized], Return[normalized]];
  Join[normalized, <|"OriginalExpression" -> normalized["Expression"],
    "ExternalMassRules" -> Lookup[
      poleDiscoveryMetadata[normalized["Targets"], normalized["Records"]],
      "ExternalMassRules", {}]|>, extra]
];

completionProgress[callback_, enabled_, event_Association] := Module[{text},
  If[!TrueQ[enabled], Return[Null]];
  If[callback =!= Automatic, Quiet[Check[callback[event], Null]]; Return[Null]];
  text = Lookup[event, "Stage", "Amplitude completion"];
  If[KeyExistsQ[event, "Operation"], text = text <> ": " <> ToString[event["Operation"]]];
  If[KeyExistsQ[event, "Phase"], text = text <> ": " <> ToString[event["Phase"]]];
  If[KeyExistsQ[event, "Status"], text = text <> "; " <> ToString[event["Status"]]];
  If[KeyExistsQ[event, "Item"] && KeyExistsQ[event, "Items"],
    text = text <> Switch[Lookup[event, "InputType", "Diagram"],
      "FactorizationChannel", "; channel ", "Amplitude", "; amplitude ", _, "; diagram "] <>
      ToString[event["Item"]] <> "/" <> ToString[event["Items"]],
  If[KeyExistsQ[event, "Diagram"] && KeyExistsQ[event, "Diagrams"],
    text = text <> "; diagram " <> ToString[event["Diagram"]] <> "/" <> ToString[event["Diagrams"]]]];
  If[KeyExistsQ[event, "Completed"] && KeyExistsQ[event, "Total"],
    text = text <> ": " <> ToString[event["Completed"]] <> "/" <> ToString[event["Total"]]];
  If[!KeyExistsQ[event, "Completed"] && KeyExistsQ[event, "Current"] && KeyExistsQ[event, "Total"],
    text = text <> ": " <> ToString[event["Current"]] <> "/" <> ToString[event["Total"]]];
  If[KeyExistsQ[event, "Unknowns"],
    text = text <> "; " <> ToString[event["Unknowns"]] <> " correction coefficients"];
  If[KeyExistsQ[event, "UnknownCount"],
    text = text <> "; " <> ToString[event["UnknownCount"]] <> " correction coefficients"];
  If[KeyExistsQ[event, "Round"],
    text = text <> "; refinement " <> ToString[event["Round"]]];
  If[KeyExistsQ[event, "EquationCount"],
    text = text <> "; " <> ToString[event["EquationCount"]] <> " equations"];
  If[KeyExistsQ[event, "Complexity"],
    text = text <> "; complexity " <> ToString[event["Complexity"]]];
  If[KeyExistsQ[event, "Terms"], text = text <> "; terms " <> ToString[event["Terms"]]];
  If[KeyExistsQ[event, "Elapsed"],
    text = text <> "; " <> ToString[Round[event["Elapsed"], 0.1], InputForm] <> " s"];
  If[$FrontEnd === Null, Print[text], PrintTemporary[text]];
  Null
];

completionValidationRuleSets[model_List, overrides_, requested_] := Module[
  {rules = residueParameterRules[model, overrides], massSymbols, alternate,
   supplied, independent, variations, candidate, completeQ},
  If[requested =!= Automatic,
    Return[DeleteDuplicates[Prepend[
      (residueParameterRules[model, Join[#, Replace[overrides, Automatic -> {}]]] & /@ requested),
      rules]]]];
  If[!ListQ[rules], Return[{}]];
  massSymbols = Select[DeleteDuplicates[model[[1, All, 6]]], modelParameterKeyQ];
  If[model[[4]] =!= {},
    (* Vary declared independent inputs, then recompute every derived mass and
       coupling. Reusing the full resolved rule list would freeze the model's
       constraints. Distinct positive contraction factors change mass ratios
       without pushing a mixing parameter out of its usual bounded domain. *)
    supplied = modelParameterOverrideRules[Replace[overrides, Automatic -> {}],
      First /@ Join[model[[3]], model[[4]]]];
    If[!ListQ[supplied], Return[{rules}]];
    independent = Select[DeleteDuplicates[First /@ model[[3]]],
      !MemberQ[First /@ supplied, #] && NumericQ[# /. rules] &&
        residueFiniteQ[# /. rules] && !TrueQ[(# /. rules) == 0] &];
    completeQ[assignment_] := ListQ[assignment] &&
      ContainsAll[First /@ assignment, First /@ rules] &&
      AllTrue[massSymbols /. assignment, NumericQ[#] && residueFiniteQ[#] &&
        TrueQ[Im[#] == 0 && Re[#] >= 0] &];
    variations = Table[
      candidate = residueParameterRules[model, Join[
        MapIndexed[#1 -> (#1 /. rules) (First[#2] + variant + 1)/
          (First[#2] + variant + 2) &, independent], supplied]];
      If[completeQ[candidate], candidate, Nothing], {variant, 2}];
    Return[DeleteDuplicates[Prepend[variations, rules]]]];
  alternate = (First[#] -> If[MemberQ[massSymbols, First[#]] && NumericQ[Last[#]],
    2 Last[#], Last[#]] &) /@ rules;
  DeleteDuplicates[{rules, alternate}]
];

(* A numerical coefficient that vanishes at one parameter assignment is not
   a symbolic identity. Fit the same affine unknowns at all retained model-
   consistent assignments, rather than only discovering the discrepancy in
   held-out validation after solving. Every original equation is preserved. *)
completionParameterConstraintSets[builder_, assignments_List, seed_Integer] := Module[
  {reports, valid, first},
  reports = MapIndexed[Function[{rules, index}, With[
    {report = builder[rules, seed + 104729 (First[index] - 1)]},
    <|"ParameterRules" -> rules, "Report" -> report|>]], assignments];
  valid = Select[Lookup[reports, "Report", {}], AssociationQ];
  first = If[valid === {}, <||>, First[valid]];
  Join[first, <|"Status" -> If[Length[valid] === Length[assignments] &&
        AllTrue[valid, Lookup[#, "Status", None] === "COMPLETE" &], "COMPLETE", "UNRESOLVED"],
    "Equations" -> Flatten[Lookup[valid, "Equations", {}], 1],
    "Samples" -> Flatten[Lookup[valid, "Samples", {}], 1],
    "Diagnostics" -> DeleteDuplicates[Flatten[Lookup[valid, "Diagnostics", {}], 1]],
    "ParameterAssignments" -> reports|>]
];

completionIdentityModel[model_List, overrides_] := Module[{supplied},
  supplied = modelParameterOverrideRules[Replace[overrides, Automatic -> {}],
    First /@ Join[model[[3]], model[[4]]]];
  If[!ListQ[supplied], Return[model]];
  (* A directly overridden dependent input is no longer constrained by its old
     definition. Other exact model definitions remain available to proofs. *)
  ReplacePart[model, 4 -> Select[model[[4]], !MemberQ[First /@ supplied, First[#]] &]]
];

completionReduceConstraintFamily[trial_, variables_List, constraints_Association] := Module[
  {solution, reduced = constraints},
  If[variables === {} || Lookup[constraints, "Status", None] =!= "COMPLETE",
    Return[<|"FamilyAmplitude" -> trial, "FreeParameters" -> variables,
      "ConstraintData" -> constraints, "Reduced" -> False|>]];
  solution = completionSolveLinear[constraints["Equations"], variables];
  If[!MemberQ[{"COMPLETE", "UNDERDETERMINED"}, solution["Status"]] ||
      Length[solution["FreeParameters"]] >= Length[variables],
    Return[<|"FamilyAmplitude" -> trial, "FreeParameters" -> variables,
      "ConstraintData" -> constraints, "LinearSystem" -> solution, "Reduced" -> False|>]];
  reduced = Join[constraints, <|"UnreducedEquations" -> constraints["Equations"],
    "Equations" -> (constraints["Equations"] /. solution["SolutionRules"]),
    "EliminatedCoefficients" -> solution["SolutionRules"]|>];
  <|"FamilyAmplitude" -> (trial /. solution["SolutionRules"]),
    "FreeParameters" -> solution["FreeParameters"], "ConstraintData" -> reduced,
    "LinearSystem" -> solution, "Reduced" -> True|>
];

completionSubstituteConstraintFamily[constraints_Association, rules_List] :=
  Join[constraints, <|"UnreducedEquations" -> Lookup[constraints, "UnreducedEquations",
    Lookup[constraints, "Equations", {}]],
    "Equations" -> (Lookup[constraints, "Equations", {}] /. rules)|>];

completionHEFamilyReport[report_Association, trial_, variables_List, original_] := Module[
  {representative = trial /. Thread[variables -> 0]},
  Join[report, <|"Amplitude" -> representative, "FamilyAmplitude" -> trial,
    "FreeParameters" -> variables, "RemainingBasis" -> (D[trial, #] & /@ variables),
    "Correction" -> representative - original|>]
];

completionFormat[report_Association, output_, retainReport_: True] := If[output === "Details", report,
  If[report["Status"] === "COMPLETE",
    If[output === "Expression", report["Amplitude"],
      {Select[Lookup[report, "ExternalMassRules", {}],
        MatchQ[#, HoldPattern[Mass[_Integer] -> _]] &], report["Amplitude"]}],
    Failure["IncompleteAmplitude", If[TrueQ[retainReport], <|"MessageTemplate" ->
      "Amplitude completion did not establish all required constraints. Inspect the retained report.",
      "Amplitude" -> report["Amplitude"], "Report" -> report|>,
      Module[{reason = SelectFirst[Lookup[report, "Diagnostics", {}], StringQ,
          "Factorization completion did not establish agreement with every channel."]},
        <|"MessageTemplate" -> reason <> " Request ReturnDetails -> True for diagnostics.",
          "Status" -> report["Status"], "Reason" -> reason|>]]]]];

completionCoefficientEquations[expression_, variables_List] := Module[{numerator},
  If[variables =!= {} && PolynomialQ[expression, variables],
    Return[Last /@ CoefficientRules[expression, variables]]];
  numerator = Numerator[Cancel[Together[expression]]];
  If[variables === {}, Return[{numerator}]];
  If[!PolynomialQ[numerator, variables], Return[Failure["NonPolynomialSpinDependence", <||>]]];
  Last /@ CoefficientRules[Expand[numerator], variables]
];

completionCoefficientEquations[expression_, variables_List, unknowns_List] := Module[
  {arrays, components, coefficientRules, exponents, lookups, matrix},
  If[variables === {} || unknowns === {},
    Return[completionCoefficientEquations[expression, variables]]];
  arrays = Quiet[Check[CoefficientArrays[expression, unknowns], $Failed]];
  If[!ListQ[arrays] || !(1 <= Length[arrays] <= 2),
    Return[completionCoefficientEquations[expression, variables]]];
  components = Prepend[If[Length[arrays] === 1,
    ConstantArray[0, Length[unknowns]], Normal[arrays[[2]]]], First[arrays]];
  If[!AllTrue[components, residueFiniteQ[#] && PolynomialQ[#, variables] &],
    Return[completionCoefficientEquations[expression, variables]]];
  (* Extract each small spin polynomial before reassembling affine rows. This
     avoids repeatedly expanding every fitting unknown against every spin. *)
  coefficientRules = CoefficientRules[#, variables] & /@ components;
  exponents = DeleteDuplicates[First /@ Flatten[coefficientRules, 1]];
  If[exponents === {}, Return[{}]];
  exponents = First /@ CoefficientRules[
    Total[Times @@ (variables^#) & /@ exponents], variables];
  lookups = Association /@ coefficientRules;
  matrix = Table[First[Lookup[#, {power}, 0]] & /@ lookups, {power, exponents}];
  First[#] + Rest[#].unknowns & /@ matrix
];

completionLinearComponents[trial_, unknowns_List, preserveForm_: True] := Module[{arrays, linear},
  If[unknowns === {}, Return[{trial}]];
  If[TrueQ[preserveForm], Return[Prepend[Coefficient[trial, #] & /@ unknowns,
    trial /. Thread[unknowns -> 0]]]];
  (* One affine pass avoids rescanning the full trial for every coefficient. *)
  arrays = Quiet[Check[CoefficientArrays[trial, unknowns], $Failed]];
  If[ListQ[arrays] && 1 <= Length[arrays] <= 2,
    linear = If[Length[arrays] === 1, ConstantArray[0, Length[unknowns]],
      Normal[arrays[[2]]]];
    If[VectorQ[linear] && Length[linear] === Length[unknowns],
      Return[Prepend[linear, trial /. Thread[unknowns -> 0]]]]];
  Prepend[Coefficient[trial, #] & /@ unknowns, trial /. Thread[unknowns -> 0]]
];

completionSupportInputs[trial_, externalRules_List, rows_List, model_List] := Module[{propagators},
  If[!residueFiniteQ[trial],
    Return[residueSimpleInputs[{externalRules, trial}, rows, model]]];
  (* Support discovery needs the propagator inventory, not spinor reduction of
     every affine correction. All components still undergo residue validation. *)
  propagators = DeleteDuplicates[Cases[trial, _PropDen, Infinity]];
  residueSimpleInputs[{externalRules, Total[1/propagators]}, rows, model]
];

completionPolynomialZeroQ[expression_, variables_List] := Module[{coefficients},
  coefficients = completionCoefficientEquations[expression, variables];
  !FailureQ[coefficients] && AllTrue[coefficients, highEnergyZeroState[#] === "Zero" &]
];

completionTargets[rows_List] := Map[Function[group,
  Module[{complete = AllTrue[group, TrueQ[Lookup[#, "Complete", False]] &&
      KeyExistsQ[#, "StateSum"] &]},
    Join[First[group], <|"Complete" -> complete,
      "StateSum" -> If[complete, Total[Lookup[group, "StateSum"]],
        Missing["IncompleteFactorizationChannel"]]|>]]],
  GatherBy[residueNormalizeChannel /@ rows, residueChannelKey]];

(* Preserve zero-residue obligations even after their original propagator has
   disappeared from the candidate. These rows are internal validation inputs. *)
completionCheckChannelRows[normalized_Association, rows_List] := Module[
  {external, keys, missing, masses},
  external = Cases[normalized["ExternalMassRules"], HoldPattern[Mass[i_Integer] -> _] :> i];
  keys = ({canonicalPhysicalCut[List @@ #[[-3]], external], #[[-2]]} & /@ rows);
  missing = Select[completionTargets[normalized["Targets"]],
    !MemberQ[keys, residueChannelKey[#]] && TrueQ[#["Complete"]] &&
      TrueQ[residueExactZero[#["StateSum"]]] &];
  masses = Mass /@ external /. normalized["ExternalMassRules"];
  Join[rows, Join[masses, {Multiparticle @@ #["Cut"], #["Mass"], 0}] & /@ missing]
];

completionBoundedRationalReconstruction[value_Integer, modulus_Integer, limit_Integer] := Module[
  {residue = Mod[value, modulus], r0 = modulus, r1, t0 = 0, t1 = 1, q, numerator, denominator},
  If[residue === 0, Return[0]];
  r1 = residue;
  While[Abs[r1] > limit,
    q = Quotient[r0, r1];
    {r0, r1} = {r1, r0 - q r1}; {t0, t1} = {t1, t0 - q t1}];
  If[t1 === 0, Return[Missing["NoReconstruction"]]];
  {numerator, denominator} = Sign[t1] {r1, t1};
  If[Abs[numerator] > limit || denominator > limit ||
      !CoprimeQ[numerator, denominator] || !CoprimeQ[denominator, modulus] ||
      Mod[numerator - residue denominator, modulus] =!= 0,
    Missing["NoReconstruction"], numerator/denominator]
];

completionExactLeftNullCertificate[matrix_List, constant_List, rowScales_List,
    integerWitness_List] := Module[
  {fallback = Missing["InvalidExactLeftNullCertificate"], rationalQ, rows = Length[matrix],
   columns, integerMatrix, annihilation, delta},
  rationalQ[value_] := MatchQ[value, _Integer | _Rational];
  If[rows === 0 || !MatrixQ[matrix, rationalQ] || Length[constant] =!= rows ||
      !VectorQ[constant, rationalQ] || Length[rowScales] =!= rows ||
      !AllTrue[rowScales, IntegerQ[#] && # > 0 &] ||
      Length[integerWitness] =!= rows || !VectorQ[integerWitness, IntegerQ], Return[fallback]];
  columns = Length[First[matrix]];
  If[columns === 0, Return[fallback]];
  integerMatrix = MapThread[Times, {matrix, rowScales}];
  If[!MatrixQ[integerMatrix, IntegerQ], Return[fallback]];
  (* For y = rowScales*w, w.(rowScales*A) is exactly y.A. This
     integer form checks every original coefficient without rational GCDs. *)
  annihilation = Normal[SparseArray[integerWitness].SparseArray[integerMatrix]];
  delta = integerWitness.(rowScales constant);
  If[Length[annihilation] =!= columns || !AllTrue[annihilation, # === 0 &] ||
      !rationalQ[delta] || delta === 0, Return[fallback]];
  <|"LeftNullVector" -> rowScales integerWitness, "RowScales" -> rowScales,
    "RowScaledLeftNullVector" -> integerWitness,
    "ZeroCoefficientResidual" -> annihilation, "NonzeroConstantResidual" -> delta,
    "ExactAllColumnCertificate" -> True|>
];

(* A left-null contradiction certifies inconsistency without constructing the
   full affine nullspace. Row denominator clearing makes the final all-column
   certificate an integer product. A modular pivot count is only a lower bound
   on the exact rank and is reported as such. *)
completionExactLeftNullContradiction[matrix_List, constant_List, seconds_: 60,
    prime_: 2147483647] := Module[
  {fallback = Missing["NoCertifiedLeftNullContradiction"], started = AbsoluteTime[],
   deadline, rows = Length[matrix], columns, rationalQ, rowScales, integerMatrix,
   integerConstant, modular, positions, selectedRows, pivots, rank, square,
   right, rightScale, point, pointScale, scaledPoint, residual, contradiction,
   weights, weightScale, integerWitness, certificate,
   bounded, stop, tag = Unique["leftNullContradiction"]},
  rationalQ[value_] := MatchQ[value, _Integer | _Rational];
  If[!TrueQ[NumericQ[seconds] && Element[seconds, Reals] && 0 < seconds < Infinity] ||
      rows === 0 || !MatrixQ[matrix, rationalQ] || Length[constant] =!= rows ||
      !VectorQ[constant, rationalQ] || !IntegerQ[prime] ||
      !TrueQ[2 < prime <= 2147483647 && PrimeQ[prime]], Return[fallback]];
  columns = Length[First[matrix]];
  If[columns === 0, Return[fallback]];
  deadline = started + seconds;
  stop[] := Throw[fallback, tag];
  SetAttributes[bounded, HoldAll];
  bounded[expression_] := If[AbsoluteTime[] >= deadline, stop[],
    TimeConstrained[expression, Max[0.001, deadline - AbsoluteTime[]], stop[]]];
  positions[value_List] := DeleteCases[Map[Function[row,
    SelectFirst[Range[Length[row]], row[[#]] =!= 0 &, Missing["ZeroRow"]]], value], _Missing];
  Quiet[Check[TimeConstrained[MemoryConstrained[Catch[
    rowScales = bounded[Apply[LCM, Denominator[#]] & /@ matrix];
    integerMatrix = bounded[MapThread[Times, {matrix, rowScales}]];
    integerConstant = bounded[rowScales constant];
    If[!MatrixQ[integerMatrix, IntegerQ] ||
        !AllTrue[rowScales, IntegerQ[#] && # > 0 &], stop[]];
    contradiction = SelectFirst[Range[rows],
      AllTrue[integerMatrix[[#]], # === 0 &] && integerConstant[[#]] =!= 0 &,
      Missing["NoConstantRow"]];
    If[!MissingQ[contradiction],
      integerWitness = UnitVector[rows, contradiction]; rank = 0,
      modular = bounded[RowReduce[Mod[Transpose[integerMatrix], prime], Modulus -> prime]];
      If[!MatrixQ[modular, IntegerQ], stop[]];
      selectedRows = positions[modular]; rank = Length[selectedRows];
      If[rank === 0, stop[]];
      modular = bounded[RowReduce[Mod[integerMatrix[[selectedRows]], prime], Modulus -> prime]];
      If[!MatrixQ[modular, IntegerQ], stop[]];
      pivots = positions[modular];
      If[Length[pivots] =!= rank || !DuplicateFreeQ[selectedRows] ||
          !DuplicateFreeQ[pivots], stop[]];
      square = integerMatrix[[selectedRows, pivots]];
      right = -integerConstant[[selectedRows]];
      rightScale = bounded[Apply[LCM, Denominator[right]]];
      point = bounded[LinearSolve[square, rightScale right]]/rightScale;
      If[!VectorQ[point, rationalQ] || Length[point] =!= rank, stop[]];
      pointScale = bounded[Apply[LCM, Denominator[point]]];
      scaledPoint = pointScale point;
      If[!AllTrue[bounded[square.scaledPoint - pointScale right], # === 0 &], stop[]];
      residual = bounded[integerMatrix[[All, pivots]].scaledPoint +
        pointScale integerConstant];
      contradiction = SelectFirst[Range[rows], residual[[#]] =!= 0 &,
        Missing["ConsistentParticular"]];
      If[MissingQ[contradiction], stop[]];
      weights = bounded[LinearSolve[Transpose[square], integerMatrix[[contradiction, pivots]]]];
      If[!VectorQ[weights, rationalQ] || Length[weights] =!= rank, stop[]];
      weightScale = bounded[Apply[LCM, Denominator[weights]]];
      integerWitness = weightScale UnitVector[rows, contradiction];
      integerWitness[[selectedRows]] -= weightScale weights];
    certificate = bounded[completionExactLeftNullCertificate[
      matrix, constant, rowScales, integerWitness]];
    If[!AssociationQ[certificate], stop[]];
    Join[<|"Status" -> "INCONSISTENT", "Rank" -> Which[
        AllTrue[Flatten[integerMatrix], # === 0 &], 0,
        rank === columns, columns, True, Missing["NotComputedFromContradictionCertificate"]],
      "RankLowerBound" -> rank, "CoefficientRankLowerBound" -> rank, "CheckedRows" -> rows,
      "CheckedColumns" -> columns, "Backend" -> "CertifiedExactLeftNullContradiction",
      "ContradictionPrime" -> prime, "ContradictionRow" -> contradiction|>, certificate],
    tag], 536870912, fallback],
    Max[0.001, deadline - AbsoluteTime[]], fallback], fallback]]
];

completionCertifiedModularReduce[matrix_List, constant_List, seconds_: 60,
    primeInventory_: Automatic] := Module[
  {fallback = Missing["CertifiedModularUnavailable"], started = AbsoluteTime[], deadline,
   rows = Length[matrix], columns, rationalQ, primes = primeInventory,
   augmented, profile = None, free = {}, modulus = 1,
   residues, candidate = None, reduced, active, pivots, block, prime,
   unique, reconstructed, lookup, limit, used = {}, heldOut, scales, integerBlock,
   expected, proof, rationalRows, actualPivots, rank, bounded, stop,
   profileBetterQ, rationalModulo, certify, contradictionAttempted = False,
   tag = Unique["certifiedModular"]},
  rationalQ[value_] := MatchQ[value, _Integer | _Rational];
  If[!TrueQ[NumericQ[seconds] && Element[seconds, Reals] && 0 < seconds < Infinity] ||
      Length[constant] =!= rows || !VectorQ[constant, rationalQ] ||
      !MatrixQ[matrix, rationalQ], Return[fallback]];
  If[rows === 0, Return[<|"ReducedRows" -> {}, "Rank" -> 0, "CheckedRows" -> 0|>]];
  columns = Length[First[matrix]];
  If[AllTrue[Join[Flatten[matrix], constant], # === 0 &],
    Return[<|"ReducedRows" -> {}, "Rank" -> 0, "CheckedRows" -> rows|>]];
  If[columns === 0, Return[fallback]];
  If[primes === Automatic, primes = NestList[NextPrime[#, -1] &, 2147483647, 24]];
  If[!ListQ[primes] || Length[primes] < 3 || !DuplicateFreeQ[primes] ||
      !AllTrue[primes, IntegerQ[#] && 2 < # <= 2147483647 && PrimeQ[#] &],
    Return[fallback]];
  deadline = started + seconds;
  stop[] := Throw[fallback, tag];
  SetAttributes[bounded, HoldAll];
  bounded[expression_] := If[AbsoluteTime[] >= deadline, stop[],
    TimeConstrained[expression, Max[0.001, deadline - AbsoluteTime[]], stop[]]];
  profileBetterQ[new_List, old_List] := Length[new] > Length[old] ||
    (Length[new] === Length[old] && new =!= old && OrderedQ[{new, old}]);
  rationalModulo[values_, p_Integer] := Map[Function[value,
    Mod[Numerator[value] PowerMod[Denominator[value], -1, p], p]], values, {2}];
  certify[values_, p_Integer] := Module[{},
    scales = bounded[Apply[LCM, Denominator[#]] & /@ Transpose[values]];
    integerBlock = Map[# scales &, values];
    If[!MatrixQ[integerBlock, IntegerQ], stop[]];
    expected = Map[# scales &, augmented[[All, Append[free, columns + 1]]]];
    (* A_p B = [A_free, c] certifies every original row and free direction.
       The free identity gives n-r independent null vectors; the modular
       rank lower bound proves that this is the complete exact family. *)
    proof = bounded[Normal[SparseArray[augmented[[All, profile]]].
      SparseArray[integerBlock]] === expected];
    If[!TrueQ[proof], Return[fallback]];
    rank = Length[profile];
    rationalRows = ConstantArray[0, {rank, columns + 1}];
    rationalRows[[All, profile]] = IdentityMatrix[rank];
    rationalRows[[All, Append[free, columns + 1]]] = values;
    actualPivots = Map[Function[row, SelectFirst[Range[columns],
      row[[#]] =!= 0 &, Missing["NoPivot"]]], rationalRows];
    If[actualPivots =!= profile, Return[fallback]];
    <|"ReducedRows" -> (Append[Most[#], -Last[#]] & /@ rationalRows),
      "Rank" -> rank, "CheckedRows" -> rows, "Backend" -> "CertifiedCRT",
      "CRTPrimes" -> used, "HeldOutPrime" -> p|>
  ];
  Quiet[Check[TimeConstrained[Catch[
    augmented = bounded[MapThread[Function[{row, rhs},
      With[{whole = Append[row, rhs]}, whole Apply[LCM, Denominator[whole]]]],
      {matrix, constant}]];
    Do[
      reduced = bounded[RowReduce[augmented, Modulus -> prime]];
      If[!MatrixQ[reduced, IntegerQ], stop[]];
      active = Select[reduced, AnyTrue[#, # =!= 0 &] &];
      pivots = First[FirstPosition[#, 1]] & /@ active;
      If[!DuplicateFreeQ[pivots] || pivots =!= Sort[pivots] ||
          !AllTrue[pivots, IntegerQ[#] && 1 <= # <= columns + 1 &], stop[]];
      (* Full coefficient-column rank already gives an exact upper bound.
         A larger augmented rank modulo this prime is then an exact
         contradiction, even though a rank-deficient modular gap alone
         would not prove inconsistency. No rational RREF is fabricated. *)
      If[pivots === Range[columns + 1],
        Throw[<|"Status" -> "INCONSISTENT", "Rank" -> columns,
          "CheckedRows" -> rows, "Backend" -> "CertifiedFullColumnRankContradiction",
          "ContradictionPrime" -> prime, "CoefficientRankLowerBound" -> columns,
          "AugmentedRankLowerBound" -> columns + 1|>, tag]];
      If[MemberQ[pivots, columns + 1] && !TrueQ[contradictionAttempted],
        contradictionAttempted = True;
        proof = bounded[completionExactLeftNullContradiction[matrix, constant,
          (* Only a modular augmented-rank gap opens this proof attempt.
             A fixed twenty seconds was too short to certify wider systems,
             leaving repeated modular gaps with no possible CRT solution.
             Scale the optional proof allowance with the actual column count,
             inside at most half the existing remaining solver clock. *)
          Min[Max[20., Min[120., columns/8.]],
            Max[0.001, (deadline - AbsoluteTime[])/2]], prime]];
        If[AssociationQ[proof] && Lookup[proof, "Status", None] === "INCONSISTENT" &&
            TrueQ[Lookup[proof, "ExactAllColumnCertificate", False]], Throw[proof, tag]]];
      If[pivots === {} || MemberQ[pivots, columns + 1], Continue[]];
      If[profile === None || profileBetterQ[pivots, profile],
        profile = pivots; free = Complement[Range[columns], profile];
        used = {}; modulus = 1; candidate = None,
        If[pivots =!= profile, Continue[]]];
      block = active[[All, Append[free, columns + 1]]];
      If[candidate =!= None,
        If[!AnyTrue[Flatten[candidate], Mod[Denominator[#], prime] === 0 &],
          heldOut = bounded[rationalModulo[candidate, prime] === block];
          If[TrueQ[heldOut],
            proof = certify[candidate, prime];
            If[AssociationQ[proof], Throw[proof, tag]]]];
        candidate = None];
      If[modulus === 1, residues = block,
        residues = bounded[residues + modulus Mod[
          (block - Mod[residues, prime]) PowerMod[modulus, -1, prime], prime]]];
      modulus *= prime; AppendTo[used, prime];
      If[Length[used] < 2, Continue[]];
      unique = bounded[DeleteDuplicates[Flatten[residues]]];
      limit = Floor[Sqrt[(modulus - 1)/2]];
      reconstructed = bounded[completionBoundedRationalReconstruction[#, modulus, limit] & /@ unique];
      If[FreeQ[reconstructed, _Missing],
        lookup = AssociationThread[unique, reconstructed];
        candidate = bounded[Lookup[lookup, #] & /@ residues]],
      {prime, primes}];
    fallback, tag], Max[0.001, deadline - AbsoluteTime[]], fallback], fallback]]
];

completionExactBlockReduce[matrix_List, constant_List, prime_: 2147483647] := Module[
  {rationalQ, fallback = Missing["ExactBlockFallback"], rows = Length[matrix], columns,
   integerMatrix, rowScales, modular, pivotPositions, selectedRows, pivots, free,
   rank, square, right, block, width, blockQ, zeroVectorQ, bad, repair, remaining,
   batches, pivotMap, freeMap, affine, scales, integerAffine, certificate, reduced,
   repairsSucceeded, single, contradiction, tag = Unique["exactBlock"]},
  rationalQ[value_] := MatchQ[value, _Integer | _Rational];
  If[rows === 0 || !MatrixQ[matrix, rationalQ] || Length[constant] =!= rows ||
      !VectorQ[constant, rationalQ] || !IntegerQ[prime] || !PrimeQ[prime], Return[fallback]];
  columns = Length[First[matrix]];
  If[columns === 0, Return[fallback]];
  rowScales = (LCM @@ (Denominator /@ #) &) /@ matrix;
  integerMatrix = MapThread[Times, {matrix, rowScales}];
  pivotPositions[value_List] := DeleteCases[Map[Function[row,
    SelectFirst[Range[Length[row]], row[[#]] =!= 0 &, Missing["ZeroRow"]]], value], _Missing];
  modular = Quiet[Check[RowReduce[Mod[Transpose[integerMatrix], prime],
    Modulus -> prime], $Failed]];
  If[!MatrixQ[modular], Return[fallback]];
  selectedRows = pivotPositions[modular]; rank = Length[selectedRows];
  If[rank === 0,
    Return[If[AllTrue[Flatten[matrix], # === 0 &] && AllTrue[constant, # === 0 &],
      <|"ReducedRows" -> {}, "Rank" -> 0, "CheckedRows" -> rows|>, fallback]]];
  modular = Quiet[Check[RowReduce[Mod[integerMatrix[[selectedRows]], prime],
    Modulus -> prime], $Failed]];
  If[!MatrixQ[modular], Return[fallback]];
  pivots = pivotPositions[modular];
  If[Length[pivots] =!= rank, Return[fallback]];
  free = Complement[Range[columns], pivots]; width = 1 + Length[free];
  square = matrix[[selectedRows, pivots]];
  right = Join[Transpose[{-constant[[selectedRows]]}], -matrix[[selectedRows, free]], 2];
  blockQ[value_, count_] := MatrixQ[value, rationalQ] && Dimensions[value] === {rank, count};
  zeroVectorQ[value_] := VectorQ[value] && AllTrue[value, # === 0 &];
  block = Quiet[Check[LinearSolve[square, right], $Failed]];
  If[!blockQ[block, width], Return[fallback]];
  bad = Select[Range[width], !zeroVectorQ[square.block[[All, #]] - right[[All, #]]] &];
  (* Certify every right-hand side, repairing only failed columns in small batches. *)
  batches = Table[Take[bad, {index, Min[index + 15, Length[bad]]}],
    {index, 1, Length[bad], 16}];
  repairsSucceeded = Catch[
    Do[
      repair = Quiet[Check[LinearSolve[square, right[[All, batch]]], $Failed]];
      If[!blockQ[repair, Length[batch]], Throw[False, tag]];
      remaining = Select[Range[Length[batch]],
        !zeroVectorQ[square.repair[[All, #]] - right[[All, batch[[#]]]]] &];
      Do[
        single = Quiet[Check[LinearSolve[square, right[[All, batch[[index]]]]], $Failed]];
        If[!VectorQ[single, rationalQ] || Length[single] =!= rank ||
            !zeroVectorQ[square.single - right[[All, batch[[index]]]]], Throw[False, tag]];
        repair[[All, index]] = single,
        {index, remaining}];
      block[[All, batch]] = repair,
      {batch, batches}]; True,
    tag];
  If[!TrueQ[repairsSucceeded], Return[fallback]];
  If[!AllTrue[Flatten[square.block - right], # === 0 &], Return[fallback]];
  pivotMap = AssociationThread[pivots, Range[rank]];
  freeMap = AssociationThread[free, Range[Length[free]]];
  affine = Table[If[KeyExistsQ[pivotMap, index], block[[pivotMap[index]]],
    UnitVector[width, 1 + freeMap[index]]], {index, columns}];
  If[free =!= {} && affine[[free, Range[2, width]]] =!= IdentityMatrix[Length[free]],
    Return[fallback]];
  scales = (LCM @@ (Denominator /@ #) &) /@ Transpose[affine];
  integerAffine = Transpose[MapThread[Times, {Transpose[affine], scales}]];
  certificate = matrix.integerAffine;
  certificate[[All, 1]] = certificate[[All, 1]] + constant First[scales];
  reduced = MapThread[Function[{pivot, values}, ReplacePart[ConstantArray[0, columns + 1],
    Join[{pivot -> 1, columns + 1 -> First[values]}, Thread[free -> (-Rest[values])]]]],
    {pivots, block}];
  (* The caller reads leading rational pivots, which can differ from modular
     pivots even when their ranks agree. Such a prime must use the native path. *)
  If[pivotPositions[Most /@ reduced] =!= pivots, Return[fallback]];
  (* A modular rank alone is inconclusive. The certified square block spans all
     of its solutions; an exact nonzero residual independent of every free
     coordinate proves that no solution can satisfy this original row. *)
  If[!AllTrue[Flatten[certificate], # === 0 &],
    (* Certify the full nullspace as well, so the reported coefficient rank is
       exact even when the chosen prime could have dropped a matrix rank. *)
    If[!AllTrue[Flatten[Rest /@ certificate], # === 0 &], Return[fallback]];
    contradiction = SelectFirst[Range[rows], Function[index,
      certificate[[index, 1]] =!= 0 && AllTrue[Rest[certificate[[index]]], # === 0 &]],
      Missing["NoExactContradiction"]];
    If[MissingQ[contradiction], Return[fallback]];
    Return[<|"ReducedRows" -> Append[reduced, Append[ConstantArray[0, columns], 1]],
      "Rank" -> rank, "CheckedRows" -> rows, "ContradictionRow" -> contradiction|>]];
  <|"ReducedRows" -> reduced, "Rank" -> rank, "CheckedRows" -> rows|>
];

DownValues[completionSolveLinear] = {};
(* Remove chart-dependent algebraic units row by row before a whole sampled
   matrix is normalized. Each accepted divisor has an exact nonzero algebraic
   certificate, and every original affine row is retained for replay. This
   changes equation units only, never a correction coefficient's coordinates. *)
completionAlgebraicNonzeroCertificate[value_] := Module[{parts, proofs, real, imaginary, reduced},
  If[value === 0 || !NumericQ[value] || !FreeQ[value, _Real] || !residueFiniteQ[value],
    Return[Missing["NoExactAlgebraicNonzeroProof"]]];
  If[MatchQ[value, _Integer | _Rational] || Head[value] === Complex &&
      MatchQ[Re[value], _Integer | _Rational] && MatchQ[Im[value], _Integer | _Rational],
    Return[<|"Method" -> "ExactNonzeroScalar", "Value" -> value|>]];
  If[Head[value] === Times,
    proofs = completionAlgebraicNonzeroCertificate /@ List @@ value;
    If[AllTrue[proofs, AssociationQ], Return[<|"Method" -> "ProductOfNonzeroAlgebraicFactors",
      "Value" -> value, "Factors" -> proofs|>]]];
  If[Head[value] === Power && MatchQ[Last[value], _Integer | _Rational],
    proofs = completionAlgebraicNonzeroCertificate[First[value]];
    If[AssociationQ[proofs], Return[<|"Method" -> "NonzeroRationalPower",
      "Value" -> value, "Base" -> proofs, "Exponent" -> Last[value]|>]]];
  {real, imaginary} = {Re[value], Im[value]};
  If[imaginary =!= value && imaginary =!= 0,
    proofs = completionAlgebraicNonzeroCertificate[imaginary];
    If[AssociationQ[proofs], Return[<|"Method" -> "NonzeroImaginaryPart",
      "Value" -> value, "Part" -> proofs|>]]];
  If[real =!= value && real =!= 0,
    proofs = completionAlgebraicNonzeroCertificate[real];
    If[AssociationQ[proofs], Return[<|"Method" -> "NonzeroRealPart",
      "Value" -> value, "Part" -> proofs|>]]];
  reduced = Quiet[Check[RootReduce[value], $Failed]];
  If[reduced =!= $Failed && reduced =!= 0 && FreeQ[reduced, _Real] &&
      TrueQ[Element[reduced, Algebraics]],
    <|"Method" -> "ExactAlgebraicRootReduction", "Value" -> value, "ReducedValue" -> reduced|>,
    Missing["NoExactAlgebraicNonzeroProof"]]
];

(* An exact sampled coefficient can be an unevaluated sum of thousands of
   rational terms. Canonicalize DISTINCT numbers before the affine solve.
   This changes neither rows nor coordinates. Every replacement has an exact
   ordinary-algebra replay; a guard or timeout retains the original matrix. *)
completionCanonicalNumericCoefficientMatrix[matrix_List, seconds_: 20] := Module[
  {started = AbsoluteTime[], original = matrix, distinct, values, cache, normalized,
   replay, remaining, outcome, fallback = Missing["NoCertifiedNumericMatrixNormalization"]},
  remaining[] := Max[0, seconds - (AbsoluteTime[] - started)];
  If[!TrueQ[NumericQ[seconds] && seconds > 0] || !MatrixQ[matrix] ||
      Times @@ Dimensions[matrix] > 65536 || LeafCount[matrix] > 12000000 ||
      !FreeQ[matrix, _Real] || !AllTrue[Flatten[matrix], NumericQ] ||
      !residueFiniteQ[matrix], Return[fallback]];
  outcome = TimeConstrained[MemoryConstrained[
    distinct = DeleteDuplicates[Flatten[matrix]];
    values = Together /@ distinct;
    If[!AllTrue[values, NumericQ] || !residueFiniteQ[values], Return[fallback]];
    replay = And @@ MapThread[(Together[#1 - #2] === 0) &, {distinct, values}];
    If[!TrueQ[replay], Return[fallback]];
    cache = AssociationThread[distinct, values];
    normalized = Map[cache[[Key[#]]] &, matrix, {2}];
    If[Dimensions[normalized] =!= Dimensions[original], Return[fallback]];
    <|"Status" -> "COMPLETE", "Matrix" -> normalized,
      "Method" -> "DistinctExactNumericalCoefficientsWithOrdinaryAlgebraReplay",
      "OriginalDimensions" -> Dimensions[original], "Dimensions" -> Dimensions[normalized],
      "OriginalLeaves" -> LeafCount[original], "ReducedLeaves" -> LeafCount[normalized],
      "DistinctCoefficients" -> Length[distinct], "NumericalApproximation" -> False,
      "GaussianRationalMatrix" -> AllTrue[Flatten[normalized], completionGaussianRationalQ],
      "Certificate" -> <|"EveryDistinctCoefficientReplayedExactly" -> True,
        "AllRowsRetained" -> True, "AllCoordinatesRetained" -> True,
        "NoSampledZerosDiscarded" -> True, "NoNonzeroRowScaling" -> True|>,
      "ElapsedSeconds" -> AbsoluteTime[] - started|>,
    805306368, fallback], Max[0.000001, remaining[]], fallback];
  outcome
];

completionAlgebraicRowUnits[matrix_List, constant_List, seconds_: 5] := Module[
  {resultMatrix = matrix, resultConstant = constant, records = {}, started = AbsoluteTime[],
   source, candidates, scale, scaleProof, ratios, replay, outcome, row, remaining,
   exactRationalQ, unit, complete = True, proof, factors, radicalFactors},
  exactRationalQ[value_] := MatchQ[value, _Integer | _Rational] ||
    Head[value] === Complex && MatchQ[Re[value], _Integer | _Rational] &&
      MatchQ[Im[value], _Integer | _Rational];
  remaining[] := Max[0, seconds - (AbsoluteTime[] - started)];
  If[Length[matrix] =!= Length[constant] || !TrueQ[seconds > 0],
    Return[<|"Matrix" -> matrix, "Constant" -> constant,
      "Normalization" -> <|"Rows" -> {}, "AcceptedRows" -> 0,
        "OriginalRowCount" -> Length[matrix], "Complete" -> False|>|>]];
  Do[
    If[remaining[] <= 0, complete = False; Break[]];
    source = Append[matrix[[row]], constant[[row]]];
    If[AllTrue[source, exactRationalQ], Continue[]];
    candidates = SortBy[Select[DeleteDuplicates[source], # =!= 0 &&
      NumericQ[#] && FreeQ[#, _Real] && residueFiniteQ[#] &], LeafCount];
    candidates = DeleteDuplicates[Flatten[Map[Function[value,
      factors = If[Head[value] === Times, List @@ value, {value}];
      radicalFactors = Select[factors, MatchQ[#, Power[_, _Rational] | _Root] &];
      {Times @@ radicalFactors, Times @@ Select[factors, !exactRationalQ[#] &]}], candidates], 1]];
    candidates = SortBy[DeleteCases[candidates, 1 | -1],
      {Count[#, _Plus, Infinity], LeafCount[#]} &];
    If[candidates === {}, Continue[]];
    outcome = TimeConstrained[Catch[
      Do[
        ratios = Quiet[Check[Cancel[source/unit], $Failed]];
        If[!ListQ[ratios], Continue[]];
        If[!AllTrue[ratios, exactRationalQ], ratios = Quiet[Check[RootReduce[ratios], $Failed]]];
        If[!ListQ[ratios] || !AllTrue[ratios, exactRationalQ], Continue[]];
        proof = completionAlgebraicNonzeroCertificate[unit];
        If[!AssociationQ[proof], Continue[]];
        replay = Quiet[Check[RootReduce[unit ratios - source], $Failed]];
        If[!ListQ[replay] || !AllTrue[replay, # === 0 &], Continue[]];
        Throw[<|"Scale" -> unit, "ProvedNonzeroScale" -> unit,
          "NonzeroCertificate" -> proof,
          "NormalizedRow" -> ratios, "ExactReplay" -> replay|>],
        {unit, Take[candidates, UpTo[3]]}]; Missing["NoUsefulRowUnit"]],
      Min[0.2, remaining[]], Missing["RowUnitBudget"]];
    If[AssociationQ[outcome],
      scale = outcome["Scale"]; ratios = outcome["NormalizedRow"];
      resultMatrix[[row]] = Most[ratios]; resultConstant[[row]] = Last[ratios];
      AppendTo[records, Join[KeyDrop[outcome, "NormalizedRow"],
        <|"Row" -> row, "OriginalAffineRow" -> source,
          "ExactRowEquivalence" -> True, "UnknownCoordinatesChanged" -> False|>]]],
    {row, Length[matrix]}];
  <|"Matrix" -> resultMatrix, "Constant" -> resultConstant,
    "Normalization" -> <|"Rows" -> records, "AcceptedRows" -> Length[records],
      "OriginalRowCount" -> Length[matrix], "Complete" -> complete,
      "AllOriginalRowsRetained" -> True, "UnknownCoordinatesChanged" -> False,
      "ElapsedTime" -> AbsoluteTime[] - started|>|>
];

(* Approximate arithmetic only proposes a small independent block. Its inverse,
   full affine nullspace, and every original exact row must then replay exactly.
   Independent sample charts need not be combined into one huge number field. *)
completionExactAlgebraicBlockSolve[matrix_List, constant_List, variables_List, seconds_: 8] := Module[
  {fallback = Missing["UncertifiedAlgebraicBlock"], columns = Length[variables],
   rows = Length[matrix], work, tag = Unique["algebraicBlock"]},
  If[columns < 1 || columns > 16 || rows < Max[12, 4 columns] ||
      Length[constant] =!= rows || !MatrixQ[matrix] || Length[First[matrix]] =!= columns ||
      !FreeQ[{matrix, constant}, _Real] ||
      !AllTrue[Flatten[{matrix, constant}], NumericQ[#] && residueFiniteQ[#] &] ||
      FreeQ[{matrix, constant}, _Root | Power[_, _Rational]] || !TrueQ[seconds > 0], Return[fallback]];
  work[] := Catch[Module[
    {order, numbers, maxima, selected, pivots, free, rank, square, right, solved,
     inverse, block, affine, certificate, proof, coefficientProof, contradiction,
     exactZero, pivotPositions, reduced, rules, zeroRows},
    exactZero[value_] := Module[{cancelled = Quiet[Check[Cancel[Together[value]], $Failed]]},
      cancelled === 0 || cancelled =!= $Failed && Quiet[Check[RootReduce[cancelled], $Failed]] === 0];
    pivotPositions[value_List] := DeleteCases[Map[Function[row,
      SelectFirst[Range[Length[row]], TrueQ[Abs[row[[#]]] > 10^-25] &, Missing["ZeroRow"]]], value], _Missing];
    order = SortBy[Range[rows], LeafCount[matrix[[#]]] + LeafCount[constant[[#]]] &];
    numbers = Block[{$MaxExtraPrecision = 500}, Quiet[Check[N[matrix[[order]], 40], $Failed]]];
    If[!MatrixQ[numbers, NumberQ], Throw[fallback, tag]];
    maxima = Max[Abs[#]] & /@ numbers;
    numbers = MapThread[If[TrueQ[#2 == 0], #1, #1/#2] &, {numbers, maxima}];
    numbers = Quiet[Check[Chop[RowReduce[Transpose[numbers]], 10^-25], $Failed]];
    If[!MatrixQ[numbers, NumberQ], Throw[fallback, tag]];
    selected = order[[pivotPositions[numbers]]]; rank = Length[selected];
    If[rank === 0,
      zeroRows = Map[exactZero, Append[#, #2] & @@@ MapThread[List, {matrix, constant}], {2}];
      If[!AllTrue[Flatten[zeroRows], TrueQ], Throw[fallback, tag]];
      Throw[<|"Status" -> "UNDERDETERMINED", "SolutionRules" -> {},
        "FreeParameters" -> variables, "Rank" -> 0, "Diagnostics" -> {},
        "AlgebraicBlockCertificate" -> <|"Method" -> "ExactAllZeroRows", "CheckedRows" -> rows,
          "OriginalMatrix" -> matrix, "OriginalConstant" -> constant,
          "AllOriginalRowsVerified" -> True, "UnknownCoordinatesChanged" -> False|>|>, tag]];
    numbers = Quiet[Check[Chop[RowReduce[N[matrix[[selected]], 40]], 10^-25], $Failed]];
    If[!MatrixQ[numbers, NumberQ], Throw[fallback, tag]];
    pivots = pivotPositions[numbers];
    If[Length[pivots] =!= rank || !DuplicateFreeQ[pivots], Throw[fallback, tag]];
    free = Complement[Range[columns], pivots]; square = matrix[[selected, pivots]];
    right = Join[IdentityMatrix[rank], Transpose[{-constant[[selected]]}],
      -matrix[[selected, free]], 2];
    solved = Quiet[Check[RootReduce[LinearSolve[square, right]], $Failed]];
    If[!MatrixQ[solved] || Dimensions[solved] =!= {rank, rank + 1 + Length[free]}, Throw[fallback, tag]];
    inverse = solved[[All, Range[rank]]];
    If[!AllTrue[Flatten[square.inverse - IdentityMatrix[rank]], exactZero], Throw[fallback, tag]];
    block = solved[[All, Range[rank + 1, rank + 1 + Length[free]]]];
    affine = Table[If[MemberQ[pivots, index], block[[First[FirstPosition[pivots, index]]]],
      UnitVector[1 + Length[free], 1 + First[FirstPosition[free, index]]]], {index, columns}];
    certificate = matrix.affine; certificate[[All, 1]] += constant;
    proof = Map[exactZero, certificate, {2}];
    coefficientProof = If[free === {}, True, AllTrue[Flatten[Rest /@ proof], TrueQ]];
    If[!TrueQ[coefficientProof], Throw[fallback, tag]];
    contradiction = SelectFirst[Range[rows], !TrueQ[proof[[#, 1]]] &&
      AssociationQ[completionAlgebraicNonzeroCertificate[certificate[[#, 1]]]] &, Missing["NoContradiction"]];
    If[!AllTrue[Flatten[proof], TrueQ] && MissingQ[contradiction], Throw[fallback, tag]];
    rules = MapThread[Rule, {variables[[pivots]],
      (First[#] + Rest[#].variables[[free]]) & /@ block}];
    <|"Status" -> If[MissingQ[contradiction], If[free === {}, "COMPLETE", "UNDERDETERMINED"], "INCONSISTENT"],
      "SolutionRules" -> If[MissingQ[contradiction], rules, {}],
      "FreeParameters" -> If[MissingQ[contradiction], variables[[free]], variables],
      "Rank" -> rank, "Diagnostics" -> If[MissingQ[contradiction], {},
        {"No correction in the current bounded space satisfies every channel."}],
      "AlgebraicBlockCertificate" -> <|"Method" -> "ExactInverseAndFullAffineReplay",
        "SelectedRows" -> selected, "PivotColumns" -> pivots, "Inverse" -> inverse,
        "AffineMap" -> affine, "CheckedRows" -> rows,
        "OriginalMatrix" -> matrix, "OriginalConstant" -> constant,
        "AllOriginalRowsVerified" -> MissingQ[contradiction], "FullNullspaceVerified" -> True,
        "ContradictionRow" -> contradiction, "UnknownCoordinatesChanged" -> False|>|>
  ], tag];
  TimeConstrained[work[], seconds, fallback]
];

completionSolveLinear[equations_List, unknowns_List, modularSeconds_ : 60] := Module[
  {eqs, arrays, constant, matrix, augmented, reduced, n = Length[unknowns],
   pivots = {}, rules = {}, row, pivot, free, rank, entries, inconsistent = False,
   rightScale = 1, nonzeroConstant, candidateScale, scaledConstant, rationalQ,
   columnScales, column, scaledColumn, firstEntry, j, blockReduction,
   rowUnits, rowNormalization = <||>, annotate, algebraicBlock},
  annotate[report_Association] := Join[report,
    <|"RowNormalization" -> KeyDrop[rowNormalization, "ElapsedTime"]|>];
  If[!NumericQ[modularSeconds] || !TrueQ[0 < modularSeconds < Infinity],
    Return[<|"Status" -> "UNRESOLVED", "SolutionRules" -> {},
      "FreeParameters" -> unknowns, "Rank" -> 0, "Diagnostics" -> {
        "The certified modular solve requires a positive finite remaining time budget."}|>]];
  (* Extract affine rows once. Repeated polynomial tests and common-denominator
     formation over hundreds of unknowns dominate otherwise sparse systems. *)
  eqs = DeleteDuplicates[DeleteCases[equations, 0]];
  arrays = If[n > 0 && AllTrue[eqs, residueFiniteQ],
    Quiet[Check[CoefficientArrays[eqs, unknowns], $Failed]], $Failed];
  If[!ListQ[arrays] || Length[arrays] > 2,
    (* Algebraic zero coefficients can hide an apparent higher degree. Retain
       the original whole-row normalization before rejecting such equations. *)
    eqs = DeleteDuplicates[DeleteCases[Quiet[RootReduce[Numerator[Cancel[Together[#]]]]] & /@
      equations, 0]];
    arrays = $Failed;
    If[AnyTrue[eqs, !residueFiniteQ[#] || !PolynomialQ[#, unknowns] &],
      Return[<|"Status" -> "UNRESOLVED", "SolutionRules" -> {},
        "FreeParameters" -> unknowns, "Rank" -> 0,
        "Diagnostics" -> {"The correction equations are not finite polynomials."}|>]]];
  If[eqs === {}, Return[<|"Status" -> If[n === 0, "COMPLETE", "UNDERDETERMINED"],
    "SolutionRules" -> {}, "FreeParameters" -> unknowns, "Rank" -> 0, "Diagnostics" -> {}|>]];
  If[n === 0, Return[<|"Status" -> If[AnyTrue[eqs,
      highEnergyZeroState[#] === "Nonzero" &], "INCONSISTENT", "UNRESOLVED"],
    "SolutionRules" -> {}, "FreeParameters" -> {}, "Rank" -> 0,
    "Diagnostics" -> {"There are nonzero constraints but no available correction coefficients."}|>]];
  If[arrays === $Failed, arrays = Quiet[Check[CoefficientArrays[eqs, unknowns], $Failed]]];
  If[arrays === $Failed || Length[arrays] > 2,
    Return[<|"Status" -> "UNRESOLVED", "SolutionRules" -> {},
      "FreeParameters" -> unknowns, "Rank" -> 0,
      "Diagnostics" -> {"Correction coefficients must enter linearly."}|>]];
  constant = Normal[First[arrays]];
  matrix = If[Length[arrays] === 1, ConstantArray[0, {Length[eqs], n}], Normal[arrays[[2]]]];
  rowUnits = completionAlgebraicRowUnits[matrix, constant, Min[5, modularSeconds/6]];
  rowNormalization = rowUnits["Normalization"];
  algebraicBlock = completionExactAlgebraicBlockSolve[rowUnits["Matrix"], rowUnits["Constant"], unknowns,
    Min[8, modularSeconds/4]];
  If[AssociationQ[algebraicBlock], Return[annotate[algebraicBlock]]];
  constant = Quiet[RootReduce[rowUnits["Constant"]]];
  matrix = Quiet[RootReduce[rowUnits["Matrix"]]];
  entries = Flatten[{constant, matrix}];
  If[AnyTrue[entries, highEnergyZeroState[#] === "Unknown" &],
    Return[annotate[<|"Status" -> "UNRESOLVED", "SolutionRules" -> {},
      "FreeParameters" -> unknowns, "Rank" -> 0,
      "Diagnostics" -> {"Supply numerical ParameterRules for unresolved masses or couplings in the linear equations."}|>]]];
  (* Remove common algebraic units before exact row reduction, restoring both
     pivot and free-variable scales in the returned original coordinates. *)
  rationalQ[value_] := MatchQ[value, _Integer | _Rational];
  columnScales = ConstantArray[1, n];
  Do[
    column = matrix[[All, j]];
    If[AllTrue[column, rationalQ], Continue[]];
    firstEntry = SelectFirst[column, highEnergyZeroState[#] === "Nonzero" &,
      Missing["ZeroColumn"]];
    If[MissingQ[firstEntry], Continue[]];
    candidateScale = Quiet[Check[Last[FactorTermsList[RootReduce[firstEntry]]], 1]];
    If[candidateScale === 1 || highEnergyZeroState[candidateScale] =!= "Nonzero", Continue[]];
    scaledColumn = Quiet[Check[RootReduce[column/candidateScale], $Failed]];
    If[ListQ[scaledColumn] && AllTrue[scaledColumn, rationalQ],
      matrix[[All, j]] = scaledColumn; columnScales[[j]] = candidateScale],
    {j, n}];
  If[AllTrue[Flatten[matrix], rationalQ],
    nonzeroConstant = SelectFirst[constant, highEnergyZeroState[#] === "Nonzero" &,
      Missing["ZeroRightHandSide"]];
    If[!MissingQ[nonzeroConstant],
      candidateScale = Quiet[Check[Last[FactorTermsList[RootReduce[nonzeroConstant]]], 1]];
      If[candidateScale =!= 1 && highEnergyZeroState[candidateScale] === "Nonzero",
        scaledConstant = Quiet[Check[RootReduce[constant/candidateScale], $Failed]];
        If[ListQ[scaledConstant] && AllTrue[scaledConstant, rationalQ],
          rightScale = candidateScale; constant = scaledConstant]]]];
  augmented = MapThread[Append, {matrix, -constant}];
  blockReduction = If[n >= 64, completionCertifiedModularReduce[matrix, constant, modularSeconds],
    Missing["SmallLinearSystem"]];
  If[AssociationQ[blockReduction] && Lookup[blockReduction, "Status", None] === "INCONSISTENT",
    Return[annotate[<|"Status" -> "INCONSISTENT", "SolutionRules" -> {},
      "FreeParameters" -> unknowns, "Rank" -> blockReduction["Rank"],
      "RankLowerBound" -> Lookup[blockReduction, "RankLowerBound",
        Lookup[blockReduction, "CoefficientRankLowerBound", blockReduction["Rank"]]],
      "InconsistencyCertificate" -> KeyDrop[blockReduction, "Status"],
      "Diagnostics" -> {"No correction in the current bounded space satisfies every channel."}|>]]];
  If[n >= 64 && !AssociationQ[blockReduction],
    blockReduction = completionExactBlockReduce[matrix, constant]];
  reduced = If[AssociationQ[blockReduction], blockReduction["ReducedRows"],
    Quiet[Check[RootReduce[RowReduce[augmented]], $Failed]]];
  If[reduced === $Failed, Return[annotate[<|"Status" -> "UNRESOLVED",
    "SolutionRules" -> {}, "FreeParameters" -> unknowns, "Rank" -> 0,
    "Diagnostics" -> {"Exact row reduction failed."}|>]]];
  Do[
    pivot = SelectFirst[Range[n], highEnergyZeroState[row[[#]]] === "Nonzero" &,
      Missing["NoPivot"]];
    If[MissingQ[pivot],
      If[highEnergyZeroState[Last[row]] === "Nonzero",
        inconsistent = True; Break[]],
      AppendTo[pivots, pivot];
      AppendTo[rules, unknowns[[pivot]] ->
        RootReduce[(rightScale Last[row] -
          Total[Delete[Most[row] columnScales unknowns, pivot]])/
          (row[[pivot]] columnScales[[pivot]])]]],
    {row, reduced}];
  If[inconsistent, Return[annotate[<|"Status" -> "INCONSISTENT", "SolutionRules" -> {},
    "FreeParameters" -> unknowns, "Rank" -> Length[pivots],
    "Diagnostics" -> {"No correction in the current bounded space satisfies every channel."}|>]]];
  free = unknowns[[Complement[Range[n], pivots]]]; rank = Length[pivots];
  annotate[<|"Status" -> If[free === {}, "COMPLETE", "UNDERDETERMINED"],
    "SolutionRules" -> rules, "FreeParameters" -> free, "Rank" -> rank,
    "Diagnostics" -> {}|>]
];

DownValues[completionRefineLinear] = {};
completionRefinementAffineRows[previous_Association, equations_List, seconds_: 10] := Module[
  {rules = Lookup[previous, "SolutionRules", {}], free = Lookup[previous, "FreeParameters", {}],
   original, work, fallback = Missing["NativeAffineSubstitutionRequired"]},
  original = Join[First /@ rules, free];
  If[Length[original] < 64 || equations === {} || !DuplicateFreeQ[original] ||
      !TrueQ[seconds > 0], Return[fallback]];
  work[] := Module[{raw, matrix, constant, units, affine, offsets, transfer,
      mapped, reducedMatrix, reducedConstant, rebuilt, gaussianQ},
    gaussianQ[value_] := MatchQ[value, _Integer | _Rational] || Head[value] === Complex &&
      MatchQ[Re[value], _Integer | _Rational] && MatchQ[Im[value], _Integer | _Rational];
    raw = Quiet[Check[CoefficientArrays[equations, original], $Failed]];
    If[!ListQ[raw] || Length[raw] > 2, Return[fallback]];
    constant = Normal[First[raw]];
    matrix = If[Length[raw] === 1, ConstantArray[0, {Length[equations], Length[original]}], Normal[raw[[2]]]];
    units = completionAlgebraicRowUnits[matrix, constant, Min[5, seconds/2]];
    If[!AllTrue[Flatten[{units["Matrix"], units["Constant"]}], gaussianQ], Return[fallback]];
    mapped = original /. rules;
    affine = Quiet[Check[CoefficientArrays[mapped, free], $Failed]];
    If[!ListQ[affine] || Length[affine] > 2, Return[fallback]];
    offsets = Normal[First[affine]];
    transfer = If[Length[affine] === 1, ConstantArray[0, {Length[original], Length[free]}], Normal[affine[[2]]]];
    If[!AllTrue[Flatten[{offsets, transfer}], gaussianQ], Return[fallback]];
    (* CoefficientArrays is an exact linear decomposition. A degree above one
       was rejected above; its constant and linear arrays therefore certify
       x = offsets + transfer.free without expanding that dense affine family. *)
    reducedMatrix = SparseArray[units["Matrix"]].SparseArray[transfer];
    reducedConstant = units["Constant"] + SparseArray[units["Matrix"]].offsets;
    rebuilt = Normal[reducedMatrix.free + reducedConstant];
    <|"Equations" -> rebuilt,
      "Certificate" -> <|"Method" -> "ExactSparseAffineMatrixComposition",
        "OriginalVariables" -> original, "FreeParameters" -> free,
        "OriginalRowCount" -> Length[equations], "ReducedRowCount" -> Length[rebuilt],
        "AffineMapReconstructionVerified" -> True,
        "AffineMapCertificateMethod" -> "ExactLinearCoefficientArraysDecomposition",
        "AllOriginalEquationsRetained" -> True,
        "UnknownCoordinatesChanged" -> False,
        "RawRowNormalization" -> KeyDrop[units["Normalization"], {"Rows", "ElapsedTime"}],
        "ExactRowUnits" -> Map[KeyDrop[#, {"OriginalAffineRow", "ExactReplay"}] &,
          Lookup[units["Normalization"], "Rows", {}]]|>|>
  ];
  TimeConstrained[work[], seconds, fallback]
];

completionRefineLinear[previous_Association, equations_List, modularSeconds_ : 60] := Module[
  {extension, rank, rankLowerBound, result, affineRows, reducedEquations},
  affineRows = completionRefinementAffineRows[previous, equations, Min[12, modularSeconds/3]];
  reducedEquations = If[AssociationQ[affineRows], affineRows["Equations"],
    equations /. previous["SolutionRules"]];
  extension = completionSolveLinear[reducedEquations,
    previous["FreeParameters"], modularSeconds];
  rank = If[IntegerQ[previous["Rank"]] && IntegerQ[extension["Rank"]],
    previous["Rank"] + extension["Rank"], Missing["NotComputedFromContradictionCertificate"]];
  result = Join[extension, <|"Rank" -> rank,
    "SolutionRules" -> Join[previous["SolutionRules"] /. extension["SolutionRules"],
      extension["SolutionRules"]]|>];
  If[AssociationQ[affineRows], result = Join[result,
    <|"AffineRefinementCertificate" -> affineRows["Certificate"]|>]];
  If[MissingQ[rank],
    rankLowerBound = Lookup[previous, "RankLowerBound", previous["Rank"]] +
      Lookup[extension, "RankLowerBound", extension["Rank"]];
    If[IntegerQ[rankLowerBound], AssociateTo[result, "RankLowerBound" -> rankLowerBound]]];
  result
];

completionCoherentCutChart[saved_Association, rules_List] := Module[
  {chart = saved, spin = {}, vector, originalPole, map, mass, basis},
  Do[
    (* Exact cut identities may use any invertible massive spin frame. A
       diagonal determinant-m frame separates mass radicals by tensor index,
       avoiding artificial number-field mixtures from random frame entries.
       This choice is confined to cut fitting, never high-energy scaling. *)
    mass = chart["Masses"][leg]; basis = {{1,0},{0,mass}};
    AssociateTo[chart["AngleBasis"],leg -> basis];
    AssociateTo[chart["SquareBasis"],leg ->
      ({{0,1},{-1,0}}.residueAdjugate[chart["Momenta"][leg]].basis/mass)];
    vector = {1, Unique["completionSpin"]}; AppendTo[spin, Last[vector]];
    AssociateTo[chart["Angle"], leg -> chart["AngleBasis"][leg].vector];
    AssociateTo[chart["Square"], leg -> chart["SquareBasis"][leg].vector];
    AssociateTo[chart["ExternalSpinVectors"], leg -> vector],
    {leg, Keys[chart["AngleBasis"]]}];
  AssociateTo[chart,"MassiveSpinFrame" -> "DiagonalDeterminantMassExactCut"];
  originalPole = chart["PoleVariable"];
  map = With[{frozenChart = chart, pole = originalPole, parameters = rules},
    Function[{expression, channels, variables},
      If[Length[channels] =!= 1 || Length[variables] =!= 1,
        Missing["AutomaticMultipleCutChartNotImplemented"],
        residueEvaluateChart[expression, frozenChart /. pole -> First[variables], parameters]]]];
  <|"Map" -> map, "Chart" -> chart, "SpinVariables" -> spin, "ParameterRules" -> rules,
    "AutomaticCoherentChart" -> True|>
];

completionCutChart[channel_, sample_, seed_, rules_] := Module[{generated},
  If[!residueNumericMassesQ[channel, rules],
    Return[Failure["UnspecifiedMassParameters", <||>]]];
  generated = residueAutomaticChart[channel, sample, seed, rules];
  If[FailureQ[generated], generated, completionCoherentCutChart[generated["Chart"], rules]]
];

completionSimpleCutEvaluator[channel_Association, chart_Association] := Module[
  {tag = Unique[], pole = Unique["simpleCut"], frozen, parameters, evaluate, primitive,
   evaluateTerm, evaluateExpression},
  If[!TrueQ[Lookup[chart, "AutomaticCoherentChart", False]] ||
      !AssociationQ[Lookup[chart, "Chart", None]] ||
      !ListQ[Lookup[chart, "ParameterRules", None]],
    Return[Missing["SimpleCutRestrictionNotApplicable"]]];
  frozen = chart["Chart"] /. chart["Chart"]["PoleVariable"] -> 0;
  parameters = chart["ParameterRules"];
  evaluate[atom_?NumericQ] := If[residueFiniteQ[atom], atom,
    Throw[Missing["NonfiniteCutAtom"], tag]];
  evaluate[sum_Plus] := Total[evaluate /@ List @@ sum];
  evaluate[product_Times] := Times @@ (evaluate /@ List @@ product);
  evaluate[Power[base_, exponent_Integer]] := Module[{value = evaluate[base]},
    If[exponent < 0 && residueExactZero[value],
      Throw[Missing["SingularCutDenominator"], tag]];
    value^exponent];
  evaluate[Power[momentum_Mom, exponent_Integer?EvenQ]] := primitive[momentum^exponent];
  evaluate[atom:(_SpinorChain | _SpinorTrace | _MomProd | _Mandelstahm)] := primitive[atom];
  evaluate[atom:PropDen[_, _?NumericQ]] := primitive[atom];
  evaluate[Mass[label_Integer]] := primitive[Mass[label]];
  evaluate[_] := Throw[Missing["UnsupportedCutStructure"], tag];
  primitive[atom_] := primitive[atom] = Module[{value},
    (* Composite cut spinors are defined only on the cut, not analytically nearby. *)
    If[!FreeQ[atom,
        Spinor[_, ("Angle" | "Square"), _Multiparticle, ___] |
        Spinor[_, ("Upper" | "Lower"), ("Angle" | "Square"), _Multiparticle, ___]],
      Throw[Missing["CutOnlySpinor"], tag]];
    value = Quiet[residueEvaluateChart[atom, frozen, parameters],
      {Power::infy, Infinity::indet}];
    If[!residueFiniteQ[value] || residueUnmappedQ[value] || ListQ[value],
      Throw[Missing["NonfiniteCutPrimitive"], tag]];
    value];
  evaluateTerm[term_] := Module[{factors, poleFactors, regularFactors, polynomialFactors,
      exponent, value, numeratorValue},
    factors = If[Head[term] === Times, List @@ term, {term}];
    poleFactors = Select[factors, # === pole || (Head[#] === Power &&
      First[#] === pole && IntegerQ[Last[#]]) &];
    regularFactors = Select[factors, FreeQ[#, pole] &];
    polynomialFactors = Select[factors, !FreeQ[#, pole] &&
      !MemberQ[poleFactors, #] && PolynomialQ[#, pole] &];
    exponent = Total[If[# === pole, 1, Last[#]] & /@ poleFactors];
    If[Length[poleFactors] + Length[regularFactors] + Length[polynomialFactors] =!=
        Length[factors] || exponent < -1,
      Throw[Missing["NonmonomialOrHigherOrderCut"], tag]];
    value = evaluate[Times @@ regularFactors];
    If[!residueFiniteQ[value], Throw[Missing["NonfiniteCutCoefficient"], tag]];
    (* Bose projection can leave a polynomial numerator over one explicit
       simple propagator. Its residue needs only the numerator at the cut;
       do not expand the full rational expression or freeze inverse pole
       dependence. Regular inverse factors are still checked above. *)
    numeratorValue = Times @@ Map[Function[factor, Module[{coefficients},
      (* A positive power of the explicit pole can multiply a hidden inverse
         invariant. Check every coefficient before dropping those powers. *)
      coefficients = evaluate /@ CoefficientList[factor, pole];
      If[!AllTrue[coefficients, residueFiniteQ],
        Throw[Missing["NonfiniteCutNumeratorCoefficient"], tag]];
      First[coefficients]]], polynomialFactors];
    If[!residueFiniteQ[numeratorValue],
      Throw[Missing["NonfiniteCutNumerator"], tag]];
    If[exponent === -1, value numeratorValue, 0]];
  evaluateExpression[expression_] := Catch[Module[{canonical, terms, value},
    If[!FreeQ[expression, _xFactor | _xTildeFactor],
      Throw[Missing["ContextDependentCutXFactor"], tag]];
    canonical = residueCanonicalPropagators[expression, channel["ExternalLegs"]] /.
      channel["Propagator"] -> pole;
    canonical = canonical /. parameters;
    terms = If[Head[canonical] === Plus, List @@ canonical, {canonical}];
    (* Supported rational primitives are analytic here only after their frozen
       values are finite and every inverse base is nonzero. Hidden poles fall back. *)
    value = Total[evaluateTerm /@ terms];
    If[residueFiniteQ[value], value, Missing["NonfiniteCutResult"]]], tag];
  Function[expression, evaluateExpression[expression]]
];

(* This structural certificate applies only to a polynomial typed numerator
   divided by explicit propagators and nonkinematic constants. It proves no
   identity between different columns and never removes an affine coordinate. *)
completionComponentPoleProfile[expression_, external_List] := Module[
  {propagators = {}, constants = {}, inverseBase, inverses, keys},
  If[!completionHECovariantScalarQ[expression, external], Return[<|"Supported" -> False|>]];
  inverseBase[propagator_PropDen] := If[Length[propagator] === 2,
    AppendTo[propagators, propagator]; True, False];
  inverseBase[product_Times] := AllTrue[List @@ product, inverseBase];
  inverseBase[Power[base_, exponent_Integer?Positive]] := inverseBase[base];
  inverseBase[base_] := If[FreeQ[base,
      _Spinor | _SpinorChain | _SpinorTrace | _Mom | _MomProd | _PropDen | _Mandelstahm],
    AppendTo[constants, base]; True, False];
  inverses = Cases[{expression}, Power[base_, exponent_] /;
    !TrueQ[NumericQ[exponent] && exponent >= 0] :> {base, exponent}, Infinity];
  If[!AllTrue[inverses, IntegerQ[Last[#]] && Last[#] < 0 && inverseBase[First[#]] &],
    Return[<|"Supported" -> False|>]];
  propagators = DeleteDuplicates[propagators];
  keys = residuePropagatorKey[#, external] & /@ propagators;
  If[AnyTrue[keys, MissingQ], Return[<|"Supported" -> False|>]];
  <|"Supported" -> True, "Propagators" -> propagators, "PropagatorKeys" -> keys,
    "InverseConstants" -> DeleteDuplicates[constants],
    "Method" -> "TypedPolynomialNumeratorAndExplicitInverseInventory"|>
];

completionComponentPoleProfiles[components_List, external_List, seconds_: 5] := Module[
  {checkpoint = ConstantArray[<|"Supported" -> False|>, Length[components]], profile, value},
  (* Small batches already have a cheap exact path. A timed-out precomputation
     leaves each unfinished coordinate on that original path. *)
  If[Length[components] < 8 || !TrueQ[seconds > 0] || LeafCount[components] > 3000000,
    Return[checkpoint]];
  profile[expression_] := profile[expression] = completionComponentPoleProfile[expression, external];
  TimeConstrained[MemoryConstrained[
    Do[value = profile[components[[index]]]; checkpoint[[index]] = value,
      {index, Length[components]}], 268435456, Null], seconds, Null];
  checkpoint
];

completionCutRegularityEvaluator[channel_Association, chart_Association] := Module[
  {key, frozen, spinorData, propagatorNonzero, constantNonzero, sameKey, regular},
  If[!TrueQ[Lookup[chart, "AutomaticCoherentChart", False]] ||
      !AssociationQ[Lookup[chart, "Chart", None]] || !ListQ[Lookup[chart, "ParameterRules", None]],
    Return[Function[profile, False]]];
  key = residueChannelKey[channel];
  frozen = Quiet[chart["Chart"] /. chart["Chart"]["PoleVariable"] -> 0,
    {Power::infy, Infinity::indet}];
  (* Current automatic charts have regular spinor coordinates. Saved/future
     charts must satisfy that same contract before polynomial numerators can
     be declared analytic without evaluating each of their chains. *)
  If[!AllTrue[Lookup[frozen, {"Angle", "Square", "AngleBasis", "SquareBasis"}, <||>], AssociationQ],
    Return[Function[profile, False]]];
  spinorData = Flatten[Values /@ Lookup[frozen,
    {"Angle", "Square", "AngleBasis", "SquareBasis"}, <||>], 1];
  If[!residueFiniteQ[spinorData] || residueUnmappedQ[spinorData] ||
      !FreeQ[spinorData, _Missing | _Failure], Return[Function[profile, False]]];
  sameKey[propagatorKey_] := sameKey[propagatorKey] = TrueQ[
    First[propagatorKey] === First[key] && residueExactZero[Last[propagatorKey]^2 - Last[key]^2]];
  propagatorNonzero[propagator_] := propagatorNonzero[propagator] = Module[{value},
    value = residueEvaluateChart[propagator, frozen, chart["ParameterRules"]];
    residueFiniteQ[value] && !residueUnmappedQ[value] && highEnergyZeroState[value] === "Nonzero"];
  constantNonzero[constant_] := constantNonzero[constant] = With[
    {value = constant /. chart["ParameterRules"]}, NumericQ[value] &&
      residueFiniteQ[value] && highEnergyZeroState[value] === "Nonzero"];
  regular[profile_Association] := TrueQ[Lookup[profile, "Supported", False]] &&
    ListQ[Lookup[profile, "Propagators", None]] && ListQ[Lookup[profile, "PropagatorKeys", None]] &&
    ListQ[Lookup[profile, "InverseConstants", None]] &&
    Length[profile["Propagators"]] === Length[profile["PropagatorKeys"]] &&
    !AnyTrue[profile["PropagatorKeys"], sameKey] &&
    AllTrue[profile["InverseConstants"], constantNonzero] &&
    AllTrue[profile["Propagators"], propagatorNonzero];
  regular[_] := False;
  Function[profile, regular[profile]]
];

(* Evaluate a linear correction term by term before combining its coefficients.
   Keeping fit symbols out of the rational kinematic restriction avoids large
   intermediate denominators without changing the residue equations. *)
completionLinearResidue[components_List, unknowns_List, channel_Association,
    targets_List, chart_Association, seconds_, profiles_: Automatic] := Module[
  {initial, residues, invalid, additive = TrueQ[Lookup[chart, "AutomaticCoherentChart", False]],
   restriction, cachedRestriction, exactNumericQ, component, base, simpleEvaluator,
   restrictionMethods = {}, componentProfiles, regularityEvaluator},
  initial = PhysicalPoleResidue[If[additive, 0, First[components]], channel,
    "KinematicMap" -> chart["Map"], "KinematicKind" -> "Symbolic",
    "StructuralCoefficient" -> False,
    "TimeConstraint" -> seconds, "UncutChannels" -> targets];
  If[!AssociationQ[initial] || FailureQ[initial] ||
      Lookup[initial, "Status", None] =!= "PASS", Return[initial]];
  simpleEvaluator = completionSimpleCutEvaluator[channel, chart];
  componentProfiles = If[additive,
    If[ListQ[profiles] && Length[profiles] === Length[components], profiles,
      completionComponentPoleProfiles[components, channel["ExternalLegs"], Min[5, seconds/10]]], {}];
  regularityEvaluator = completionCutRegularityEvaluator[channel, chart];
  (* The chart and cut are identical for every direction. Validate them once,
     but still require each component's pole restriction to be regular. *)
  cachedRestriction[expression_] := cachedRestriction[expression] = residueOnChart[expression,
    initial["Channels"], initial["PoleVariables"], chart["Map"],
    Range[Length[initial["Channels"]]]];
  exactNumericQ[factor_] := NumericQ[factor] && Precision[factor] === Infinity &&
    residueFiniteQ[factor];
  restriction[expression_] := Module[{factors, numeric, body, value},
    factors = If[Head[expression] === Times, List @@ expression, {expression}];
    numeric = Times @@ Select[factors, exactNumericQ];
    body = Times @@ Select[factors, !exactNumericQ[#] &];
    value = cachedRestriction[body];
    If[MissingQ[value], value, numeric value]];
  component[expression_, profile_] := TimeConstrained[Module[{values = {}, value, failed = False},
    If[TrueQ[regularityEvaluator[profile]],
      AppendTo[restrictionMethods, "TypedRegularNoSelectedPole"]; Return[0]];
    If[Head[simpleEvaluator] === Function,
      value = simpleEvaluator[expression];
      If[!MissingQ[value], AppendTo[restrictionMethods, "FrozenAutomaticSimplePole"];
        Return[value]]];
    AppendTo[restrictionMethods, "ExactMappedRestriction"];
    (* Cut x factors use the whole component's internal-spinor inventory. *)
    If[Head[expression] =!= Plus || !FreeQ[expression, _xFactor | _xTildeFactor],
      Return[restriction[expression]]];
    (* Individually singular terms may cancel. Only the original whole
       restriction may decide regularity when additivity cannot establish it. *)
    Do[value = restriction[term];
      If[MissingQ[value], failed = True; Break[]];
      AppendTo[values, value], {term, List @@ expression}];
    If[failed, restriction[expression], Total[values]]],
    seconds, Missing["Timeout"]];
  residues = If[additive, MapThread[component, {components, componentProfiles}],
    TimeConstrained[residueOnChart[#, initial["Channels"],
        initial["PoleVariables"], chart["Map"], Range[Length[initial["Channels"]]]],
      seconds, Missing["Timeout"]] & /@ Rest[components]];
  invalid = SelectFirst[residues, MissingQ, None];
  If[invalid =!= None, Return[Join[initial, <|"Status" -> "UNRESOLVED",
    "PhysicalResidue" -> invalid, "Diagnostics" -> {invalid}|>]]];
  base = If[additive, First[residues], initial["PhysicalResidue"]];
  Join[initial, <|"ComponentRestrictionMethods" -> If[additive, restrictionMethods,
      ConstantArray["WholeCustomMap", Length[components]]],
    "StructurallyRegularComponents" -> Count[restrictionMethods, "TypedRegularNoSelectedPole"],
    "ComponentCoordinatesPreserved" -> True, "PhysicalResidue" -> base +
    If[unknowns === {}, 0, unknowns.If[additive, Rest[residues], residues]]|>]
];

(* An individual correction direction may contain a higher pole that cancels
   only in the affine combination. Constrain its complete principal part,
   rather than dropping the column or substituting into its denominator.
   The known channel residue must itself have a regular finite restriction. *)
completionLaurentResidueConstraints[components_List, unknowns_List, channel_Association,
    chart_Association, initial_Association, seconds_] := Module[
  {variables, pole, channels, mapped, rational, numerator, denominator, order,
   regularDenominator, expected, difference, coefficients, equations, result,
   quotientCoefficients = {}, constantDenominator, finiteResidue},
  variables = Lookup[initial, "PoleVariables", {}]; channels = Lookup[initial, "Channels", {}];
  If[Length[variables] =!= 1 || Length[channels] =!= 1 ||
      !TrueQ[Lookup[Lookup[initial, "KinematicChecks", <||>], "Valid", False]],
    Return[Missing["LaurentChartNotSupported"]]];
  pole = First[variables];
  result = TimeConstrained[
    expected = residueOnChart[channel["StateSum"], {channel}, {pole}, chart["Map"], {}];
    If[MissingQ[expected] || !residueFiniteQ[expected] || residueUnmappedQ[expected],
      Return[Missing["NonregularExpectedResidue"]]];
    mapped = Quiet[chart["Map"][#, channels, variables], {Power::infy, Infinity::indet}] & /@ components;
    If[AnyTrue[mapped, MissingQ[#] || !residueFiniteQ[#] || residueUnmappedQ[#] &],
      Return[Missing["UnsupportedLaurentComponent"]]];
    rational = Cancel[Together[pole (Prepend[unknowns, 1].mapped)]];
    {numerator, denominator} = NumeratorDenominator[rational];
    If[!PolynomialQ[numerator, pole] || !PolynomialQ[denominator, pole] ||
        residueExactZero[denominator] || !FreeQ[denominator, Alternatives @@ unknowns],
      Return[Missing["NonrationalLaurentComponent"]]];
    order = Min[First[First[#]] & /@ CoefficientRules[denominator, {pole}]];
    regularDenominator = Cancel[denominator/pole^order];
    If[residueExactZero[regularDenominator /. pole -> 0], Return[Missing["InvalidLaurentValuation"]]];
    difference = Expand[numerator - pole^order regularDenominator expected];
    coefficients = Table[Coefficient[difference, pole, degree], {degree, 0, order}];
    equations = completionCoefficientEquations[#, chart["SpinVariables"], unknowns] & /@ coefficients;
    If[AnyTrue[equations, FailureQ], Return[Missing["NonlinearLaurentConstraints"]]];
    constantDenominator = regularDenominator /. pole -> 0;
    Do[AppendTo[quotientCoefficients, Cancel[(Coefficient[numerator,pole,degree] -
      Total[Table[Coefficient[regularDenominator,pole,index] quotientCoefficients[[degree-index+1]],
        {index,1,degree}]])/constantDenominator]], {degree,0,order}];
    finiteResidue = Last[quotientCoefficients];
    <|"Status" -> "COMPLETE", "Equations" -> DeleteDuplicates[Flatten[equations]],
      "PrincipalPartEquations" -> DeleteDuplicates[Flatten[Most[equations]]],
      "Difference" -> difference, "PoleVariables" -> variables,
      "PoleStrippedDenominatorOrder" -> order, "SelectedPoleOrder" -> order + 1,
      "MappedPoleStrippedExpression" -> rational, "FiniteResidue" -> finiteResidue,
      "ExpectedResidue" -> expected, "ConstraintMethod" -> "ExactRationalLaurent"|>,
    seconds, Missing["LaurentConstraintTimeout"]];
  result
];

(* A sample retains the complete pole inventory, including zero-residue
   obligations. Its chart seed depends only on the original channel/sample. *)
completionConstraintSample[components_List, unknowns_List, targets_List,
    job_List, seed_Integer, rules_List, seconds_, deadline_, profiles_: Automatic] := Module[
  {channel = targets[[First[job]]], sample = Last[job], chart, result,
   expected, difference, coefficients, variable, remaining, completed, laurent, tag = Unique["completionSample"]},
  If[!TrueQ[Lookup[channel, "Complete", False]] ||
      MissingQ[Lookup[channel, "StateSum", Missing[]]],
    Return[<|"Status" -> "UNRESOLVED", "Diagnostics" -> {
      "A required factorization channel is incomplete."}|>]];
  remaining = If[deadline === Infinity, Infinity, Max[0, deadline - AbsoluteTime[]]];
  completed = TimeConstrained[Catch[
    Do[
      chart = completionCutChart[channel, sample + 4 attempt,
        seed + 104729 attempt, rules];
      If[FailureQ[chart], Continue[]];
      result = completionLinearResidue[components, unknowns, channel, targets, chart, seconds, profiles];
      If[!AssociationQ[result], Continue[]];
      If[result["Status"] =!= "PASS",
        laurent = completionLaurentResidueConstraints[components, unknowns, channel, chart, result, seconds];
        If[AssociationQ[laurent] && Lookup[laurent, "Status", None] === "COMPLETE",
          Throw[<|"Status" -> "COMPLETE", "Equations" -> laurent["Equations"],
            "Sample" -> Join[<|"Cut" -> channel["Cut"], "Sample" -> sample, "Chart" -> chart["Chart"]|>,
              KeyTake[laurent, {"Difference", "ConstraintMethod", "SelectedPoleOrder", "PoleStrippedDenominatorOrder"}]],
            "Diagnostics" -> {}|>, tag]];
        Continue[]];
      variable = First[result["PoleVariables"]];
      expected = residueOnChart[channel["StateSum"], {channel}, {variable}, chart["Map"], {}];
      If[!residueFiniteQ[expected] || residueUnmappedQ[expected], Continue[]];
      difference = result["PhysicalResidue"] - expected;
      coefficients = completionCoefficientEquations[difference, chart["SpinVariables"], unknowns];
      If[FailureQ[coefficients], Continue[]];
      Throw[<|"Status" -> "COMPLETE", "Equations" -> coefficients,
        "Sample" -> <|"Cut" -> channel["Cut"], "Sample" -> sample,
          "Chart" -> chart["Chart"], "Difference" -> difference|>,
        "Diagnostics" -> {}|>, tag], {attempt, 0, 5}];
    False, tag], remaining, False];
  If[AssociationQ[completed], Return[completed]];
  <|"Status" -> "UNRESOLVED", "Diagnostics" -> {
    If[remaining === 0 || !TrueQ[completed],
      "A regular exact cut chart could not supply all correction equations within TimeConstraint.",
      "A regular exact cut chart could not supply all correction equations."]}|>
];

(* A cold worker pool is worthwhile for a substantial exact-sample batch.
   Short probes may abort and release their workers; the next large fit must
   not silently remain serial merely because that probe emptied the pool. *)
completionWarmOnlyQ[jobs_List, unknowns_List, components_List] :=
  Length[jobs] < 16 || Length[unknowns] < 8 && LeafCount[components] < 5000;

completionResidueConstraints[trial_, unknowns_List, normalized_Association,
    samples_Integer, seed_Integer, rules_List, seconds_, callback_, enabled_] := Module[
  {targets = completionTargets[normalized["Targets"]], components, jobs, worker, run,
   results, valid, equations, used, diagnostics, started = AbsoluteTime[], deadline, settings, completedSamples = 0,
   componentProfiles},
  components = completionLinearComponents[trial, unknowns, False];
  componentProfiles = completionComponentPoleProfiles[components,
    Cases[normalized["ExternalMassRules"], HoldPattern[Mass[leg_Integer] -> _] :> leg], Min[5, seconds/10]];
  jobs = Tuples[{Range[Length[targets]], Range[samples]}];
  deadline = If[seconds === Infinity, Infinity, started + seconds];
  settings = If[AssociationQ[$completionParallelSettings], $completionParallelSettings,
    <|"Parallelization" -> False, "MaxKernels" -> Automatic|>];
  worker = With[{c = components, u = unknowns, t = targets, se = seed,
      r = rules, sec = seconds, until = deadline, profiles = componentProfiles},
    Function[job, completionConstraintSample[c, u, t, job, se, r, sec, until, profiles]]];
  run = TimeConstrained[amplitudeParallelMap[worker, jobs,
      Join[settings, <|"WarmOnly" -> completionWarmOnlyQ[jobs, unknowns, components]|>], Function[{result, index, total},
        completedSamples++;
        completionProgress[callback, enabled, <|"Stage" -> "Factorization samples",
          "Completed" -> completedSamples, "Total" -> Length[jobs],
          "Cut" -> targets[[First[jobs[[index]]]]]["Cut"],
          "Unknowns" -> Length[unknowns], "Elapsed" -> AbsoluteTime[] - started|>]]],
    seconds, $TimedOut];
  results = If[AssociationQ[run], Lookup[run, "Results", {}], {}];
  valid = Select[results, AssociationQ[#] && Lookup[#, "Status", None] === "COMPLETE" &];
  equations = Flatten[Lookup[valid, "Equations", {}], 1];
  used = Lookup[valid, "Sample", {}];
  diagnostics = DeleteDuplicates[Flatten[Lookup[Select[results, AssociationQ], "Diagnostics", {}], 1]];
  If[Length[valid] =!= Length[jobs], AppendTo[diagnostics,
    "Factorization equation construction did not complete every exact sample within TimeConstraint."]];
  completionProgress[callback, enabled, <|"Stage" -> "Factorization constraints",
    "Completed" -> Count[Partition[Map[
      AssociationQ[#] && Lookup[#, "Status", None] === "COMPLETE" &, results], samples],
      values_ /; AllTrue[values, TrueQ]],
    "Total" -> Length[targets], "Unknowns" -> Length[unknowns],
    "Elapsed" -> AbsoluteTime[] - started|>];
  <|"Status" -> If[diagnostics === {} && Length[used] === Length[jobs],
      "COMPLETE", "UNRESOLVED"], "Equations" -> equations, "Samples" -> used,
    "Execution" -> If[AssociationQ[run], Lookup[run, "Execution", <||>],
      <|"Mode" -> "Interrupted", "Diagnostics" -> {"The stage time limit interrupted sample dispatch."}|>],
    "Diagnostics" -> diagnostics|>
];

completionCanonicalReduce[expression_, massRules_List] := Module[{externalRules, external, continued},
  externalRules = Select[massRules, MatchQ[#, HoldPattern[Mass[_Integer] -> _]] &];
  external = Sort[Cases[externalRules, HoldPattern[Mass[i_Integer] -> _] :> i]];
  continued = factorizationContinueInternalSpinors[expression, externalRules];
  If[FailureQ[continued], continued = expression];
  withProtectedPropagators[
    residueCanonicalPropagators[continued /. externalRules, external], Cancel]
];

(* Ordinary external identities only; diagram-local shell rules never enter here. *)
completionExternalReduce[expression_, massRules_List] := Module[
  {externalRules, external, result, momentum},
  externalRules = Select[massRules, MatchQ[#, HoldPattern[Mass[_Integer] -> _]] &];
  external = Sort[Cases[externalRules, HoldPattern[Mass[i_Integer] -> _] :> i]];
  momentum[index_Multiparticle] := Module[{legs = Sort[List @@ index], complement},
    If[!VectorQ[legs, IntegerQ] || !DuplicateFreeQ[legs] ||
        Complement[legs, external] =!= {}, Return[Mom[index]]];
    complement = Complement[external, legs];
    If[Length[complement] < Length[legs],
      -Total[Mom /@ complement], Total[Mom /@ legs]]];
  result = residueCanonicalPropagators[expression, external];
  (* Expand vector sums only in contractions. Otherwise ordinary Expand
     would multiply momentum symbols as scalars inside a Lorentz square. *)
  result = withProtectedPropagators[result, Function[body,
    ReduceSpinorProducts[body /. {
      chain_SpinorChain :> (chain /. Mom[index_Multiparticle] :> momentum[index]),
      trace_SpinorTrace :> (trace /. Mom[index_Multiparticle] :> momentum[index])}] /. externalRules]];
  result = canonicalChains[result];
  withProtectedPropagators[result, Cancel]
];

completionPhysicalCoverageQ[rows_List, targets_List] :=
  ContainsAll[residueChannelKey /@ rows, residueChannelKey /@ targets];

completionPhysicalPassQ[report_, targets_: Automatic] := AssociationQ[report] && !FailureQ[report] &&
  ListQ[Lookup[report, "Channels", None]] &&
  AllTrue[report["Channels"], AssociationQ[#] && Lookup[#, "Status", None] === "PASS" &] &&
  (targets === Automatic || completionPhysicalCoverageQ[report["Channels"], targets]);

(* Reuse the exact momenta that supplied each held-out comparison, checking all
   massive-spin components before adding its equations to a later fit. *)
completionValidationConstraints[trial_, unknowns_List, normalized_Association,
    reports_List, seconds_] := Module[
  {equations = {}, used = {}, diagnostics = {}, targets = normalized["Targets"],
   rows, matching, channel, chart, calculation, variable, expected, difference,
   coefficients, rules, saved, components, componentProfiles, laurent, tag = Unique["completionValidation"]},
  components = completionLinearComponents[trial, unknowns, False];
  componentProfiles = completionComponentPoleProfiles[components,
    Cases[normalized["ExternalMassRules"], HoldPattern[Mass[leg_Integer] -> _] :> leg], Min[5, seconds/10]];
  Catch[
    If[reports === {} && targets =!= {}, Throw[False, tag]];
    Do[
      rules = entry["ParameterRules"];
      If[!AssociationQ[entry["Report"]] || FailureQ[entry["Report"]],
        Throw[False, tag]];
      rows = Lookup[entry["Report"], "Channels", None];
      If[!ListQ[rows] || !AllTrue[rows, AssociationQ] ||
          !completionPhysicalCoverageQ[rows, targets], Throw[False, tag]];
      Do[
        matching = Lookup[row, "FactorizationChannels", None];
        If[!ListQ[matching] || matching === {} || !AllTrue[matching,
            TrueQ[Lookup[#, "Complete", False]] && KeyExistsQ[#, "StateSum"] &],
          Throw[False, tag]];
        channel = Join[First[matching], <|"StateSum" -> Total[Lookup[matching, "StateSum"]]|>];
        If[!ListQ[Lookup[row, "Samples", None]] || row["Samples"] === {} ||
            !AllTrue[row["Samples"], AssociationQ], Throw[False, tag]];
        Do[
          saved = Lookup[sample, "Kinematics", None];
          If[!AssociationQ[saved], Throw[False, tag]];
          chart = completionCoherentCutChart[saved, rules];
          calculation = completionLinearResidue[components, unknowns, channel, targets, chart, seconds, componentProfiles];
          If[!AssociationQ[calculation] || FailureQ[calculation], Throw[False, tag]];
          laurent = None;
          If[Lookup[calculation,"Status",None] =!= "PASS",
            laurent = completionLaurentResidueConstraints[components,unknowns,channel,chart,calculation,seconds];
            If[!AssociationQ[laurent] || Lookup[laurent,"Status",None] =!= "COMPLETE", Throw[False,tag]]];
          variable = First[calculation["PoleVariables"]];
          expected = If[AssociationQ[laurent],laurent["ExpectedResidue"],
            residueOnChart[channel["StateSum"], {channel}, {variable}, chart["Map"], {}]];
          difference = If[AssociationQ[laurent],laurent["FiniteResidue"],calculation["PhysicalResidue"]] - expected;
          If[!residueFiniteQ[difference] || residueUnmappedQ[difference], Throw[False, tag]];
          coefficients = If[AssociationQ[laurent],laurent["Equations"],
            completionCoefficientEquations[difference, chart["SpinVariables"], unknowns]];
          If[FailureQ[coefficients], Throw[False, tag]];
          equations = Join[equations, coefficients];
          AppendTo[used, <|"Cut" -> channel["Cut"],
            "Sample" -> Lookup[sample, "SampleIndex", Length[used] + 1],
            "RandomSeed" -> entry["RandomSeed"], "ParameterRules" -> rules,
            "Chart" -> chart["Chart"], "Difference" -> difference|>],
          {sample, row["Samples"]}], {row, rows}], {entry, reports}]; True,
    tag, (AppendTo[diagnostics,
      "A held-out comparison did not provide regular exact equations for refinement."]; False) &];
  <|"Status" -> If[diagnostics === {}, "COMPLETE", "UNRESOLVED"],
    "Equations" -> equations, "Samples" -> used, "Diagnostics" -> diagnostics|>
];

(* Restrict the original sparse components before inserting a dense fitted
   solution. The same held-out samples certify the candidate and affine family
   and supply raw equations for another fit, without remapping that family. *)
completionSparseValueState[value_, variables_List] := Module[{values, states},
  If[!residueFiniteQ[value] || residueUnmappedQ[value], Return["Unknown"]];
  values = completionCoefficientEquations[value, variables];
  If[FailureQ[values], Return["Unknown"]];
  states = highEnergyZeroState /@ values;
  Which[MemberQ[states, "Nonzero"], "Nonzero",
    AllTrue[states, # === "Zero" &], "Zero", True, "Unknown"]
];

completionSparseValidationSample[components_List, unknowns_List, targets_List,
    job_List, solutionRules_List, candidateRules_List, free_List, zeroFree_List,
    seed_Integer, rules_List, seconds_, deadline_, profiles_: Automatic] := Module[
  {channel = targets[[First[job]]], sample = Last[job], chart, calculation, variable,
   expected, difference, coefficients, candidateDifference, candidateResidue, opposite,
   candidateState, oppositeState, signs, status, familyCoefficients, oneFamilyPass,
   pointRules, familyCoordinates, familyRows,
   result, remaining, completed, laurent, tag = Unique["completionHeldOutSample"]},
  If[!TrueQ[Lookup[channel, "Complete", False]] ||
      MissingQ[Lookup[channel, "StateSum", Missing[]]],
    Return[<|"Status" -> "UNRESOLVED", "Diagnostics" -> {
      "A required factorization channel is incomplete."}|>]];
  remaining = If[deadline === Infinity, Infinity, Max[0, deadline - AbsoluteTime[]]];
  completed = TimeConstrained[Catch[
    (* Collapse the affine coefficient map at the candidate point before
       inserting it into a large residue. This is the same substitution order
       without first distributing hundreds of still-free coefficients. *)
    pointRules = Thread[unknowns -> ((unknowns /. solutionRules) /. candidateRules)];
    familyCoordinates = DeleteDuplicates[Join[free, zeroFree]];
    Do[
      chart = completionCutChart[channel, sample + 4 attempt,
        seed + 104729 attempt, rules];
      If[FailureQ[chart], Continue[]];
      calculation = completionLinearResidue[components, unknowns, channel, targets, chart, seconds, profiles];
      If[!AssociationQ[calculation] || FailureQ[calculation], Continue[]];
      laurent = None;
      If[Lookup[calculation,"Status",None] =!= "PASS",
        laurent = completionLaurentResidueConstraints[components,unknowns,channel,chart,calculation,seconds];
        If[!AssociationQ[laurent] || Lookup[laurent,"Status",None] =!= "COMPLETE", Continue[]]];
      variable = First[calculation["PoleVariables"]];
      expected = If[AssociationQ[laurent],laurent["ExpectedResidue"],
        residueOnChart[channel["StateSum"], {channel}, {variable}, chart["Map"], {}]];
      If[!residueFiniteQ[expected] || residueUnmappedQ[expected], Continue[]];
      difference = If[AssociationQ[laurent],laurent["FiniteResidue"],calculation["PhysicalResidue"]] - expected;
      coefficients = If[AssociationQ[laurent],laurent["Equations"],
        completionCoefficientEquations[difference, chart["SpinVariables"], unknowns]];
      If[FailureQ[coefficients], Continue[]];
      candidateDifference = If[AssociationQ[laurent],
        residueRegularRestriction[laurent["MappedPoleStrippedExpression"] /. pointRules,
          {variable}] - expected, difference /. pointRules];
      If[!residueFiniteQ[candidateDifference] || residueUnmappedQ[candidateDifference], Continue[]];
      candidateResidue = expected + candidateDifference;
      opposite = candidateResidue + expected;
      candidateState = completionSparseValueState[candidateDifference, chart["SpinVariables"]];
      oppositeState = completionSparseValueState[opposite, chart["SpinVariables"]];
      signs = Pick[{1, -1}, (# === "Zero" &) /@ {candidateState, oppositeState}];
      status = Which[candidateState === "Zero", "PASS", oppositeState === "Zero", "Opp Sign",
        candidateState === "Nonzero", "FAIL", True, "UNRESOLVED"];
      familyRows = completionRefinementAffineRows[
        <|"SolutionRules" -> solutionRules, "FreeParameters" -> familyCoordinates|>,
        coefficients, Min[5, If[deadline === Infinity, Infinity,
          Max[0, deadline - AbsoluteTime[]]]]];
      familyCoefficients = If[AssociationQ[familyRows], familyRows["Equations"],
        coefficients /. solutionRules] /. Thread[zeroFree -> 0];
      oneFamilyPass = AllTrue[familyCoefficients, completionPolynomialZeroQ[#, free] &];
      result = <|"Cut" -> channel["Cut"], "Mass" -> channel["Mass"],
        "SampleIndex" -> sample, "ChartSampleIndex" -> sample + 4 attempt,
        "Attempt" -> attempt + 1, "RandomSeed" -> seed, "ParameterRules" -> rules,
        "Status" -> status, "CalculatedResidue" -> candidateResidue,
        "ExpectedResidue" -> expected, "Difference" -> candidateDifference,
        "OppositeSignDifference" -> opposite, "MatchingSigns" -> signs,
        "FamilyPass" -> oneFamilyPass, "Kinematics" -> chart["Chart"],
        "KinematicChecks" -> calculation["KinematicChecks"], "SpinVariables" -> chart["SpinVariables"],
        "Method" -> "ExactSparseComponentCutValidation",
        "Scope" -> "SampledCutAllCoherentMassiveSpinComponents", "Diagnostics" -> {}|>;
      If[AssociationQ[familyRows], result = Join[result,
        <|"AffineFamilyValidationCertificate" -> familyRows["Certificate"]|>]];
      If[AssociationQ[laurent],result=Join[result,<|
        "ConstraintMethod"->"ExactRationalLaurent",
        "PrincipalPartCancellationVerified"->True,
        "PrincipalPartCertificate"-><|"PoleVariable"->variable,
          "PoleStrippedDenominatorOrder"->laurent["PoleStrippedDenominatorOrder"],
          "OriginalAffinePrincipalEquations"->laurent["PrincipalPartEquations"],
          "CandidatePrincipalEquations"->(laurent["PrincipalPartEquations"] /. pointRules),
          "WholeCandidateRegularResidue"->candidateResidue,
          "RegularityMethod"->"CancelWholeFittedRationalExpressionBeforeRestrictingCut",
          "FamilyAllConstraintsVerified"->oneFamilyPass|>|>]];
      Throw[<|"Status" -> "COMPLETE", "Result" -> result, "Equations" -> coefficients,
        "Sample" -> <|"Cut" -> channel["Cut"], "Mass" -> channel["Mass"],
          "Sample" -> sample, "RandomSeed" -> seed, "ParameterRules" -> rules,
          "Chart" -> chart["Chart"], "SpinVariables" -> chart["SpinVariables"],
          "Difference" -> difference|>, "FamilyPass" -> oneFamilyPass, "Diagnostics" -> {}|>, tag],
      {attempt, 0, 5}]; False, tag], remaining, False];
  If[AssociationQ[completed], Return[completed]];
  <|"Status" -> "UNRESOLVED", "Diagnostics" -> {
    "A regular exact held-out cut chart could not validate all sparse correction components within TimeConstraint."}|>
];

completionSparseValidation[trial_, unknowns_List, solution_Association,
    free_List, zeroFree_List, normalized_Association, samples_Integer,
    seed_Integer, rules_List, seconds_, callback_, enabled_] := Module[
  {targets = completionTargets[normalized["Targets"]], components, rows, jobs, worker, run,
   results, valid, equations, used, diagnostics, familyPass, sampleRows, rowSigns, status,
   summary, report, feedback, started = AbsoluteTime[], deadline, settings, candidateRules, completedSamples = 0,
   componentProfiles},
  components = completionLinearComponents[trial, unknowns, False];
  componentProfiles = completionComponentPoleProfiles[components,
    Cases[normalized["ExternalMassRules"], HoldPattern[Mass[leg_Integer] -> _] :> leg], Min[5, seconds/10]];
  candidateRules = Thread[Lookup[solution, "FreeParameters", {}] -> 0];
  jobs = Tuples[{Range[Length[targets]], Range[samples]}];
  deadline = If[seconds === Infinity, Infinity, started + seconds];
  settings = If[AssociationQ[$completionParallelSettings], $completionParallelSettings,
    <|"Parallelization" -> False, "MaxKernels" -> Automatic|>];
  worker = With[{c = components, u = unknowns, t = targets,
      sol = solution["SolutionRules"], cand = candidateRules, f = free, z = zeroFree,
      se = seed, r = rules, sec = seconds, until = deadline, profiles = componentProfiles},
    Function[job, completionSparseValidationSample[c, u, t, job, sol, cand, f, z, se, r, sec, until, profiles]]];
  run = TimeConstrained[amplitudeParallelMap[worker, jobs,
      Join[settings, <|"WarmOnly" -> completionWarmOnlyQ[jobs, unknowns, components]|>], Function[{result, index, total},
        completedSamples++;
        completionProgress[callback, enabled, <|"Stage" -> "Validating sparse factorization samples",
          "Completed" -> completedSamples, "Total" -> Length[jobs],
          "Cut" -> targets[[First[jobs[[index]]]]]["Cut"],
          "Unknowns" -> Length[free], "Elapsed" -> AbsoluteTime[] - started|>]]],
    seconds, $TimedOut];
  results = If[AssociationQ[run], Lookup[run, "Results", {}], {}];
  valid = Select[results, AssociationQ[#] && Lookup[#, "Status", None] === "COMPLETE" &];
  equations = Flatten[Lookup[valid, "Equations", {}], 1];
  used = Lookup[valid, "Sample", {}];
  diagnostics = DeleteDuplicates[Flatten[Lookup[Select[results, AssociationQ], "Diagnostics", {}], 1]];
  If[Length[valid] =!= Length[jobs], AppendTo[diagnostics,
    "Sparse held-out validation did not complete every exact sample within TimeConstraint."]];
  familyPass = AllTrue[valid, TrueQ[Lookup[#, "FamilyPass", False]] &];
  rows = MapIndexed[Function[{channel, position},
    sampleRows = If[Length[results] < (First[position] - 1) samples + 1, {},
      Lookup[Select[Take[results, {(First[position] - 1) samples + 1,
          Min[Length[results], First[position] samples]}],
        AssociationQ[#] && Lookup[#, "Status", None] === "COMPLETE" &], "Result", {}]];
    rowSigns = Fold[Intersection, {1, -1}, Lookup[
      Select[sampleRows, MemberQ[{"PASS", "Opp Sign"}, #["Status"]] &], "MatchingSigns", {}]];
    status = Which[AnyTrue[sampleRows, #["Status"] === "FAIL" &] || rowSigns === {}, "FAIL",
      Length[sampleRows] === samples && AllTrue[sampleRows,
        MemberQ[{"PASS", "Opp Sign"}, #["Status"]] &],
      If[MemberQ[rowSigns, 1], "PASS", "Opp Sign"], True, "UNRESOLVED"];
    completionProgress[callback, enabled, <|"Stage" -> "Validating sparse factorization",
      "Completed" -> First[position], "Total" -> Length[targets], "Unknowns" -> Length[free],
      "Elapsed" -> AbsoluteTime[] - started|>];
    Join[KeyDrop[residueComparisonBase[0, channel, {}, targets], "CandidateExpression"],
      <|"Status" -> status, "Samples" -> sampleRows, "RequestedSamples" -> samples,
        "CompletedSamples" -> Length[sampleRows], "MatchingSigns" -> rowSigns,
        "CalculatedResidue" -> Lookup[sampleRows, "CalculatedResidue", {}],
        "ExpectedResidue" -> Lookup[sampleRows, "ExpectedResidue", {}],
        "Difference" -> Lookup[sampleRows, "Difference", {}],
        "Method" -> "ExactSparseComponentCutValidation",
        "Scope" -> "SampledCutAllCoherentMassiveSpinComponents", "Diagnostics" -> {}|>]], targets];
  summary = Counts[Lookup[rows, "Status", {}]];
  report = <|"Channels" -> rows, "Checks" ->
      (Join[#, <|"Type" -> "Physical", "Pole" -> #["CutCondition"]|>] & /@ rows),
    "Summary" -> summary, "PhysicalSummary" -> summary, "SpuriousSummary" -> <||>,
    "FactorizationChannels" -> targets, "Table" -> residueReportTable[rows],
    "Scope" -> "ExactSparseHeldOutComponentsAllCoherentMassiveSpinComponents",
    "RandomSeed" -> seed, "ParameterRules" -> rules, "Diagnostics" -> diagnostics,
    "Execution" -> If[AssociationQ[run], Lookup[run, "Execution", <||>],
      <|"Mode" -> "Interrupted", "Diagnostics" -> {"The stage time limit interrupted sample dispatch."}|>]|>;
  feedback = <|"Status" -> If[diagnostics === {} && Length[used] === Length[jobs],
      "COMPLETE", "UNRESOLVED"], "Equations" -> equations, "Samples" -> used,
    "Diagnostics" -> diagnostics|>;
  <|"Report" -> report, "Feedback" -> feedback,
    "FamilyPass" -> (feedback["Status"] === "COMPLETE" && familyPass)|>
];

(* Retain the exact particular-point recipe used by sparse cut validation before
   an unfinished affine-family proof can leave the original amplitude in place.
   A recorded fit is construction data, not an independent amplitude check. *)
ConstructiveDiagrams`Private`completionFactorizationPointCheckpoint[trial_, variables_List,
    solution_Association, externalRules_List, provenance_Association : <||>] := Module[
  {rules = Lookup[solution, "SolutionRules", None], free = Lookup[solution, "FreeParameters", None], solved},
  If[!MemberQ[{"COMPLETE", "UNDERDETERMINED"}, Lookup[solution, "Status", None]] ||
      !AllTrue[variables, MatchQ[#, _Symbol] &] || !DuplicateFreeQ[variables] ||
      !ListQ[rules] || !AllTrue[rules, MatchQ[#, _Rule] &] ||
      !ListQ[free] || !DuplicateFreeQ[free], Return[Missing["NoFiniteFittedPoint"]]];
  solved = First /@ rules;
  If[!DuplicateFreeQ[solved] || Intersection[solved, free] =!= {} ||
      Sort[Join[solved, free]] =!= Sort[variables] ||
      !residueFiniteQ[trial] || !AllTrue[Last /@ rules, residueFiniteQ] ||
      !FreeQ[Last /@ rules, Alternatives @@ solved], Return[Missing["NoFiniteFittedPoint"]]];
  Join[provenance, <|"Status" -> "UNVALIDATED_RECORDED_POINT",
    "TrialAmplitude" -> trial, "FitVariables" -> variables,
    "SolutionRules" -> rules, "FreeParameters" -> free,
    "ParticularAssignment" -> Thread[free -> 0], "ExternalMassRules" -> externalRules,
    "CoordinatePolicy" -> "SameZeroFreeCoordinatesAsSparseValidation",
    "IndependentPointValidationPerformed" -> False, "FamilyUniquenessEstablished" -> False,
    "BenchmarkUsedForConstruction" -> False|>]
];

(* Materialize only the recorded fit, preserving the formal affine family.
   No channel, benchmark, new coefficient or internal-shell identity enters. *)
ConstructiveDiagrams`Private`constructFactorizationFittedPoint[source_Association, seconds_] :=
  TimeConstrained[Module[{checkpoint = Lookup[source, "FittedPointCheckpoint", None],
      fit, variables, solution, recorded, family, point, directions, free, trial},
    If[!AssociationQ[checkpoint] || !AssociationQ[Lookup[source, "ConstraintData", None]],
      Return[Missing["NoRecordedFittedPoint"]]];
    fit = source["ConstraintData"]; variables = Lookup[fit, "FitVariables", None];
    solution = Lookup[fit, "LinearSolution", None];
    If[!ListQ[variables] || !AssociationQ[solution] ||
        !ListQ[Lookup[source, "CorrectionBasis", None]] ||
        Length[source["CorrectionBasis"]] =!= Length[variables] ||
        Lookup[checkpoint, "ExternalMassRules", None] =!= Lookup[source, "ExternalMassRules", None],
      Return[Missing["MismatchedFittedPoint"]]];
    trial = completionCanonicalReduce[fit["FitSeed"], source["ExternalMassRules"]] +
      variables.source["CorrectionBasis"];
    recorded = ConstructiveDiagrams`Private`completionFactorizationPointCheckpoint[
      trial, variables, solution, source["ExternalMassRules"]];
    If[!AssociationQ[recorded] ||
        KeyTake[checkpoint, Keys[recorded]] =!= recorded,
      Return[Missing["MismatchedFittedPoint"]]];
    (* A known failed held-out point cannot be superseded by favourable new
       samples. Unproved affine directions are a separate obligation. *)
    If[AnyTrue[Lookup[checkpoint, "SparseValidationReports", {}], Function[entry,
        AssociationQ[Lookup[entry, "Report", None]] &&
          AnyTrue[Lookup[entry["Report"], "Checks", {}],
            MemberQ[{"FAIL", "Opp Sign"}, Lookup[#, "Status", None]] &]]],
      Return[Missing["KnownFailedFittedPoint"]]];
    free = recorded["FreeParameters"];
    family = trial /. recorded["SolutionRules"];
    point = family /. recorded["ParticularAssignment"];
    If[!residueFiniteQ[point] || !FreeQ[point, Alternatives @@ variables] ||
        !residueFiniteQ[family], Return[Missing["NonfiniteFittedPoint"]]];
    directions = (Coefficient[family, #] & /@ free);
    Join[source, <|"Amplitude" -> point, "FamilyAmplitude" -> family,
      "FreeParameters" -> free, "RemainingBasis" -> directions,
      "FittedPointCheckpoint" -> Join[checkpoint, <|"Materialized" -> True,
        "ReturnedAmplitudeWasRecordedPoint" -> SameQ[point, Lookup[source, "Amplitude", None]],
        "FormalAffineDirectionsClassified" -> False|>]|>]
  ], seconds, Missing["FittedPointMaterializationTimeConstraint"]];

completionNormalizeBasis[terms_List] := DeleteDuplicates[DeleteCases[Map[Function[term,
  Module[{factors, numeric}, factors = If[Head[term] === Times, List @@ term, {term}];
    numeric = Times @@ Select[factors, NumericQ];
    If[TrueQ[numeric === 0], 0, Cancel[term/numeric]]]], terms], 0]];

(* Formal monomial dependence is exact, not a sampled physical relation.
   Incremental Gaussian elimination avoids a large bulk row reduction. *)
DownValues[completionGaussianRationalQ] = {};
DownValues[completionLegacyIndependentBasis] = {};
DownValues[completionGaussianIndependentBasis] = {};
DownValues[completionIndependentBasis] = {};
completionGaussianRationalQ[value_] := MatchQ[value, _Integer | _Rational] ||
  (Head[value] === Complex && MatchQ[Re[value], _Integer | _Rational] && MatchQ[Im[value], _Integer | _Rational]);

completionLegacyIndependentBasis[basis_List, seconds_] := TimeConstrained[Module[
  {terms, scalar, key, monomials, positions, columns, entries, matrix, reduced, pivots},
  If[Length[basis] < 2, Return[basis]];
  scalar[term_] := Times @@ Select[If[Head[term] === Times, List @@ term, {term}],
    NumericQ[#] && Precision[#] === Infinity &&
      residueFiniteQ[#] &];
  key[term_] := Cancel[term/scalar[term]];
  terms = Map[Function[value, With[{expanded = Expand[value]},
    If[Head[expanded] === Plus, List @@ expanded, If[expanded === 0, {}, {expanded}]]]], basis];
  If[!FreeQ[terms, number_?NumberQ /; Precision[number] =!= Infinity], Return[basis]];
  monomials = DeleteDuplicates[key /@ Flatten[terms, 1]];
  If[monomials === {}, Return[{}]];
  positions = AssociationThread[monomials, Range[Length[monomials]]];
  columns = Map[Function[column, GroupBy[
    ({Lookup[positions, key[#]], scalar[#]} &) /@ column, First -> Last, Total]], terms];
  entries = Flatten[MapIndexed[Function[{column, index},
    KeyValueMap[({#1, First[index]} -> #2) &, column]], columns], 1];
  matrix = SparseArray[entries, {Length[monomials], Length[basis]}];
  reduced = RowReduce[matrix];
  positions = Cases[ArrayRules[reduced],
    (HoldPattern[Rule[{row_Integer, column_Integer}, value_]] /; value =!= 0) :> {row, column}];
  pivots = Values[KeySort[GroupBy[positions, First -> Last, Min]]]; basis[[pivots]]
], seconds, basis];

completionGaussianIndependentBasis[basis_List] := Module[
  {scalar, key, terms, positions = <||>, rowCount = 0, pivots = <||>, selected = {},
   vector, value, row, pivot, coefficient, record, index = 0, tag = Unique["pruner"]},
  Catch[
    scalar[term_] := scalar[term] = Times @@ Select[If[Head[term] === Times, List @@ term, {term}],
      NumericQ[#] && Precision[#] === Infinity &&
        residueFiniteQ[#] &];
    (* Memoized Cancel preserves the legacy formal-monomial convention. *)
    key[term_] := key[term] = Cancel[term/scalar[term]];
    Do[
      index++;
      terms = With[{expanded = Expand[expression]},
        If[Head[expanded] === Plus, List @@ expanded, If[expanded === 0, {}, {expanded}]]];
      If[!FreeQ[terms, number_?NumberQ /; Precision[number] =!= Infinity],
        Throw[<|"Mode" -> "NoPruning", "Basis" -> basis|>, tag]];
      If[!AllTrue[terms, completionGaussianRationalQ[scalar[#]] &],
        Throw[<|"Mode" -> "LegacyExactFieldFallback"|>, tag]];
      vector = <||>;
      Do[
        row = Lookup[positions, key[term], Missing["New"]];
        If[MissingQ[row], rowCount++; row = rowCount; AssociateTo[positions, key[term] -> row]];
        value = Lookup[vector, row, 0] + scalar[term];
        If[value === 0, KeyDropFrom[vector, row], AssociateTo[vector, row -> value]],
        {term, terms}];
      While[Length[vector] > 0,
        pivot = Min[Keys[vector]]; coefficient = vector[pivot];
        If[KeyExistsQ[pivots, pivot],
          record = pivots[pivot];
          KeyValueMap[Function[{keyRow, factor},
            value = Lookup[vector, keyRow, 0] - coefficient factor;
            If[value === 0, KeyDropFrom[vector, keyRow], AssociateTo[vector, keyRow -> value]]], record],
          AssociateTo[pivots, pivot -> Map[#/coefficient &, vector]];
          AppendTo[selected, index]; vector = <||>]],
      {expression, basis}];
    <|"Mode" -> "ExactGaussianSparseColumns", "Basis" -> basis[[selected]],
      "Indices" -> selected, "FormalRank" -> Length[selected]|>, tag]
];

completionIndependentBasis[basis_List, seconds_: 60] := Module[{started, result, remaining},
  If[Length[basis] < 2 || !(seconds === Infinity ||
      (NumericQ[seconds] && TrueQ[seconds > 0])), Return[basis]];
  started = AbsoluteTime[];
  result = TimeConstrained[completionGaussianIndependentBasis[basis], seconds, <|"Mode" -> "NoPruning", "Basis" -> basis|>];
  If[Lookup[result, "Mode", None] === "LegacyExactFieldFallback",
    remaining = If[seconds === Infinity, Infinity, seconds - (AbsoluteTime[] - started)];
    If[remaining <= 0, basis, completionLegacyIndependentBasis[basis, remaining]], Lookup[result, "Basis", basis]]
];

(* One name and one set of reference choices across preparation/completion. *)
completionPolePreference[requested_, inputs___] := Module[
  {reports = Select[{inputs}, AssociationQ], choices, candidate},
  If[requested =!= Automatic, Return[requested]];
  choices = Flatten[Map[Function[report,
    {Lookup[report, "PolePreference", Automatic],
      Lookup[Lookup[report, "Options", <||>], "PolePreference", Automatic],
      (* Permit an already-created in-memory legacy preparation report. *)
      Lookup[Lookup[report, "Options", <||>], "ReferenceSpinors", Automatic]}], reports], 1];
  candidate = SelectFirst[choices, # =!= Automatic &, Automatic];
  If[candidate =!= Automatic, Return[Replace[candidate, "Physical" -> "AllPhysical"]]];
  choices = DeleteDuplicates[Flatten[Function[report,
    Lookup[Flatten[Lookup[Lookup[Lookup[report, "ItemReports", {}], "PolePreference", <||>],
      "Assignments", {}]], "Mode", {}]] /@ reports]];
  Which[choices === {}, None,
    AllTrue[choices, # === "AllPhysical" &], "AllPhysical",
    AllTrue[choices, MemberQ[{"AllSpurious", "Cyclic", "ReverseCyclic"}, #] &], "AllSpurious",
    AllTrue[choices, MemberQ[{"AllPhysical", "AllSpurious", "Cyclic", "ReverseCyclic"}, #] &], "Mixed",
    choices === {"Xi"}, "Xi", choices === {"IndependentXi"}, "IndependentXi", True, None]
];

(* Conservative structural source filter. It admits no new denominator by
   algebraic inference: kinematic inverses must factor into known typed physical
   propagators. Masses/couplings and other nonkinematic coefficients are allowed.
   A rejected source remains available to the ordinary completion fallback. *)
(* Call-local inverse classification can be reused across a complete source
   catalog. It has the same conservative rules as the public-report predicate. *)
completionPhysicalDenominatorPredicate[normalized_Association] := Module[
  {external = Lookup[normalized, "ExternalMassRules", {}], targets, legs, allowed,
   baseQ, inverseQ, check},
  legs = Cases[external, HoldPattern[Mass[i_Integer] -> _] :> i];
  targets = completionTargets[Lookup[normalized, "Targets", {}]];
  allowed = residueChannelKey /@ Select[targets, KeyExistsQ[#, "ChannelExpression"] &];
  baseQ[value_] := baseQ[value] = Which[
    Head[value] === PropDen, With[{candidateKey = residuePropagatorKey[value, legs]},
      !MissingQ[candidateKey] && AnyTrue[allowed,
        First[#] === First[candidateKey] && residueExactZero[Last[#]^2 - Last[candidateKey]^2] &]],
    Head[value] === Times, AllTrue[List @@ value, baseQ],
    MatchQ[value, Power[_, _Integer?Positive]], baseQ[First[value]],
    True, !poleKinematicFactorQ[value] && residueFiniteQ[value] &&
      !TrueQ[residueExactZero[value /. external]]];
  (* Exact scalar coefficients can contain inverse roots after an exchange
     projection. Their exponents say nothing about kinematic pole order. *)
  inverseQ[{base_, exponent_}] :=
    (NumericQ[base] && NumericQ[exponent] &&
      !poleKinematicFactorQ[base^exponent] && residueFiniteQ[base^exponent]) ||
    (IntegerQ[exponent] && exponent < 0 && baseQ[base]);
  check[expression_] := Module[{inverses, reciprocalFunctions},
    If[!residueFiniteQ[expression], Return[False]];
    inverses = Cases[{expression}, Power[base_, exponent_] /;
      !(NumericQ[exponent] && TrueQ[exponent >= 0]) :> {base, exponent}, Infinity];
    If[!AllTrue[inverses, inverseQ], Return[False]];
    reciprocalFunctions = Cases[{expression}, value : ((Csc | Sec | Cot | Csch | Sech | Coth)[arg_]) /;
      poleKinematicFactorQ[arg] :> value, Infinity];
    reciprocalFunctions === {}];
  Function[expression, check[expression]]
];

completionPhysicalDenominatorOnlyQ[expression_, normalized_Association] :=
  completionPhysicalDenominatorPredicate[normalized][expression];

(* This is only a source-derived correction proposal. Individual atoms need
   not preserve their source channel: the caller must fit every original cut
   and validate the complete affine family before accepting any result. *)
(* Normalize each existing correction direction as a WHOLE expression. Splitting
   a reduced sum into new coordinates would change the proposal space. Every
   unfinished column and the unvisited tail therefore remain literal inputs. *)
completionNormalizePhysicalColumns[basis_List, massRules_List, seconds_ : 30] := Module[
  {started = AbsoluteTime[], external, checkpoint, outcome = True, remaining,
   value, complete, report, allowance, count = Length[basis], inputLeaves, i},
  external = preparationExternalRules[massRules];
  checkpoint = <|"Basis" -> basis, "ColumnReports" -> {}, "Processed" -> 0|>;
  inputLeaves = LeafCount[basis];
  If[!TrueQ[NumericQ[seconds] && 0 < seconds < Infinity] || inputLeaves > 2000000 ||
      !preparationScalarExternalRulesQ[external],
    Return[Join[checkpoint, <|"Status" -> "UNCHANGED", "InputColumns" -> count,
      "OutputColumns" -> count, "NormalizedColumns" -> 0, "TimeoutsPreserved" -> 0,
      "UntouchedTail" -> Range[count], "SourceBasisChanged" -> False,
      "FunctionalSpanPreserved" -> True, "Reatomized" -> False,
      "ExternalMassRules" -> external, "InternalOnShellConditions" -> {},
      "ElapsedTime" -> AbsoluteTime[] - started|>]]];
  external = DeleteDuplicatesBy[external, First];
  remaining[] := Max[0, seconds - (AbsoluteTime[] - started)];
  outcome = TimeConstrained[MemoryConstrained[
    Do[
      allowance = Min[2, remaining[]]; If[allowance <= 0, Break[]];
      value = TimeConstrained[MemoryConstrained[
        Block[{$rspCanonicalProductBasis = True}, completionExternalReduce[basis[[i]], external]],
        67108864, $Failed], allowance, $TimedOut];
      complete = value =!= $TimedOut && residueFiniteQ[value] &&
        FreeQ[value, _List | _Association | _Rule | _RuleDelayed];
      report = <|"Index" -> i, "Status" -> If[complete, "NORMALIZED", "PRESERVED"],
        "Before" -> basis[[i]], "After" -> If[complete, value, basis[[i]]],
        "ExactForwardIdentity" -> True,
        "Method" -> If[complete, "OrdinaryExternalIdentityNormalization", "UnchangedCheckpoint"],
        "Operations" -> If[complete, {"CanonicalPropagators", "ExternalMomentumConservation",
          "ForwardSpinorProducts", "ExternalMassReplacements", "CanonicalChains",
          "ExactRationalAlgebra"}, {}],
        "NumericalKinematicSamples" -> 0, "InternalOnShellConditions" -> {}|>;
      (* One checkpoint commits the column, proof route and processed index.
         A deadline between RHS evaluation and this Set keeps the old state. *)
      checkpoint = <|"Basis" -> If[complete, ReplacePart[checkpoint["Basis"], i -> value],
          checkpoint["Basis"]], "ColumnReports" -> Append[checkpoint["ColumnReports"], report],
        "Processed" -> i|>,
      {i, count}]; True,
    268435456, False], Max[0.000001, remaining[]], False];
  Join[checkpoint, <|"Status" -> If[checkpoint["Processed"] === count, "NORMALIZED", "PARTIAL"],
    "InputColumns" -> count, "OutputColumns" -> Length[checkpoint["Basis"]],
    "NormalizedColumns" -> Count[checkpoint["ColumnReports"], row_ /; row["Status"] === "NORMALIZED"],
    "TimeoutsPreserved" -> Count[checkpoint["ColumnReports"], row_ /; row["Status"] === "PRESERVED"],
    "UntouchedTail" -> Range[checkpoint["Processed"] + 1, count],
    "TimedOut" -> !TrueQ[outcome], "SourceBasisChanged" -> False,
    "FunctionalSpanPreserved" -> True, "Reatomized" -> False,
    "ExternalMassRules" -> external, "InternalOnShellConditions" -> {},
    "ElapsedTime" -> AbsoluteTime[] - started|>]
];



(* Only a failure-only caller grants this recovery. Retry actual timed-out
   ordinary source slots, keeping the original build deadline and its one-second
   per-slot maximum. Failed or unsupported rewrites supply no new coordinates. *)
completionRetryTimedOutOrdinarySources[records_List, indices_List, external_List,
    deadline_, supported_] := Module[
  {admitted={},reports={},record,index,remaining,allowance,started,reduced,status,
   memoryLimit=67108864,valid},
  valid=DuplicateFreeQ[indices] && AllTrue[indices,IntegerQ[#] && 1<=#<=Length[records]&] &&
    AllTrue[indices,AssociationQ[records[[#]]] && KeyExistsQ[records[[#]],"Expression"]&];
  If[!valid,Return[<|"Status"->"NOT_ATTEMPTED","Reason"->"InvalidSourceSlots",
    "Sources"->{},"Reports"->{},"Attempted"->False|>]];
  If[!NumericQ[deadline] || !TrueQ[0<deadline<Infinity],
    Return[<|"Status"->"NOT_ATTEMPTED","Reason"->"NoFiniteBuildDeadline",
      "Sources"->{},"Reports"->{},"Attempted"->False|>]];
  Do[
    remaining=deadline-AbsoluteTime[];If[remaining<=0.001,Break[]];
    allowance=Min[1,remaining];record=records[[index]];started=AbsoluteTime[];
    reduced=TimeConstrained[MemoryConstrained[
      Block[{$rspCanonicalProductBasis=True},completionExternalReduce[record["Expression"],external]],
      memoryLimit,Missing["OrdinarySourceMemoryLimit"]],allowance,$TimedOut];
    status=Which[reduced===$TimedOut,"TIMEOUT",
      reduced===Missing["OrdinarySourceMemoryLimit"],"MEMORY_LIMIT",
      !residueFiniteQ[reduced] || !FreeQ[reduced,_List|_Association|_Rule|_RuleDelayed|_Failure|_Missing],"REJECTED",
      !TrueQ[supported[reduced]],"REJECTED",True,"ADMITTED"];
    If[status==="ADMITTED",AppendTo[admitted,<|"SourceIndex"->index,"Expression"->reduced|>]];
    AppendTo[reports,<|"SourceIndex"->index,"Source"->Lookup[record,"Source",Missing["UnrecordedSource"]],
      "FirstPassStatus"->"TIMEOUT","Status"->status,"TimeConstraint"->allowance,
      "MemoryConstraintBytes"->memoryLimit,"Seconds"->N[AbsoluteTime[]-started]|>],
    {index,indices}];
  <|"Status"->Which[indices==={},"NOT_NEEDED",Length[reports]<Length[indices],"DEADLINE",
      AllTrue[reports,#["Status"]==="ADMITTED"&],"COMPLETE",True,"PARTIAL"],
    "Sources"->admitted,"Reports"->reports,"Attempted"->(reports=!={}),
    "RequestedSourceIndices"->indices,"OriginalBuildDeadline"->deadline,
    "Method"->"OnlyTimedOutOrdinarySourceSlotsWithinTheOriginalFiniteBuildDeadline"|>
];

completionPhysicalChannelBasis[normalized_Association, channelPreparation_,
    exchangePlan_Association, constructionLimit_Integer, limit_Integer, seconds_,
    reducedChannels_: Missing["NotProvided"]] := Module[
  {started = AbsoluteTime[], external = normalized["ExternalMassRules"], legs,
   proposals, regular = Missing["NotCollected"], sourceRecords = {}, sources = {}, groupedSources = {},
   quotientSources = {}, regularPartQ,
   directions = {}, terms, value, reduced, projected, targets, fallbackBasis,
   candidateMode = "PreparedAndReducedPhysicalUnion", fullCount = Missing["NotMeasured"],
   diagnostics = {}, complete, exceeded = False, tag = Unique["physicalChannelBasis"],
   closedQ, physicalQ, supportedQ, appendSource, channelNormalized, sourceCount = 0, rawCount = 0, basis = {},
   automaticCeiling, constructionBound, effectiveLimit = limit, capChanges = {}, nextLimit,
   columnNormalization = Missing["NotRequested"], normalizationBudget, normalizedColumns,
   rejectedColumns = {},ordinaryClosureEnabled=TrueQ[$completionOrdinarySourceClosure],
   ordinaryIndex=0,ordinaryTimedOut={},ordinaryReductionReports={},ordinarySlotStarted,
   ordinaryClosure=Missing["NotRequested"],ordinaryRecord,ordinaryAdmission},
  (* The public wrapper grants this permission only for an Automatic cap.
     Every explicit numeric child call resets it at its own wrapper entry. *)
  automaticCeiling = If[IntegerQ[$completionAutomaticCorrectionTermCeiling] &&
      $completionAutomaticCorrectionTermCeiling > limit, $completionAutomaticCorrectionTermCeiling, limit];
  constructionBound = If[automaticCeiling > limit,
    Min[4096, Max[constructionLimit, automaticCeiling Max[1, Lookup[exchangePlan, "Order", 1]]]],
    constructionLimit];
  legs = Cases[external, HoldPattern[Mass[i_Integer] -> _] :> i];
  targets = completionTargets[normalized["Targets"]];
  physicalQ = completionPhysicalDenominatorPredicate[normalized];
  closedQ[expression_] := FreeQ[expression,
    _xFactor | _xTildeFactor | (Spinor | SpinorHat)["Xi", ___] |
    (Spinor | SpinorHat)[_, ("Angle" | "Square"), _Multiparticle, ___] |
    (Spinor | SpinorHat)[_, ("Upper" | "Lower"), ("Angle" | "Square"), _Multiparticle, ___]];
  supportedQ[expression_] := Module[{higher},
    If[!closedQ[expression] || !physicalQ[expression], Return[False]];
    higher = completionHigherPhysicalPoles[expression, targets, legs];
    ListQ[higher] && higher === {}
  ];
  regularPartQ[expression_] := Module[{expanded},
    If[rspSandwichExpansionCount[expression] > Min[4096, constructionBound], Return[True]];
    expanded = withProtectedPropagators[expression, Expand];
    AnyTrue[If[Head[expanded] === Plus, List @@ expanded, {expanded}],
      # =!= 0 && FreeQ[Denominator[#], _PropDen] &]
  ];
  appendSource[expression_, origin_] := Module[{canonical, ordinary},
    canonical = residueCanonicalPropagators[expression /. external, legs];
    ordinary = completionOrdinaryPairPoleSource[canonical, external];
    canonical = ordinary["Expression"];
    If[canonical =!= 0 && supportedQ[canonical],
      AppendTo[sourceRecords, Join[<|"Expression" -> canonical, "Source" -> origin,
          "CorrelatedRegularQuotient" -> regularPartQ[canonical]|>,
        If[ordinary["Status"] === "REDUCED", <|"OrdinaryPoleNormalization" ->
          KeyDrop[ordinary, "Expression"]|>, <||>]]]]];
  complete = TimeConstrained[Catch[
    proposals = completionInputProposals[normalized, constructionBound];
    If[Lookup[proposals, "Status", None] =!= "AVAILABLE",
      diagnostics = Join[diagnostics, Lookup[proposals, "Diagnostics", {}]];
      Throw[False, tag]];
    regular = proposals["RegularExpression"];
    (* Explicit regular input remains fixed; even it must have no apparent
       spurious denominator for this physical-only proposal to qualify. *)
    If[!closedQ[regular] || !physicalQ[regular],
      AppendTo[diagnostics, "The fixed explicit regular input is not closed and physical-denominator-only."];
      Throw[False, tag]];
    (* Explicit regular input is already fixed in RegularExpression. Strip it
       per record before ordinary cancellation, including mutually canceling
       regular pieces in different records. A newly exposed quotient remains
       correlated with its entire pole-bearing source. *)
    Do[appendSource[source, "PreparedInput"], {source, proposals["PoleBearingByRecord"]}];
    If[AssociationQ[channelPreparation] &&
        ListQ[Lookup[channelPreparation, "PreparedAmplitudes", None]] &&
        completionModelQ[Lookup[channelPreparation, "Model", None]],
      (* Normalize the legacy 1/z contour and sewing sign exactly as the
         checker does; neither belongs to a free off-cut continuation. *)
      channelNormalized = residueSimpleInputs[0, channelPreparation["PreparedAmplitudes"],
        channelPreparation["Model"]];
      If[AssociationQ[channelNormalized],
        Do[If[TrueQ[Lookup[target, "Complete", False]] && KeyExistsQ[target, "StateSum"],
          appendSource[target["StateSum"]/target["Propagator"], "PreparedChannel"]],
          {target, completionTargets[channelNormalized["Targets"]]}]]];
    If[AssociationQ[reducedChannels],
      Do[appendSource[source, "ReducedPhysicalChannelSource"],
        {source, Lookup[reducedChannels, "Sources", {}]}];
      Do[appendSource[source, "ReducedPhysicalChannelDirection"],
        {source, Lookup[reducedChannels, "Basis", {}]}]];
    targets = completionTargets[normalized["Targets"]];
    Do[If[TrueQ[Lookup[target, "Complete", False]] && KeyExistsQ[target, "StateSum"],
      appendSource[target["StateSum"]/target["Propagator"], "OriginalReferenceFreeChannel"]],
      {target, targets}];
    sourceRecords = DeleteDuplicatesBy[sourceRecords, #["Expression"] &];
    sourceCount = Length[sourceRecords];
    If[sourceCount === 0, AppendTo[diagnostics,
      "No closed source with only catalogued physical propagator denominators was available."];
      Throw[False, tag]];
    Do[
      If[ordinaryClosureEnabled,ordinaryIndex++;ordinarySlotStarted=AbsoluteTime[]];
      value = record["Expression"];
      (* Retain the original source if optional ordinary reduction times out
         or exposes a denominator outside the supplied physical catalog. *)
      reduced = TimeConstrained[completionExternalReduce[value, external],
        Max[0.000001, Min[1, seconds/Max[1, 2 sourceCount]]], $TimedOut];
      If[ordinaryClosureEnabled,
        If[reduced===$TimedOut,AppendTo[ordinaryTimedOut,ordinaryIndex]];
        AppendTo[ordinaryReductionReports,<|"SourceIndex"->ordinaryIndex,"Source"->record["Source"],
          "Status"->If[reduced===$TimedOut,"TIMEOUT","RETURNED"],
          "Seconds"->N[AbsoluteTime[]-ordinarySlotStarted]|>]];
      sources = DeleteDuplicates[Join[sources, {value},
        If[residueFiniteQ[reduced] && supportedQ[reduced], {reduced}, {}]]];
      If[TrueQ[Lookup[record, "CorrelatedRegularQuotient", False]],
        quotientSources = DeleteDuplicates[Join[quotientSources, {value},
          If[residueFiniteQ[reduced] && supportedQ[reduced], {reduced}, {}]]]];
      If[record["Source"] === "ReducedPhysicalChannelDirection" ||
          TrueQ[Lookup[record, "CorrelatedRegularQuotient", False]],
        groupedSources = DeleteDuplicates[Join[groupedSources, {value},
          If[residueFiniteQ[reduced] && supportedQ[reduced], {reduced}, {}]]]],
      {record, sourceRecords}];
    If[ordinaryClosureEnabled,
      ordinaryClosure=completionRetryTimedOutOrdinarySources[sourceRecords,ordinaryTimedOut,
        external,started+seconds,supportedQ];
      Do[
        ordinaryRecord=sourceRecords[[ordinaryAdmission["SourceIndex"]]];
        reduced=ordinaryAdmission["Expression"];
        sources=DeleteDuplicates[Join[sources,{reduced}]];
        If[TrueQ[Lookup[ordinaryRecord,"CorrelatedRegularQuotient",False]],
          quotientSources=DeleteDuplicates[Join[quotientSources,{reduced}]]];
        If[ordinaryRecord["Source"]==="ReducedPhysicalChannelDirection" ||
            TrueQ[Lookup[ordinaryRecord,"CorrelatedRegularQuotient",False]],
          groupedSources=DeleteDuplicates[Join[groupedSources,{reduced}]]],
        {ordinaryAdmission,ordinaryClosure["Sources"]}]];
    Do[
      Which[
        MemberQ[groupedSources, source], terms = {source},
        rspSandwichExpansionCount[source] > constructionBound,
          AppendTo[diagnostics, "A source was kept grouped because its formal expansion exceeded the construction bound."];
          terms = {source},
        True, value = withProtectedPropagators[source, Expand];
          terms = If[Head[value] === Plus, List @@ value, {value}]];
      terms = Select[terms, # =!= 0 &&
        (MemberQ[quotientSources, source] || !FreeQ[#, Power[_PropDen, _Integer?Negative]]) && supportedQ[#] &];
      directions = completionNormalizeBasis[Join[directions, terms]];
      If[Length[directions] > constructionBound,
        exceeded = True; Throw[False, tag]], {source, sources}];
    rawCount = Length[directions];
    projected = completionCompactExchangeProject[#, exchangePlan] & /@ directions;
    (* The source catalog can be incomplete under an exchange. Reject that
       proposal instead of silently introducing an undeclared denominator. *)
    If[!AllTrue[projected, supportedQ],
      AppendTo[diagnostics, "Identical-particle projection exposed a denominator outside the physical catalog."];
      Throw[False, tag]];
    (* Preserve the functional column space while exposing ordinary identity
       dependencies. Never split a normalized column into new fit variables. *)
    If[Length[projected] > 128,
      normalizationBudget = If[seconds === Infinity, 90,
        Min[90, 3 Max[0, seconds - (AbsoluteTime[] - started)]/4]];
      If[normalizationBudget > 0.01,
        columnNormalization = completionNormalizePhysicalColumns[projected, external,
          normalizationBudget];
        normalizedColumns = columnNormalization["Basis"];
        rejectedColumns = Select[Range[Length[projected]],
          !closedQ[normalizedColumns[[#]]] || !physicalQ[normalizedColumns[[#]]] &];
        Do[normalizedColumns[[index]] = projected[[index]], {index, rejectedColumns}];
        projected = normalizedColumns;
        columnNormalization = Join[columnNormalization,
          <|"RejectedPresentationColumns" -> rejectedColumns,
            "AcceptedDistinctColumns" -> Length[completionNormalizeBasis[projected]]|>]]];
    basis = completionIndependentBasis[completionNormalizeBasis[projected],
      If[seconds === Infinity, 5, Max[0.000001, seconds - (AbsoluteTime[] - started)]]];
    If[effectiveLimit < Length[basis] <= automaticCeiling,
      nextLimit = Min[automaticCeiling, 2^Ceiling[Log[2, Length[basis]]]];
      capChanges = {<|"From" -> effectiveLimit, "To" -> nextLimit,
        "ObservedProjectedDirections" -> Length[basis],
        "Operation" -> "ReuseCompletePhysicalUnion", "ElapsedTime" -> AbsoluteTime[] - started|>};
      effectiveLimit = nextLimit];
    If[Length[basis] > effectiveLimit, exceeded = True; Throw[False, tag]];
    True, tag], seconds, False];
  If[exceeded && AssociationQ[reducedChannels] &&
      ListQ[Lookup[reducedChannels, "Basis", None]] &&
      (seconds === Infinity || seconds - (AbsoluteTime[] - started) > 0.01),
    (* A named smaller source space is a separate reconstruction proposal,
       not a truncation of the oversized union or its eventual nullspace. *)
    fullCount = Max[Length[directions], Length[basis]];
    fallbackBasis = TimeConstrained[
      completionIndependentBasis[completionNormalizeBasis[
        completionCompactExchangeProject[#, exchangePlan] & /@
          Select[reducedChannels["Basis"], supportedQ]],
        If[seconds === Infinity, 5, Max[0.000001, seconds - (AbsoluteTime[] - started)]]],
      If[seconds === Infinity, 5, Max[0.000001, seconds - (AbsoluteTime[] - started)]], $TimedOut];
    If[ListQ[fallbackBasis] && fallbackBasis =!= {} && Length[fallbackBasis] <= effectiveLimit &&
        AllTrue[fallbackBasis, supportedQ],
      basis = fallbackBasis; complete = True; exceeded = False;
      candidateMode = "ReducedPhysicalChannelsBudgetFallback";
      AppendTo[diagnostics,
        "The full physical union exceeded its cap; the complete reduced physical-channel source space is tried instead."]]];
  If[exceeded, AppendTo[diagnostics,
    "The physical-only proposal exceeds its source or final correction-term cap; no arbitrary directions were discarded."]];
  If[!TrueQ[complete] && diagnostics === {}, AppendTo[diagnostics,
    "Physical-only source construction exceeded its shared time budget."]];
  Join[<|"Status" -> If[TrueQ[complete] && basis =!= {}, "AVAILABLE", "UNAVAILABLE"],
    "Basis" -> If[TrueQ[complete], basis, {}], "RegularExpression" -> regular,
    "Sources" -> sourceRecords, "RawDirectionCount" -> rawCount,
    "CandidateMode" -> candidateMode, "OversizedUnionDirections" -> fullCount,
    "SourceCount" -> sourceCount, "ProjectedDirectionCount" -> Length[basis],
    "WithinLimit" -> !exceeded, "EffectiveMaxCorrectionTerms" -> effectiveLimit,
    "CapChanges" -> capChanges, "CatalogConstructionLimit" -> constructionBound,
    "ColumnNormalization" -> columnNormalization,
    "ElapsedTime" -> AbsoluteTime[] - started,
    "Diagnostics" -> DeleteDuplicates[diagnostics],
    "Scope" -> "SourceDerivedPhysicalDenominatorOnlyProposalRequiringAllChannelValidation"|>,
    If[ordinaryClosureEnabled,<|"OrdinarySourceReductionReports"->ordinaryReductionReports,
      "OrdinarySourceClosure"->Join[If[AssociationQ[ordinaryClosure],KeyDrop[ordinaryClosure,"Sources"],
          <|"Status"->"NOT_REACHED","Reports"->{},"Attempted"->False|>],
        <|"TimedOutSourceIndices"->ordinaryTimedOut,"OriginalSourcesRetained"->True,
          "ExistingDenominatorAndGroupingChecksRetained"->True,
          "OriginalBuildTimeConstraint"->seconds,
          "Activation"->"FailureOnlyAutomaticTimeoutRecovery"|>]|>,<||>]]
];

(* A correlated proposal for large coherent-spin systems. It uses only supplied
   prepared sources and retained fixed-reference shell remainders. Complete
   insertion-degree blocks keep numerator relations intact; the larger original
   channel union remains a separate fallback if this finite proposal fails. *)
completionStructuredPhysicalSourceBasis[normalized_Association, channelPreparation_,
    plan_Association, constructionLimit_Integer, limit_Integer, seconds_,
    presentation_: "Original", cachedCatalog_: None] := Module[
  {started = AbsoluteTime[], external = normalized["ExternalMassRules"], legs, targets,
   sources = {}, rejected = {}, proposals, regular = Missing["NotCollected"], prepared, value, closedQ, supportedQ, physicalQ,
   add, degree, split, blocks = {}, projected, basis = {}, normalization = Missing["NotRequested"],
   normalizedColumns, rejectedColumns, admission, complete, exceeded = False,
   diagnostics = {}, tag = Unique["structuredPhysicalSources"], remaining, effectiveLimit = limit,
   capChanges = {}, rawCount = 0, records = {}, sourceIndex = 0, catalogBuilt = False,
   sourceCatalogComplete = False, inputSignature, catalog = Missing["IncompleteSourceCatalog"], reused = False,
   sourceSignature, proposalSources, remainderValues},
  remaining[] := If[seconds === Infinity, Infinity, Max[0, seconds - (AbsoluteTime[] - started)]];
  legs = Cases[external, HoldPattern[Mass[i_Integer] -> _] :> i];
  targets = completionTargets[normalized["Targets"]];
  physicalQ = completionPhysicalDenominatorPredicate[normalized];
  closedQ[expression_] := FreeQ[expression, _xFactor | _xTildeFactor |
    (Spinor | SpinorHat)["Xi", ___] |
    (Spinor | SpinorHat)[_, ("Angle" | "Square"), _Multiparticle, ___] |
    (Spinor | SpinorHat)[_, ("Upper" | "Lower"), ("Angle" | "Square"), _Multiparticle, ___]];
  supportedQ[expression_] := closedQ[expression] && physicalQ[expression] &&
    With[{higher = completionHigherPhysicalPoles[expression, targets, legs]}, ListQ[higher] && higher === {}];
  add[expression_, origin_] := Module[{canonical},
    canonical = residueCanonicalPropagators[expression /. external, legs];
    If[canonical === 0 || FreeQ[canonical, Power[_PropDen, _Integer?Negative]], Return[]];
    (* Prepared whole sources use their established canonical physical form.
       Discarded remainders retain the presentation in which they were derived;
       canonicalizing them before grouping changes their correlated coordinates.
       Both are checked on the same canonical physical interpretation. *)
    If[supportedQ[canonical], AppendTo[sources, <|"Expression" ->
        If[AssociationQ[origin] && Lookup[origin, "Type", None] === "RetainedShellRemainder", expression, canonical],
        "SuppliedExpression" -> expression, "CanonicalExpression" -> canonical, "Source" -> origin|>],
      AppendTo[rejected, <|"Source" -> origin, "Reason" -> "UnsupportedReferenceOrDenominator"|>]]];
  degree[chain_SpinorChain] := Count[List @@ chain, _Mom];
  degree[trace_SpinorTrace] := Count[List @@ trace, _Mom];
  degree[product_Times] := Total[degree /@ List @@ product];
  degree[Power[base_, exponent_Integer?Positive]] := exponent degree[base];
  degree[_] := 0;
  split[expression_] := Module[{profile, expanded, terms},
    profile = rspExpansionProfile[expression, constructionLimit, 2000000];
    If[profile[[1]] > constructionLimit || profile[[2]] > 2000000,
      AppendTo[blocks, expression];
      If[Length[blocks] > constructionLimit, rawCount = Length[blocks]; exceeded = True; Throw[False, tag]]; Return[]];
    expanded = withProtectedPropagators[expression, Expand];
    terms = If[Head[expanded] === Plus, List @@ expanded, {expanded}];
    If[AnyTrue[terms, FreeQ[#, Power[_PropDen, _Integer?Negative]] &],
      AppendTo[blocks, expression], blocks = Join[blocks, Values[GroupBy[terms, degree, Total]]]];
    If[Length[blocks] > constructionLimit, rawCount = Length[blocks]; exceeded = True; Throw[False, tag]]];
  complete = TimeConstrained[MemoryConstrained[Catch[
    If[!MemberQ[{"Original", "Normalized"}, presentation], Throw[False, tag]];
    (* Only the ordered shell remainders enter this proposal. Fingerprinting
       unrelated retained preparation histories can exhaust the memory budget
       before collection, despite a small complete usable source catalog. *)
    records = Lookup[normalized, "RemainderData", {}];
    records = Select[If[ListQ[records], records, {}], AssociationQ];
    remainderValues = (Lookup[#, "ShellRemainder", Missing["NoShellRemainder"]] & /@ records);
    inputSignature = Hash[{Lookup[normalized, "Records", {}], external, normalized["Targets"],
      remainderValues, If[completionPreparedChannelsQ[channelPreparation],
        KeyTake[channelPreparation, {"PreparedAmplitudes", "Model"}], None]}, "SHA256"];
    reused = AssociationQ[cachedCatalog] && Lookup[cachedCatalog, "Status", None] === "COMPLETE" &&
      Lookup[cachedCatalog, "InputSignature", None] === inputSignature &&
      ListQ[Lookup[cachedCatalog, "Sources", None]] && ListQ[Lookup[cachedCatalog, "RejectedSources", None]] &&
      KeyExistsQ[cachedCatalog, "RegularExpression"] &&
      Lookup[cachedCatalog, "SourceSignature", None] === Hash[
        {cachedCatalog["Sources"], cachedCatalog["RejectedSources"], cachedCatalog["RegularExpression"]}, "SHA256"];
    If[reused,
      sources = cachedCatalog["Sources"]; rejected = cachedCatalog["RejectedSources"];
      regular = cachedCatalog["RegularExpression"];
      If[!AllTrue[sources, AssociationQ[#] && KeyExistsQ[#, "Expression"] &&
          KeyExistsQ[#, "CanonicalExpression"] && supportedQ[#["CanonicalExpression"]] &&
          SameQ[residueCanonicalPropagators[#["Expression"] /. external, legs], #["CanonicalExpression"]] &],
        sources = {}; rejected = {}; reused = False]];
    If[!reused,
      proposals = completionInputProposals[normalized, constructionLimit];
      If[Lookup[proposals, "Status", None] =!= "AVAILABLE",
        If[Lookup[proposals, "Reason", None] === "InputTermCollectionLimit", exceeded = True];
        diagnostics = Join[diagnostics, Lookup[proposals, "Diagnostics", {}]]; Throw[False, tag]];
      regular = proposals["RegularExpression"];
      If[!supportedQ[regular], AppendTo[diagnostics,
        "The fixed explicit regular input is not reference-free and physical-denominator-only."];
        Throw[False, tag]];
      Do[value = record["Expression"];
        value = Total[Select[If[Head[value] === Plus, List @@ value, {value}], !FreeQ[Denominator[#], _PropDen] &]];
        add[value, "PreparedInput"], {record, normalized["Records"]}];
      If[completionPreparedChannelsQ[channelPreparation],
        prepared = residueSimpleInputs[0, channelPreparation["PreparedAmplitudes"], channelPreparation["Model"]];
        If[AssociationQ[prepared], Do[
          If[TrueQ[Lookup[channel, "Complete", False]] && KeyExistsQ[channel, "StateSum"],
            add[channel["StateSum"]/channel["Propagator"], "PreparedChannel"]],
          {channel, completionTargets[prepared["Targets"]]}]]];
      Do[sourceIndex++;
        If[!MissingQ[value], add[value, <|"Type" -> "RetainedShellRemainder", "Item" -> sourceIndex|>]],
        {value, remainderValues}];
      sources = DeleteDuplicatesBy[sources, #["Expression"] &]];
    sourceCatalogComplete = True;
    catalog = <|"Status" -> "COMPLETE", "Sources" -> sources, "RejectedSources" -> rejected,
      "RegularExpression" -> regular, "InputSignature" -> inputSignature,
      "SourceSignature" -> Hash[{sources, rejected, regular}, "SHA256"]|>;
    If[sources === {}, AppendTo[diagnostics, "No eligible prepared physical sources were available."];
      Throw[False, tag]];
    proposalSources = If[presentation === "Original", sources,
      DeleteDuplicatesBy[Map[Join[#, <|"Expression" -> #["CanonicalExpression"]|>] &, sources], #["Expression"] &]];
    Do[split[record["Expression"]], {record, proposalSources}]; rawCount = Length[blocks];
    projected = completionNormalizeBasis[completionCompactExchangeProject[#, plan] & /@ blocks];
    If[!AllTrue[projected, closedQ[#] && physicalQ[residueCanonicalPropagators[# /. external, legs]] &], AppendTo[diagnostics,
      "Exchange projection exposed an unsupported denominator in the structured proposal."];
      Throw[False, tag]];
    basis = projected; catalogBuilt = True;
    If[presentation === "Original",
      normalization = <|"Status" -> "NOT_REQUESTED", "Basis" -> projected,
        "InputColumns" -> Length[projected], "Processed" -> 0, "NormalizedColumns" -> 0,
        "SourceBasisChanged" -> False, "FunctionalSpanPreserved" -> True,
        "InternalOnShellConditions" -> {}|>;
      basis = completionIndependentBasis[projected,
        If[seconds === Infinity, 10, Max[0.000001, remaining[]]]],
      normalization = completionNormalizePhysicalColumns[projected, external,
        If[seconds === Infinity, 20, Min[20, remaining[]/2]]];
      normalizedColumns = normalization["Basis"];
      rejectedColumns = Select[Range[Length[projected]], !closedQ[normalizedColumns[[#]]] || !physicalQ[normalizedColumns[[#]]] &];
      Do[normalizedColumns[[index]] = projected[[index]], {index, rejectedColumns}];
      normalization = Join[normalization, <|"RejectedPresentationColumns" -> rejectedColumns|>];
      basis = completionIndependentBasis[completionNormalizeBasis[normalizedColumns],
        If[seconds === Infinity, 10, Max[0.000001, remaining[]]]]];
    True, tag], 536870912, Missing["StructuredSourceMemoryLimit"]], seconds,
    Missing["StructuredSourceTimeLimit"]];
  If[catalogBuilt,
    admission = completionMaterializedBasisCap[basis, Automatic, limit, $completionAutomaticCorrectionTermCeiling];
    effectiveLimit = admission["EffectiveMaxCorrectionTerms"];
    capChanges = (Join[#, <|"Operation" -> "ReuseCompleteStructuredPhysicalBlocks",
      "ElapsedTime" -> AbsoluteTime[] - started|>] & /@ admission["CapChanges"]);
    If[Length[basis] > effectiveLimit, exceeded = True];
    If[!TrueQ[complete], AppendTo[diagnostics,
      "Optional exact normalization or dependency pruning reached its budget; every unfinished original column was retained."]]];
  If[exceeded, AppendTo[diagnostics,
    "The complete structured physical source proposal exceeded its construction or correction-term cap."]];
  If[!TrueQ[catalogBuilt] && diagnostics === {}, AppendTo[diagnostics,
    If[complete === Missing["StructuredSourceMemoryLimit"],
      "Structured physical source construction reached its memory budget before a complete catalog was available.",
      "Structured physical source construction exceeded its shared budget."]]];
  <|"Status" -> If[catalogBuilt && !exceeded && basis =!= {}, "AVAILABLE", "UNAVAILABLE"],
    "Basis" -> If[catalogBuilt && !exceeded, basis, {}], "RegularExpression" -> regular,
    "Sources" -> If[ListQ[proposalSources], proposalSources, sources], "RejectedSources" -> rejected,
    "SourceCount" -> Length[sources], "RawDirectionCount" -> rawCount, "ProjectedDirectionCount" -> Length[basis],
    "CandidateMode" -> "StructuredPreparedPhysicalBlocks", "SourcePresentation" -> presentation,
    "Grouping" -> "ChainMomentumInsertionDegree", "WithinLimit" -> !exceeded,
    "SourceCatalogComplete" -> catalogBuilt, "CompleteSourceCatalog" -> catalog,
    "SourceCollectionComplete" -> sourceCatalogComplete, "SourceCatalogReused" -> reused,
    "CatalogInputFingerprintScope" -> "PreparedRecordsTargetsAndOrderedConsumedShellRemainders",
    "OptionalReductionCompleted" -> TrueQ[complete], "EffectiveMaxCorrectionTerms" -> effectiveLimit,
    "CapChanges" -> capChanges, "ColumnNormalization" -> normalization,
    "OriginalTargetCount" -> Length[targets], "AllOriginalTargetsRetained" -> True,
    "InternalOnShellConditions" -> {}, "ElapsedTime" -> AbsoluteTime[] - started,
    "Diagnostics" -> DeleteDuplicates[diagnostics],
    "Scope" -> "SourceDerivedCorrelatedProposalRequiringEveryOriginalCutAndCompleteAffineValidation"|>
];

(* Try a smaller, independently validated reconstruction proposal before the
   full physical union. Complete reduced channel expressions provide its
   numerator atoms; selected-cut continuation atoms and prepared input columns
   are deliberately left for the larger fallback. This changes the proposal,
   not any original residue obligation or affine direction within the fit. *)
completionReducedPhysicalSourceBasis[normalized_Association, reducedChannels_,
    exchangePlan_Association, constructionLimit_Integer, limit_Integer, seconds_,
    selectedChannels_:Automatic] := Module[
  {started = AbsoluteTime[], external = normalized["ExternalMassRules"], legs,
   targets, sources, sourceRecords = {}, directions = {}, projected = {}, basis = {},
   regular = Missing["NotCollected"], proposals, value, terms, higher, closedQ, supportedQ,
   complete, exceeded = False, rawCount = 0, normalization = Missing["NotRequested"],
   normalizedColumns, rejected, remaining, diagnostics = {}, tag = Unique["reducedPhysicalSources"],
   selectedRecords = {}, selectedControls = {}, selectedSourceVerification = Missing["NotRequested"],
   candidateMode = "ReducedPhysicalSourceAtoms"},
  remaining[] := If[seconds === Infinity, Infinity, Max[0, seconds - (AbsoluteTime[] - started)]];
  legs = Cases[external, HoldPattern[Mass[i_Integer] -> _] :> i];
  targets = completionTargets[normalized["Targets"]];
  closedQ[expression_] := FreeQ[expression,
    _xFactor | _xTildeFactor | (Spinor | SpinorHat)["Xi", ___] |
    (Spinor | SpinorHat)[_, ("Angle" | "Square"), _Multiparticle, ___] |
    (Spinor | SpinorHat)[_, ("Upper" | "Lower"), ("Angle" | "Square"), _Multiparticle, ___]];
  supportedQ[expression_] := closedQ[expression] &&
    completionPhysicalDenominatorOnlyQ[expression, normalized] &&
    (higher = completionHigherPhysicalPoles[expression, targets, legs]; ListQ[higher] && higher === {});
  sources = If[AssociationQ[reducedChannels], Lookup[reducedChannels, "Sources", {}], {}];
  complete = TimeConstrained[Catch[
    If[!ListQ[sources] || sources === {},
      AppendTo[diagnostics, "No reduced physical channel expressions were available."]; Throw[False, tag]];
    proposals = completionInputProposals[normalized, constructionLimit];
    If[Lookup[proposals, "Status", None] =!= "AVAILABLE",
      diagnostics = Join[diagnostics, Lookup[proposals, "Diagnostics", {}]]; Throw[False, tag]];
    regular = proposals["RegularExpression"];
    If[!supportedQ[regular],
      AppendTo[diagnostics, "The fixed explicit regular input is not closed and physical-denominator-only."];
      Throw[False, tag]];
    Do[
      value = residueCanonicalPropagators[source /. external, legs];
      If[!supportedQ[value], Continue[]];
      AppendTo[sourceRecords, <|"Expression" -> value, "Source" -> "ReducedPhysicalChannelSource"|>];
      If[rspSandwichExpansionCount[value] > constructionLimit,
        exceeded = True; Throw[False, tag]];
      value = withProtectedPropagators[value, Expand];
      terms = If[Head[value] === Plus, List @@ value, {value}];
      terms = Select[terms, # =!= 0 && !FreeQ[#, Power[_PropDen, _Integer?Negative]] && supportedQ[#] &];
      directions = completionNormalizeBasis[Join[directions, terms]];
      If[Length[directions] > constructionLimit, exceeded = True; Throw[False, tag]],
      {source, DeleteDuplicates[sources]}];
    rawCount = Length[directions];
    projected = completionNormalizeBasis[completionCompactExchangeProject[#, exchangePlan] & /@ directions];
    If[!AllTrue[projected, supportedQ],
      AppendTo[diagnostics, "Exchange projection exposed an unsupported physical denominator."];
      Throw[False, tag]];
    If[Length[projected] > 128 && remaining[] > 0.01,
      normalization = completionNormalizePhysicalColumns[projected, external,
        If[seconds === Infinity, 45, Min[45, 3 remaining[]/4]]];
      normalizedColumns = normalization["Basis"];
      rejected = Select[Range[Length[projected]], !closedQ[normalizedColumns[[#]]] ||
        !completionPhysicalDenominatorOnlyQ[normalizedColumns[[#]], normalized] &];
      Do[normalizedColumns[[i]] = projected[[i]], {i, rejected}];
      projected = normalizedColumns;
      normalization = Join[normalization, <|"RejectedPresentationColumns" -> rejected|>]];
    (* Cheaper columns are offered first to the exact pivot solve. Ordering and
       formal pruning preserve this complete finite proposal's functional span. *)
    projected = SortBy[completionNormalizeBasis[projected], preparationSortKey];
    basis = completionIndependentBasis[projected, If[seconds === Infinity, 15, Max[0.000001, remaining[]]]];
    If[AssociationQ[selectedChannels] && ListQ[Lookup[selectedChannels, "Sources", None]],
      (* A selected-cut numerator is one correlated continuation. Keep each
         accepted whole expression as a leading coordinate, instead of giving
         all of its monomials independent weights. Ordinary channel atoms
         remain available to complete every other residue and regular part. *)
      Do[
        value = residueCanonicalPropagators[source /. external, legs];
        If[!supportedQ[value], Continue[]];
        AppendTo[selectedRecords, <|"Expression" -> value,
          "Source" -> "OriginalSelectedCutWhole"|>],
        {source, DeleteDuplicates[selectedChannels["Sources"]]}];
      selectedControls = SortBy[completionNormalizeBasis[
        completionCompactExchangeProject[#["Expression"], exchangePlan] & /@ selectedRecords],
        preparationSortKey];
      If[!AllTrue[selectedControls, supportedQ],
        AppendTo[diagnostics, "Selected-source exchange projection exposed an unsupported denominator."];
        Throw[False, tag]];
      If[selectedControls =!= {},
        basis = completionIndependentBasis[
          completionNormalizeBasis[Join[selectedControls, basis]],
          If[seconds === Infinity, 15, Max[0.000001, remaining[]]]];
        candidateMode = "GroupedSelectedPhysicalSources"];
      selectedSourceVerification = KeyTake[selectedChannels,
        {"ConstructionStatus", "OriginalSourcesComplete", "InvariantContinuationsRequested",
          "InvariantContinuationsComplete", "Verification", "Scope", "ElapsedTime"}]];
    If[Length[basis] > limit, exceeded = True; Throw[False, tag]];
    True, tag], seconds, False];
  If[exceeded, AppendTo[diagnostics,
    "The complete reduced physical source proposal exceeds its source or correction-term cap."]];
  If[!TrueQ[complete] && diagnostics === {}, AppendTo[diagnostics,
    "Reduced physical source construction exceeded its shared time budget."]];
  <|"Status" -> If[TrueQ[complete] && basis =!= {}, "AVAILABLE", "UNAVAILABLE"],
    "Basis" -> If[TrueQ[complete], basis, {}], "RegularExpression" -> regular,
    "Sources" -> Join[selectedRecords, sourceRecords],
    "SourceCount" -> Length[selectedRecords] + Length[sourceRecords],
    "GroupedSelectedSourceCount" -> Length[selectedRecords],
    "GroupedSelectedControls" -> selectedControls,
    "SourceVerification" -> selectedSourceVerification,
    "RawDirectionCount" -> rawCount, "ProjectedDirectionCount" -> Length[basis],
    "WithinLimit" -> !exceeded, "CandidateMode" -> candidateMode,
    "ColumnNormalization" -> normalization, "ElapsedTime" -> AbsoluteTime[] - started,
    "Diagnostics" -> DeleteDuplicates[diagnostics],
    "Scope" -> "SmallerSourceDerivedPhysicalProposalRequiringEveryOriginalChannelAndFullFamilyValidation"|>
];

(* Select the continuation prescription, never the physical channels to test. *)
(* Ordinary conservation can expose numerator atoms absent from one fixed
   continuation frame. Keep the complete source-derived union and its rewrite
   provenance; no new pole type or independently chosen regular vertex enters. *)
completionConservationRelationQuotient[columns_List, routes_List, plan_Association, seconds_] := Module[
  {positions, key, coordinate, vectors = {}, routeIndices = {}, row, before, after,
   parts, vector, rule, entries, matrix, reduced, pivots, kept, transfer, proof,
   started=AbsoluteTime[], result, fallback, tag=Unique["conservationQuotient"]},
  fallback=<|"Status"->"UNRESOLVED","Basis"->columns,"PrunedDirections"->0,
    "NumericalKinematicsUsed"->False|>;
  If[Length[columns]<2 || routes==={} || !TrueQ[seconds>0],Return[fallback]];
  key[expression_] := With[{frozen=expression},HoldComplete[frozen]];
  positions=AssociationThread[key /@ columns,Range[Length[columns]]];
  coordinate[expression_] := coordinate[expression] = Module[{projected, normalized, position, coefficient},
    projected=completionCompactExchangeProject[expression,plan];
    normalized=completionNormalizeBasis[{projected}];
    If[normalized==={},Return[<||>]];
    If[Length[normalized]=!=1,Return[Missing["NonlinearConservationCoordinate"]]];
    position=Lookup[positions,key[First[normalized]],Missing["AbsentConservationCoordinate"]];
    If[MissingQ[position],Return[position]];
    coefficient=Cancel[Together[projected/First[normalized]]];
    If[!completionGaussianRationalQ[coefficient],Return[Missing["NonscalarConservationCoordinate"]]];
    <|position->coefficient|>
  ];
  result=TimeConstrained[Catch[
    Do[before=coordinate[routes[[index]]["Before"]];
      parts=Lookup[routes[[index]],"AfterTerms",{routes[[index]]["After"]}];
      after=coordinate /@ parts;
      If[!AssociationQ[before] || !AllTrue[after,AssociationQ],Continue[]];
      vector=Merge[Prepend[(-#& /@ #)& /@ after,before],Total];
      vector=Select[vector,#=!=0&];
      If[vector=!=<||>,AppendTo[vectors,vector];AppendTo[routeIndices,index]],
      {index,Length[routes]}];
    If[vectors==={},Throw[fallback,tag]];
    entries=Flatten[MapIndexed[Function[{v,index},KeyValueMap[({First[index],#1}->#2)&,v]],vectors],1];
    matrix=SparseArray[entries,{Length[vectors],Length[columns]}];
    reduced=RowReduce[matrix];
    pivots=Cases[Normal[reduced],v_List /; AnyTrue[v,#=!=0&] :>
      SelectFirst[Range[Length[v]],v[[#]]=!=0&]];
    kept=Complement[Range[Length[columns]],pivots];
    If[pivots==={} || kept==={},Throw[fallback,tag]];
    If[Normal[reduced[[Range[Length[pivots]],pivots]]] =!= IdentityMatrix[Length[pivots]],
      Throw[fallback,tag]];
    transfer=SparseArray[Join[Table[{kept[[i]],i}->1,{i,Length[kept]}],
      Flatten[Table[If[reduced[[i,kept[[j]]]]===0,Nothing,
        {pivots[[i]],j}->-reduced[[i,kept[[j]]]]],{i,Length[pivots]},{j,Length[kept]}],1]],
      {Length[columns],Length[kept]}];
    proof=matrix.transfer;
    If[AnyTrue[Last /@ ArrayRules[proof],#=!=0&],Throw[fallback,tag]];
    <|"Status"->"COMPLETE","Basis"->columns[[kept]],"OriginalBasis"->columns,
      "RetainedPositions"->kept,"RemovedPositions"->pivots,"PrunedDirections"->Length[pivots],
      "RelationRouteIndices"->routeIndices,"KnownRelationMatrix"->matrix,
      "ReducedRelationMatrix"->reduced,"ReconstructionMatrix"->transfer,
      "ReconstructionConstraintsVerified"->True,"OriginalSourceSpanPreserved"->True,
      "NumericalKinematicsUsed"->False,"ModelParameterSpecializationUsed"->False,
      "Method"->"ExactRationalQuotientOfRecordedOrdinaryMomentumIdentities",
      "ElapsedTime"->AbsoluteTime[]-started|>,tag],seconds,fallback];
  result
];

completionMomentumConservationBasis[seedSpace_Association, normalized_Association,
    plan_Association, constructionLimit_Integer, limit_Integer, seconds_] := Module[
  {external = normalized["ExternalMassRules"], legs, seeds = Lookup[seedSpace,"Basis",{}],
   directions, routes = {}, other, edit, value, terms, projected, sourceColumns, sourcePreserved=False,
   basis = {}, admission, sourceCertificate=Missing["NotConstructed"],
   started = AbsoluteTime[], completed, reason = None, buildLimit, quotient=Missing["NotRequested"],
   tag = Unique["conservationSpace"]},
  legs = Sort[Cases[external,HoldPattern[Mass[i_Integer]->_] :> i]];
  If[Length[legs] < 4 || seeds === {}, Return[Missing["NoConservationSources"]]];
  buildLimit=Max[constructionLimit,If[IntegerQ[$completionAutomaticCorrectionTermCeiling],
    Min[4096,$completionAutomaticCorrectionTermCeiling Max[1,Lookup[plan,"Order",1]]],constructionLimit]];
  directions = seeds;
  completed = TimeConstrained[Catch[
    Do[other = DeleteCases[legs,pivot];
      edit = With[{p=pivot,o=other,rules=external},Function[num,num /. {
        Mom[p] -> -Total[Mom /@ o], MomProd[p,p] -> (Mass[p]^2 /. rules),
        MomProd[p,j_Integer] /; MemberQ[o,j] :> -Total[MomProd[#,j]& /@ o],
        MomProd[i_Integer,p] /; MemberQ[o,i] :> -Total[MomProd[i,#]& /@ o]}]];
      Do[value = preparationNumerators[source,edit];
        If[value === source,Continue[]];
        value = withProtectedPropagators[value,Function[body,
          body /. SpinorChain -> SpinorChainReduced /. SpinorChainReduced -> SpinorChain]] /. external;
        If[!residueFiniteQ[value] || !completionPhysicalDenominatorOnlyQ[value,normalized],
          reason="UnsupportedConservationColumn";Throw[False,tag]];
        If[rspSandwichExpansionCount[value] > buildLimit,
          reason="ConservationExpansionLimit";Throw[False,tag]];
        value = withProtectedPropagators[value,Expand];
        terms = If[Head[value] === Plus,List @@ value,{value}];
        (* Correlate any regular terms with their original whole source,
           rather than making an independent contact coefficient. *)
        If[AnyTrue[terms,FreeQ[#,Power[_PropDen,_Integer?Negative]]&],terms={value}];
        directions=completionNormalizeBasis[Join[directions,terms]];
        AppendTo[routes,<|"EliminatedMomentum"->pivot,"Before"->source,"After"->value,
          "AfterTerms"->terms,
          "Identity"->"ExternalMomentumConservation","NumeratorOnly"->True,
          "InternalOnShellIdentity"->False|>];
        If[Length[directions]>buildLimit,reason="ConservationSourceLimit";Throw[False,tag]],
        {source,seeds}],{pivot,legs}];
    projected=completionNormalizeBasis[completionCompactExchangeProject[#,plan]& /@ directions];
    quotient=completionConservationRelationQuotient[projected,routes,plan,
      Max[0.000001,Min[5,seconds-(AbsoluteTime[]-started)]]];
    sourceColumns=completionNormalizeBasis[completionCompactExchangeProject[#,plan]& /@ seeds];
    sourcePreserved=AllTrue[sourceColumns,MemberQ[projected,#]&];
    If[AssociationQ[quotient] && Lookup[quotient,"Status",None]==="COMPLETE" &&
        TrueQ[Lookup[quotient,"ReconstructionConstraintsVerified",False]] &&
        TrueQ[Lookup[quotient,"OriginalSourceSpanPreserved",False]] && quotient["OriginalBasis"]===projected,
      basis=quotient["Basis"];
      sourceCertificate=<|"Method"->"ExactRecordedIdentityReconstruction",
        "SourceColumnsInOriginalUnion"->sourcePreserved,
        "ReconstructionConstraintsVerified"->True|>,
      (* A timed-out quotient must keep the entire source union. Formal
         pruning without its reconstruction data is unnecessary here. *)
      basis=projected;
      sourceCertificate=<|"Method"->"CompleteUnprunedSourceUnion",
        "SourceColumnsInOriginalUnion"->sourcePreserved,
        "ReconstructionConstraintsVerified"->True|>];
    If[!TrueQ[sourcePreserved],reason="UncertifiedConservationSourceSpan";Throw[False,tag]];
    admission=completionMaterializedBasisCap[basis,Automatic,limit,$completionAutomaticCorrectionTermCeiling];
    If[Length[basis]>admission["EffectiveMaxCorrectionTerms"],reason="ConservationCorrectionLimit";Throw[False,tag]];
    True,tag],seconds,False];
  <|"Status"->If[TrueQ[completed],"AVAILABLE","UNAVAILABLE"],
    "Basis"->If[TrueQ[completed],basis,{}],"RegularExpression"->Lookup[seedSpace,"RegularExpression",0],
    "CandidateMode"->"OrdinaryMomentumConservationClosure","RewriteRoutes"->routes,
    "OrdinaryRelationQuotient"->quotient,
    "OriginalSourceSpanPreserved"->TrueQ[completed && sourcePreserved],
    "SourceSpanCertificate"->sourceCertificate,
    "InitialDirections"->Length[seeds],"RawDirectionCount"->Length[directions],
    "ProjectedDirectionCount"->Length[basis],
    "EffectiveMaxCorrectionTerms"->If[AssociationQ[admission],admission["EffectiveMaxCorrectionTerms"],limit],
    "CapChanges"->If[AssociationQ[admission],Lookup[admission,"CapChanges",{}] /.
      "ReuseCompleteExchangeUnion"->"ReuseMomentumConservationClosure",{}],
    "ElapsedTime"->AbsoluteTime[]-started,
    "Diagnostics"->If[TrueQ[completed],{}, {If[reason===None,"Momentum-conservation source construction exceeded its bounded clock.",reason]}],
    "Scope"->"OrdinarySourceDerivedNumeratorClosureRequiringAllOriginalCutsAndFullFamilyValidation"|>
];

completionConservationSpaceUsableQ[space_] := AssociationQ[space] &&
  Lookup[space,"Status",None] === "AVAILABLE" && ListQ[Lookup[space,"Basis",None]] &&
  space["Basis"] =!= {} && TrueQ[Lookup[space,"OriginalSourceSpanPreserved",False]] &&
  TrueQ[Lookup[Lookup[space,"SourceSpanCertificate",<||>],"ReconstructionConstraintsVerified",False]] &&
  Lookup[space,"RawDirectionCount",0] > Lookup[space,"InitialDirections",0];

completionPreferredReferenceVariantQ[variant_Association, choice_] := Module[
  {mode = Lookup[variant, "Mode", None], assignments = Lookup[variant, "Assignments", {}], kinds},
  If[!TrueQ[Lookup[variant, "Accepted", False]], Return[False]];
  kinds = DeleteDuplicates[Lookup[assignments, "Mode", {}]];
  Switch[choice,
    "AllSpurious", MemberQ[{"AllSpurious", "Cyclic", "ReverseCyclic", "RotatedCyclic"}, mode] ||
      mode === "PreparedReferences" && kinds =!= {} && AllTrue[kinds, MemberQ[{"AllSpurious", "Cyclic", "ReverseCyclic"}, #] &],
    "Cyclic", MemberQ[{"AllSpurious", "Cyclic"}, mode],
    "ReverseCyclic", mode === "ReverseCyclic",
    "Mixed", MemberQ[{"AllPhysical", "AllSpurious", "Cyclic", "ReverseCyclic", "RotatedCyclic", "Mixed"}, mode] ||
      mode === "PreparedReferences" && kinds =!= {} && AllTrue[kinds, MemberQ[{"AllPhysical", "AllSpurious", "Cyclic", "ReverseCyclic"}, #] &],
    "Xi", mode === "Xi" || mode === "PreparedReferences" && kinds === {"Xi"},
    "IndependentXi", mode === "IndependentXi" || mode === "PreparedReferences" && kinds === {"IndependentXi"},
    "AllPhysical", mode === "AllPhysical" || mode === "PreparedReferences" && kinds === {"AllPhysical"},
    _, False]
];

(* A bounded source-derived proposal retaining the selected external reference
   prescription. All true propagators remain. Every original residue and the
   complete affine family still require the ordinary independent validation. *)
completionPreferredReferenceBasis[normalized_Association, channelPreparation_,
    exchangePlan_Association, constructionLimit_Integer, limit_Integer, seconds_,
    continuations_Association, choice_, reducedChannels_: Missing["NotProvided"]] := Module[
  {started = AbsoluteTime[], external = normalized["ExternalMassRules"], legs, targets,
   allowed, variants, sourceRecords = {}, sources = {}, directions = {}, basis = {},
   regular = Missing["NotCollected"], proposals, channelNormalized, preparedChoice,
   inverseProps, closedQ, supportedQ, appendSource, higher, terms, value, reduced,
   diagnostics = {}, complete, exceeded = False, tag = Unique["preferredReferenceBasis"]},
  If[choice === "AllPhysical", Return[completionPhysicalChannelBasis[normalized,
    channelPreparation, exchangePlan, constructionLimit, limit, seconds, reducedChannels]]];
  If[!MemberQ[{"AllSpurious", "Mixed", "Cyclic", "ReverseCyclic", "Xi", "IndependentXi"}, choice],
    Return[<|"Status" -> "UNAVAILABLE", "Basis" -> {}, "PolePreference" -> choice,
      "RegularExpression" -> regular, "Diagnostics" -> {"No explicit reference preference was requested."}|>]];
  legs = Cases[external, HoldPattern[Mass[i_Integer] -> _] :> i];
  targets = completionTargets[normalized["Targets"]];
  allowed = residueChannelKey /@ Select[targets, KeyExistsQ[#, "ChannelExpression"] &];
  closedQ[expression_] := FreeQ[expression,
    _xFactor | _xTildeFactor |
    (Spinor | SpinorHat)[_, ("Angle" | "Square"), _Multiparticle, ___] |
    (Spinor | SpinorHat)[_, ("Upper" | "Lower"), ("Angle" | "Square"), _Multiparticle, ___]] &&
    (MemberQ[{"Xi", "IndependentXi"}, choice] || FreeQ[expression, (Spinor | SpinorHat)["Xi", ___]]);
  supportedQ[expression_] := Module[{props, keys, orders},
    If[!residueFiniteQ[expression] || !closedQ[expression], Return[False]];
    (* Additional reference brackets are allowed in these modes, but a typed
       propagator absent from the supplied physical channels is not silently
       promoted from a zero-residue obligation into a physical channel. *)
    props = DeleteDuplicates[Flatten[Cases[{expression}, Power[base_, exponent_] /;
      !(NumericQ[exponent] && TrueQ[exponent >= 0]) :>
        Cases[base, _PropDen, {0, Infinity}], Infinity]]];
    keys = residuePropagatorKey[#, legs] & /@ props;
    If[AnyTrue[keys, MissingQ] || !AllTrue[keys, Function[key,
        AnyTrue[allowed, First[#] === First[key] && residueExactZero[Last[#]^2 - Last[key]^2] &]]], Return[False]];
    orders = completionHigherPhysicalPoles[expression, targets, legs];
    ListQ[orders] && orders === {}
  ];
  appendSource[expression_, origin_] := Module[{canonical},
    canonical = residueCanonicalPropagators[expression /. external, legs];
    If[canonical =!= 0 && supportedQ[canonical],
      AppendTo[sourceRecords, <|"Expression" -> canonical, "Source" -> origin|>]]];
  complete = TimeConstrained[Catch[
    proposals = completionInputProposals[normalized, constructionLimit];
    If[Lookup[proposals, "Status", None] =!= "AVAILABLE",
      diagnostics = Join[diagnostics, Lookup[proposals, "Diagnostics", {}]]; Throw[False, tag]];
    regular = proposals["RegularExpression"];
    Do[appendSource[record["Expression"], "PreparedInput"], {record, normalized["Records"]}];
    preparedChoice = If[AssociationQ[channelPreparation],
      completionPolePreference[Automatic, channelPreparation], None];
    If[preparedChoice === choice && ListQ[Lookup[channelPreparation, "PreparedAmplitudes", None]] &&
        completionModelQ[Lookup[channelPreparation, "Model", None]],
      channelNormalized = residueSimpleInputs[0, channelPreparation["PreparedAmplitudes"], channelPreparation["Model"]];
      If[AssociationQ[channelNormalized], Do[
        If[TrueQ[Lookup[target, "Complete", False]] && KeyExistsQ[target, "StateSum"],
          appendSource[target["StateSum"]/target["Propagator"], "PreparedReferenceChannel"]],
        {target, completionTargets[channelNormalized["Targets"]]}]]];
    variants = Select[Lookup[continuations, "Variants", {}], completionPreferredReferenceVariantQ[#, choice] &];
    Do[appendSource[variant["Expression"], <|"Kind" -> "PreferredChannelContinuation",
        "Mode" -> variant["Mode"], "Cut" -> Lookup[variant, "Cut", Missing["NotRecorded"]]|>],
      {variant, variants}];
    (* A lower-point channel that already has no references has no external
       reference decision to contradict this preference. *)
    Do[If[TrueQ[Lookup[target, "Complete", False]] && KeyExistsQ[target, "StateSum"] &&
        FreeQ[target["StateSum"], (Spinor | SpinorHat)["Xi", ___]],
      appendSource[target["StateSum"]/target["Propagator"], "ReferenceFreeChannel"]], {target, targets}];
    sourceRecords = DeleteDuplicatesBy[sourceRecords, #["Expression"] &];
    If[sourceRecords === {}, AppendTo[diagnostics, "No closed continuation matching the requested pole preference was available."];
      Throw[False, tag]];
    Do[
      value = record["Expression"];
      reduced = TimeConstrained[completionExternalReduce[value, external],
        Max[0.000001, Min[1, seconds/Max[1, 2 Length[sourceRecords]]]], $TimedOut];
      sources = DeleteDuplicates[Join[sources, {value},
        If[residueFiniteQ[reduced] && supportedQ[reduced], {reduced}, {}]]], {record, sourceRecords}];
    Do[
      If[rspSandwichExpansionCount[source] > constructionLimit,
        terms = {source}, value = withProtectedPropagators[source, Expand];
        terms = If[Head[value] === Plus, List @@ value, {value}]];
      terms = Select[terms, # =!= 0 && !FreeQ[#, Power[_PropDen, _Integer?Negative]] && supportedQ[#] &];
      directions = completionNormalizeBasis[Join[directions, terms]];
      If[Length[directions] > constructionLimit, exceeded = True; Throw[False, tag]], {source, sources}];
    directions = completionCompactExchangeProject[#, exchangePlan] & /@ directions;
    If[!AllTrue[directions, supportedQ], AppendTo[diagnostics,
      "Exchange projection produced an unsupported continuation; the ordinary fallback is retained."]; Throw[False, tag]];
    basis = completionIndependentBasis[completionNormalizeBasis[directions],
      If[seconds === Infinity, 5, Max[0.000001, seconds - (AbsoluteTime[] - started)]]];
    If[Length[basis] > limit, exceeded = True; Throw[False, tag]];
    True, tag], seconds, False];
  If[exceeded, AppendTo[diagnostics, "The preferred-reference source space exceeded its term cap; no arbitrary directions were discarded."]];
  If[!TrueQ[complete] && diagnostics === {}, AppendTo[diagnostics,
    "Preferred-reference source construction exhausted its shared time budget."]];
  <|"Status" -> If[TrueQ[complete] && basis =!= {}, "AVAILABLE", "UNAVAILABLE"],
    "Basis" -> If[TrueQ[complete], basis, {}], "RegularExpression" -> regular,
    "PolePreference" -> choice, "Sources" -> sourceRecords,
    "RawDirectionCount" -> Length[directions], "ProjectedDirectionCount" -> Length[basis],
    "WithinLimit" -> !exceeded, "ElapsedTime" -> AbsoluteTime[] - started,
    "Diagnostics" -> DeleteDuplicates[diagnostics],
    "Scope" -> "ReferencePreferredProposalRequiringOriginalAllChannelAndFamilyValidation"|>
];

(* Choose a small particular point of an already certified affine family.
   Formal monomial constraints use exact coefficients only. Explicit regular
   monomial coefficients stay fixed. The complete direction list and its
   physical nullspace are never pruned here. *)
completionChooseFamilyPoint[candidate_, directions_List, free_List, seconds_ : 2] := Module[
  {count = Length[directions], before = Missing["NotMeasured"],
   bestRank = Missing["NotMeasured"], best = candidate, bestValues, bestRecord,
   started = AbsoluteTime[], tried = {}, columns, keys, rows, costs, density,
   orders, regularRows = {}, movableRows, outcome, tag = Unique["familyPointSelection"], scalar, split, pick,
   values, proposal, rank, termCounts, reason, timedOut = False},
  bestValues = ConstantArray[0, count];
  bestRecord = <|"Amplitude" -> best, "Values" -> bestValues, "Rank" -> bestRank|>;
  reason = "No strictly simpler completed family point was found.";
  If[count === 0 || Length[free] =!= count || count > 128 ||
      !DuplicateFreeQ[free] || !AllTrue[free, Head[#] === Symbol &] ||
      !(seconds === Infinity || TrueQ[NumericQ[seconds] &&
        Element[seconds, Reals] && 0 < seconds < Infinity]),
    Return[<|"Status" -> "UNCHANGED", "Amplitude" -> candidate,
      "Values" -> bestValues, "RankBefore" -> before, "RankAfter" -> bestRank,
      "OrdersTried" -> {}, "DirectionsRetained" -> count, "TimedOut" -> False,
      "ProtectedRegularMonomials" -> 0,
      "Reason" -> "No eligible bounded affine family was supplied.",
      "ElapsedTime" -> AbsoluteTime[] - started|>]];
  scalar[term_] := Times @@ Select[If[Head[term] === Times, List @@ term, {term}],
    NumberQ[#] && Precision[#] === Infinity &];
  split[expression_] := Module[{expanded, terms},
    expanded = withProtectedPropagators[expression, Expand];
    terms = If[Head[expanded] === Plus, List @@ expanded,
      If[expanded === 0, {}, {expanded}]];
    Merge[(With[{factor = scalar[#]},
      Association[Cancel[#/factor] -> factor]] & /@ terms), Total]
  ];
  pick[order_List] := Module[
    {rules = {}, remaining = free, equation, pivot, rule, steps = 0},
    (* Preserve every explicit regular coefficient, including a zero one
       that a direction could otherwise create. These constraints choose
       this representative only; they do not remove the contact directions. *)
    Do[
      equation = Expand[Rest[rows[[index]]].free /. rules];
      If[equation === 0, Continue[]];
      pivot = SelectFirst[remaining,
        !TrueQ[Coefficient[equation, #] === 0] &, None];
      If[pivot === None, Continue[]];
      rule = pivot -> Cancel[-(equation /. pivot -> 0)/Coefficient[equation, pivot]];
      rules = Append[rules /. rule, rule];
      remaining = DeleteCases[remaining, pivot]; steps++;
      If[remaining === {} || steps >= count, Break[]],
      {index, regularRows}];
    If[remaining === {}, Return[free /. rules]];
    Do[
      equation = Expand[(First[rows[[index]]] + Rest[rows[[index]]].free) /. rules];
      If[equation === 0, Continue[]];
      pivot = SelectFirst[remaining,
        !TrueQ[Coefficient[equation, #] === 0] &, None];
      If[pivot === None, Continue[]];
      rule = pivot -> Cancel[-(equation /. pivot -> 0)/Coefficient[equation, pivot]];
      rules = Append[rules /. rule, rule];
      remaining = DeleteCases[remaining, pivot]; steps++;
      If[remaining === {} || steps >= count, Break[]],
      {index, order}];
    free /. rules /. Thread[remaining -> 0]
  ];
  outcome = TimeConstrained[Catch[
    If[!residueFiniteQ[candidate] || !AllTrue[directions, residueFiniteQ] ||
        !FreeQ[Prepend[directions, candidate],
          number_?NumberQ /; Precision[number] =!= Infinity] ||
        !FreeQ[Prepend[directions, candidate], Alternatives @@ free],
      Throw["Only finite exact family coefficients independent of their coordinates are eligible.", tag]];
    termCounts = rspSandwichExpansionCount /@ Prepend[directions, candidate];
    If[Max[termCounts] > 4096 || Total[termCounts] > 8192,
      Throw["The family exceeded the bounded formal expansion size.", tag]];
    before = preparationRank[candidate];
    bestRecord = <|"Amplitude" -> candidate, "Values" -> bestValues, "Rank" -> before|>;
    columns = split /@ Prepend[directions, candidate];
    keys = DeleteDuplicates[Flatten[Keys /@ columns]];
    If[keys === {} || Length[keys] > 4096,
      Throw["The family exceeded the bounded formal monomial size.", tag]];
    rows = Transpose[Lookup[#, keys, 0] & /@ columns];
    regularRows = Select[Range[Length[keys]], FreeQ[Denominator[keys[[#]]], _PropDen] &];
    movableRows = Complement[Range[Length[keys]], regularRows];
    If[movableRows === {},
      Throw["No pole-bearing coefficients are available for reweighting; the original regular expression is retained.", tag]];
    costs = ({expressionComplexity[#], LeafCount[#]} & /@ keys);
    density = Count[Rest[#], Except[0]] & /@ rows;
    orders = {
      "LowComplexityFirst" -> SortBy[movableRows, costs[[#]] &],
      "HighComplexityFirst" -> Reverse[SortBy[movableRows, costs[[#]] &]],
      "SparseHighComplexityFirst" -> SortBy[movableRows,
        {density[[#]], -costs[[#, 1]]} &],
      "DenseHighComplexityFirst" -> SortBy[movableRows,
        {-density[[#]], -costs[[#, 1]]} &],
      "ExistingHighComplexityFirst" -> SortBy[movableRows,
        {If[First[rows[[#]]] === 0, 1, 0], -costs[[#, 1]]} &],
      "NewHighComplexityFirst" -> SortBy[movableRows,
        {If[First[rows[[#]]] === 0, 0, 1], -costs[[#, 1]]} &]};
    Do[
      values = pick[Last[order]];
      If[Length[values] =!= count || !AllTrue[values, residueFiniteQ] ||
          !FreeQ[values, Alternatives @@ free], Continue[]];
      proposal = withProtectedPropagators[candidate + values.directions, Expand];
      If[!residueFiniteQ[proposal], Continue[]];
      rank = preparationRank[proposal];
      AppendTo[tried, <|"Order" -> First[order], "Rank" -> rank|>];
      If[preparationBetterQ[rank, bestRecord["Rank"]],
        bestRecord = <|"Amplitude" -> proposal, "Values" -> values, "Rank" -> rank|>],
      {order, orders}];
    True, tag], seconds, False];
  best = bestRecord["Amplitude"]; bestValues = bestRecord["Values"];
  bestRank = bestRecord["Rank"];
  Which[outcome === False, timedOut = True;
      reason = "Bounded family selection stopped at its time budget; the best completed point is retained.",
    StringQ[outcome], reason = outcome,
    best =!= candidate, reason = "A strictly simpler point was selected within the same affine family."];
  <|"Status" -> If[best === candidate, "UNCHANGED", "IMPROVED"],
    "Amplitude" -> best, "Values" -> bestValues,
    "RankBefore" -> before, "RankAfter" -> bestRank,
    "OrdersTried" -> tried, "DirectionsRetained" -> count,
    "ProtectedRegularMonomials" -> Length[regularRows],
    "TimedOut" -> timedOut, "Reason" -> reason,
    "ElapsedTime" -> AbsoluteTime[] - started|>
];

completionRecordedReferenceTables[normalized_Association] := DeleteDuplicates[
  Select[(Lookup[Lookup[#, "PolePreference", <||>], "Assignments", {}] & /@
    Lookup[normalized, "DiagramReports", {}]), # =!= {} &]];

(* Preparation reports are explicit inputs, never an expression-keyed cache.
   The original channel rows remain authoritative even when the supplied
   preparation selected a different off-cut continuation. *)
completionPreparedChannelsQ[value_] := AssociationQ[value] &&
  completionModelQ[Lookup[value, "Model", None]] &&
  ListQ[Lookup[value, "OriginalAmplitudes", None]] &&
  ListQ[Lookup[value, "PreparedAmplitudes", None]] &&
  Length[value["OriginalAmplitudes"]] === Length[value["PreparedAmplitudes"]] &&
  AllTrue[Join[value["OriginalAmplitudes"], value["PreparedAmplitudes"]], preparationChannelQ] &&
  (Most /@ value["OriginalAmplitudes"]) === (Most /@ value["PreparedAmplitudes"]) &&
  (!KeyExistsQ[value, "RemainderData"] ||
    ListQ[value["RemainderData"]] &&
      Length[value["RemainderData"]] === Length[value["PreparedAmplitudes"]] &&
      AllTrue[value["RemainderData"], AssociationQ]);

(* This exposes virtualities by ordinary algebra; it never sets one to zero.
   Inverse factors are protected, just as in diagram-local preparation. *)
completionExposePairVirtualities[expression_, targets_List, external_List] := Module[
  {legs, pairs, sides, replacements},
  legs = Cases[external, HoldPattern[Mass[i_Integer] -> _] :> i];
  pairs = Flatten[Table[sides = {target["Cut"], Complement[legs, target["Cut"]]};
    ({#, target["Mass"]} & /@ Select[sides, Length[#] === 2 &]), {target, targets}], 1];
  pairs = DeleteDuplicatesBy[pairs, Sort[First[#]] &];
  replacements = Map[Function[pair, With[{a = First[pair][[1]], b = First[pair][[2]], mass = Last[pair]},
    orderedDot[a, b] -> (PropDen[Mom[Multiparticle @@ Sort[{a, b}]], mass] +
      mass^2 - (Mass[a] /. external)^2 - (Mass[b] /. external)^2)/2]], pairs];
  preparationReduceDots[expression, replacements]
];

(* A few exact equations on one cut can reject an inadequate small space.
   A consistent probe never certifies success: the ordinary complete fit and
   all held-out spin/parameter checks still run with the user's sample count. *)
completionPreparationProbe[constant_, basis_List, normalized_Association,
    rules_List, seed_Integer, seconds_: 2] := Module[
  {targets = completionTargets[normalized["Targets"]], channel, representatives, schedule, unknowns,
   components = Prepend[basis, constant], equations = {}, samples = {},
   chart, result, expected, difference, added, solution = <||>, completed,
   tag = Unique["remainderProbe"], status = "NOT_REJECTED", started = AbsoluteTime[]},
  channel = SelectFirst[SortBy[targets, Length[#["Cut"]] &],
    TrueQ[Lookup[#, "Complete", False]] && !TrueQ[residueExactZero[Lookup[#, "StateSum", 0]]] &,
    Missing["NoNonzeroTarget"]];
  If[MissingQ[channel], Return[<|"Status" -> status, "Samples" -> {}, "ElapsedTime" -> 0|>]];
  representatives = DeleteDuplicatesBy[Select[SortBy[targets, Length[#["Cut"]] &],
    TrueQ[Lookup[#, "Complete", False]] && !TrueQ[residueExactZero[Lookup[#, "StateSum", 0]]] &],
    Length[#["Cut"]] &];
  If[Length[representatives] === 1 && Length[basis] > 8,
    Return[<|"Status" -> status, "Samples" -> {}, "ElapsedTime" -> AbsoluteTime[] - started,
      "Reason" -> "The broad one-cut-size space is left to the complete simultaneous fit."|>]];
  schedule = Join[Rest[representatives],
    ConstantArray[First[representatives], Min[20, Max[4, Length[basis] + 1]]]];
  unknowns = Table[Unique["remainderProbeCoefficient"], {Length[basis]}];
  completed = TimeConstrained[Catch[
    Do[
      channel = schedule[[sample]];
      chart = completionCutChart[channel, sample, seed + 709201, rules];
      If[FailureQ[chart], Continue[]];
      result = completionLinearResidue[components, unknowns, channel, targets, chart, seconds];
      If[!AssociationQ[result] || Lookup[result, "Status", None] =!= "PASS", Continue[]];
      expected = residueOnChart[channel["StateSum"], {channel},
        {First[result["PoleVariables"]]}, chart["Map"], {}];
      difference = result["PhysicalResidue"] - expected;
      If[!residueFiniteQ[difference] || residueUnmappedQ[difference], Continue[]];
      added = completionCoefficientEquations[difference, chart["SpinVariables"], unknowns];
      If[FailureQ[added], Continue[]];
      equations = Join[equations, added];
      AppendTo[samples, <|"Cut" -> channel["Cut"], "Sample" -> sample|>];
      If[Mod[Length[samples], 2] === 0,
        If[!FreeQ[equations, number_?NumberQ /; Precision[number] =!= Infinity],
          Throw[True, tag]];
        solution = completionSolveLinear[equations, unknowns];
        If[Lookup[solution, "Status", None] === "INCONSISTENT",
          status = "INCONSISTENT"; Throw[True, tag]]],
      {sample, Length[schedule]}]; True, tag], seconds, False];
  <|"Status" -> status, "Samples" -> samples, "EquationCount" -> Length[equations],
    "LinearSolution" -> solution, "TimedOut" -> !TrueQ[completed],
    "ElapsedTime" -> AbsoluteTime[] - started,
    "Scope" -> "ExactEarlyRejectionOnlyFullValidationStillRequired"|>
];

(* Keep small groups from the actual discarded expressions. Their numerical
   coefficients will be fitted simultaneously; no shell rule is imposed on
   the assembled trial. Caps reject a space rather than truncate its basis. *)
completionPreparationBasis[input_, channelPreparation_, normalized_Association,
    plan_Association, limit_Integer, seconds_: 10] := Module[
  {external = normalized["ExternalMassRules"], targets, records, channelRecords,
   preparedRows, originalRows, fixedRows, originalTargets, fixedTargets, preparedTargets, matches, channel,
   source, preparedSource, seed, regular = 0, proposals, directions = {}, basis = {},
   groups = {}, mappings = {}, diagnostics = {}, completed, exceeded = False,
   buildLimit, started = AbsoluteTime[], degree, add, transform, split, value,
   common, commonSources = {}, references = {}, mode, recordIndex = 0,
   tag = Unique["preparationRemainderSpace"]},
  targets = completionTargets[normalized["Targets"]];
  records = If[AssociationQ[input], Lookup[input, "RemainderData", {}], {}];
  records = Select[If[ListQ[records], records, {}], AssociationQ];
  channelRecords = If[completionPreparedChannelsQ[channelPreparation],
    Lookup[channelPreparation, "RemainderData", {}], {}];
  If[records === {} && channelRecords === {}, Return[Missing["NoPreparationRemainders"]]];
  commonSources = Map[Function[record, With[{entry = SelectFirst[
      Lookup[record, "ReferenceContinuations", {}], Lookup[#, "Mode", None] === "Xi" &, Missing[]]},
    If[AssociationQ[entry], entry["Expression"], Missing["NoCommonReferenceSource"]]]], records];
  If[records =!= {} && FreeQ[commonSources, _Missing],
    groups = {<|"Mode" -> "CommonXi", "Expression" -> Total[commonSources], "IsIdentity" -> False|>}];
  buildLimit = Max[limit, Min[4096, limit Max[1, Lookup[plan, "Order", 1]]]];
  degree[chain_SpinorChain] := Count[List @@ chain, _Mom];
  degree[trace_SpinorTrace] := Count[List @@ trace, _Mom];
  degree[product_Times] := Total[degree /@ List @@ product];
  degree[Power[v_, n_Integer?Positive]] := n degree[v];
  degree[_] := 0;
  transform[v_] := completionCanonicalReduce[canonicalChains[
    If[Lookup[plan, "Order", 1] === 1, v, completionBoseProject[v, plan]]], external];
  add[v_, metadata_Association] := Module[{projected},
    If[v === 0 || !residueFiniteQ[v], Return[]];
    projected = transform[v];
    If[projected === 0, Return[]];
    AppendTo[directions, projected];
    AppendTo[mappings, Join[metadata, <|"Expression" -> projected|>]];
    If[Length[directions] > buildLimit, exceeded = True; Throw[False, tag]]
  ];
  split[v_, metadata_Association] := Module[{body, expanded, terms, components},
    If[v === 0 || !residueFiniteQ[v], Return[]];
    (* Preserve products long enough for the directed sandwich contractions;
       the broad whole-product Schouten reducer can obscure these groups. *)
    body = TimeConstrained[preparationFactorizedReferenceTrial[
      preparationConservedMomentumChains[v, external, True, {}], external, {}, {}, True], 2, v];
    body = completionExposePairVirtualities[body, targets, external];
    If[rspSandwichExpansionCount[body] > buildLimit,
      AppendTo[diagnostics, "An oversized remainder was retained as one group."];
      add[body, Join[metadata, <|"Grouping" -> "WholeRemainder"|>]]; Return[]];
    expanded = preparationProtectedDenominators[body, Expand];
    terms = If[Head[expanded] === Plus, List @@ expanded, {expanded}];
    If[AnyTrue[terms, # =!= 0 && FreeQ[Denominator[#], _PropDen] &],
      add[body, Join[metadata, <|"Grouping" -> "WholeRemainderWithRegularTerms"|>]]; Return[]];
    components = GroupBy[terms, degree, Total];
    KeyValueMap[(add[#2, Join[metadata, <|"Grouping" -> "MomentumDegree",
      "MomentumDegree" -> #1|>]]) &, components]
  ];
  completed = TimeConstrained[Catch[
    proposals = completionInputProposals[normalized, buildLimit];
    If[Lookup[proposals, "Status", None] =!= "AVAILABLE",
      exceeded = True; Throw[False, tag]];
    regular = proposals["RegularExpression"];
    seed = normalized["Expression"];
    Do[add[proposal["Direction"], <|"Source" -> "PreparedInput", "Mode" -> proposal["Mode"]|>],
      {proposal, proposals["Proposals"]}];
    Do[recordIndex++;
      value = Lookup[record, "ShellRemainder", Missing["Unavailable"]];
      If[!MissingQ[value], split[value, <|"Source" -> "DiagramRemainder", "Item" -> recordIndex,
        "OnShellChannels" -> Lookup[record, "OnShellChannels", {}]|>]];
      Null, {record, records}];
    If[channelRecords =!= {},
      originalRows = channelPreparation["OriginalAmplitudes"];
      preparedRows = channelPreparation["PreparedAmplitudes"];
      originalTargets = completionTargets[residueSimpleInputs[0, originalRows, channelPreparation["Model"]]["Targets"]];
      preparedTargets = completionTargets[residueSimpleInputs[0, preparedRows, channelPreparation["Model"]]["Targets"]];
      fixedRows = MapThread[Function[{row, data},
        With[{fixed = Lookup[data, "FixedReferenceExpression", Missing[]]},
          If[MissingQ[fixed], row, ReplacePart[row, -1 -> fixed]]]],
        {originalRows, channelRecords}];
      fixedTargets = completionTargets[residueSimpleInputs[0, fixedRows, channelPreparation["Model"]]["Targets"]];
      Do[
        matches = Select[preparedTargets, residueChannelKey[#] === residueChannelKey[channel] &];
        If[Length[matches] =!= 1, Continue[]];
        preparedSource = First[matches]["StateSum"]/First[matches]["Propagator"];
        split[preparedSource, <|"Source" -> "PreparedChannel", "Cut" -> channel["Cut"]|>];
        matches = Select[fixedTargets, residueChannelKey[#] === residueChannelKey[channel] &];
        If[Length[matches] === 1,
          source = First[matches]["StateSum"]/First[matches]["Propagator"];
          If[FreeQ[source, _xFactor | _xTildeFactor | (Spinor | SpinorHat)["Xi", ___]],
            split[source - preparedSource, <|"Source" -> "ChannelRemainder", "Cut" -> channel["Cut"],
              "OnShellChannels" -> {channel["Cut"]}|>]]], {channel, originalTargets}]];
    basis = completionIndependentBasis[completionNormalizeBasis[directions],
      If[seconds === Infinity, 5, Max[0.000001, seconds - (AbsoluteTime[] - started)]]];
    True, tag], seconds, False];
  If[basis === {} && directions =!= {}, basis = completionNormalizeBasis[directions]];
  If[exceeded || Length[basis] > limit, basis = Missing["PreparationRemainderSpaceLimit"]];
  If[!TrueQ[completed], AppendTo[diagnostics,
    "Remainder construction stopped at its budget; only completed groups are available."]];
  <|"Basis" -> basis, "RegularExpression" -> regular, "Mappings" -> mappings,
    "ReferenceAlternatives" -> groups, "RawDirectionCount" -> Length[directions],
    "ConstructionStatus" -> If[TrueQ[completed] && !exceeded, "COMPLETE", "PARTIAL"],
    "ElapsedTime" -> AbsoluteTime[] - started, "Diagnostics" -> DeleteDuplicates[diagnostics],
    "Scope" -> "RetainedPreparationCorrectionsWithOriginalAllChannelTargets"|>
];

completionAssignedReferences[expression_, inferred_List, recorded_List,
    externalRules_List, physical_List, own_List] := Module[
  {settings = {}, choices, key, tag = Unique["completionReferences"], fail,
   rewrite, transformed, denominators = {}, external, opposite, selected},
  external = Cases[externalRules, HoldPattern[Mass[i_Integer] -> _] :> i];
  fail[] := Throw[Failure["UnavailableRecordedReferences", <||>], tag];
  Catch[
    Do[
      key = {assignment["Leg"], assignment["Reference"][[2]]};
      choices = DeleteDuplicatesBy[Select[recorded,
        Lookup[#, "Leg", None] === First[key] &&
          MatchQ[Lookup[#, "Reference", None], _Spinor] &&
          #["Reference"][[2]] === Last[key] &],
        {Lookup[#, "Mode", None], Lookup[#, "Target", None]} &];
      If[Length[choices] =!= 1, fail[]];
      selected = Join[First[choices], KeyTake[assignment, {"Reference", "Leg"}]];
      If[selected["Mode"] === "AllPhysical",
        key = {canonicalPhysicalCut[Sort[{selected["Leg"], selected["Target"]}], external],
          Mass[selected["Target"]] /. externalRules};
        If[!MemberQ[physical, key] || MemberQ[own, key], fail[]]];
      AppendTo[settings, selected], {assignment, inferred}];
    opposite["Angle"] := "Square"; opposite["Square"] := "Angle";
    rewrite[chain_SpinorChain] := Module[
      {parts = List @@ chain, left, right, middle, first, last, sign = 1, setting, a, b, ref},
      If[FreeQ[chain, Spinor["Xi", ___]], Return[chain]];
      If[Length[parts] < 2 || !FreeQ[Drop[Rest[parts], -1], Spinor["Xi", ___]], fail[]];
      left = First[parts]; right = Last[parts]; middle = Drop[Rest[parts], -1];
      first = {left}; last = {right};
      Do[
        ref = If[side === 1, left, right];
        If[MatchQ[ref, Spinor["Xi", ___]],
          choices = Select[settings, #["Reference"] === ref &];
          If[Length[choices] =!= 1,
            selected = If[side === 1, right, left];
            If[!MatchQ[selected, _Spinor], fail[]];
            choices = Select[choices, #["Leg"] === spinorLeg[selected] &]];
          If[Length[choices] =!= 1, fail[]];
          setting = First[choices]; a = setting["Leg"]; b = setting["Target"];
          If[setting["Mode"] === "AllPhysical",
            If[side === 1, first = {Spinor["Helicity", opposite[ref[[2]]], a], Mom[b]},
              last = {Mom[b], Spinor["Helicity", opposite[ref[[2]]], a]}; sign = -sign];
            AppendTo[denominators,
              SpinorChain[Spinor["Helicity", opposite[ref[[2]]], a], Mom[b],
                Spinor["Helicity", ref[[2]], a]] ->
                  PropDen[Mom[Multiparticle @@ Sort[{a, b}]], Mass[b] /. externalRules]],
            selected = Switch[setting["Mode"],
              "AllSpurious", Spinor["Helicity", ref[[2]], b],
              "Xi", b,
              "IndependentXi", ReplacePart[ref, 3 -> a], _, fail[]];
            If[side === 1, first = {selected}, last = {selected}]]], {side, {1, 2}}];
      sign (SpinorChain @@ Join[first, middle, last])];
    transformed = withProtectedPropagators[expression,
      Function[body, body /. chain_SpinorChain :> rewrite[chain]]];
    denominators = DeleteDuplicates[Join[denominators,
      (Reverse[First[#]] -> Last[#]) & /@ denominators]];
    transformed = withProtectedPropagators[transformed, Function[body,
      body /. HoldPattern[Power[chain_SpinorChain, power_?NumericQ] /; TrueQ[power < 0]] :>
        Power[chain /. denominators, power]]];
    <|"Status" -> "COMPLETE", "Expression" -> transformed, "Assignments" -> settings,
      "Diagnostics" -> {}|>, tag]
];

(* An external pair invariant can cancel an apparent repeated propagator before
   simple-pole admission. Keep every other inverse opaque, retain the complete
   rational source and restore uncanceled numerator virtualities to scalar
   products. This is an ordinary off-shell identity, never a cut assumption. *)
completionOrdinaryPairPoleSource[expression_, externalRules_List, seconds_: 0.5] := Module[
  {external = preparationExternalRules[externalRules], props, rules, back, pair,
   masses, trial, result, originalOrder, order, restoreNumerator, checkpoint, outcome},
  checkpoint = <|"Expression" -> expression, "Status" -> "UNCHANGED", "Rules" -> {},
    "InverseDefinitionRules" -> {}, "InternalOnShellConditions" -> {},
    "ExactForwardIdentity" -> True|>;
  If[!TrueQ[seconds > 0] || LeafCount[expression] > 60000 || FreeQ[expression, _MomProd] ||
      !preparationScalarExternalRulesQ[external], Return[checkpoint]];
  props = DeleteDuplicates[Cases[expression,
    Power[prop : PropDen[Mom[Multiparticle[_Integer, _Integer]], _], n_Integer /; n < -1] :> prop,
    Infinity]];
  props = Select[props, Function[prop,
    pair = List @@ prop[[1, 1]]; masses = (Mass /@ pair) /. external;
    DuplicateFreeQ[pair] && FreeQ[masses, _Mass | _Real] && MemberQ[masses, 0] &&
      residueExactZero[Total[masses^2] - prop[[2]]^2]]];
  If[props === {}, Return[checkpoint]];
  rules = DeleteDuplicates[Flatten[Map[Function[prop, pair = List @@ prop[[1, 1]];
    {MomProd @@ pair -> prop/2, MomProd @@ Reverse[pair] -> prop/2}], props]]];
  back = Map[Function[prop, prop -> 2 (orderedDot @@ List @@ prop[[1, 1]])], props];
  order[value_] := Total[Cases[{value}, Power[prop_PropDen, n_Integer?Negative] /;
    MemberQ[props, prop] :> -n, Infinity]];
  restoreNumerator[term_] := Module[{num = Numerator[term], inverses, tokens},
    inverses = DeleteDuplicates[Cases[{num}, inverse : Power[_, exponent_] /;
      !TrueQ[exponent >= 0] :> inverse, Infinity]];
    tokens = Table[Unique["pairVirtualityInverse"], {Length[inverses]}];
    ((num /. Thread[inverses -> tokens]) /. back) /.
      Thread[tokens -> inverses]]/Denominator[term];
  originalOrder = order[expression];
  outcome = TimeConstrained[MemoryConstrained[
    trial = preparationCancelReferencePoles[expression, external, props];
    (* Positive powers left by exact division carry ordinary numerator
       momentum content. Do not make them artificially cheap PropDen atoms. *)
    result = Total[restoreNumerator /@ If[Head[trial] === Plus, List @@ trial, {trial}]];
    If[result =!= expression && residueFiniteQ[result] && order[result] < originalOrder,
      checkpoint = Join[checkpoint, <|"Expression" -> result, "Status" -> "REDUCED",
        "Rules" -> rules, "InverseDefinitionRules" -> back,
        "Method" -> "OrdinaryExternalPairVirtualityCancellation"|>]];
    True, 134217728, False], seconds, False];
  Join[checkpoint, <|"Completed" -> TrueQ[outcome]|>]
];

(* Each continuation is checked only on its own cut. This preserves the supplied
   residue without imposing that channel's shell condition on the full sum. *)
(* A sum cannot have a larger pole order than its largest summand. Products
   add these upper bounds. This sufficient structural certificate avoids a
   global rational combination when every tracked pole is already simple.
   It makes no statement about other denominator factors or hidden kinematics. *)
completionExplicitSimplePoleBoundQ[expression_, variables_List] := Module[
  {zero, tracked, position, bound, orders, tag = Unique["simplePoleBound"]},
  If[variables === {} || Length[variables] > 128 || !AllTrue[variables, AtomQ] ||
      !DuplicateFreeQ[variables], Return[False]];
  zero = ConstantArray[0, Length[variables]];
  tracked = Alternatives @@ variables;
  position = AssociationThread[variables, Range[Length[variables]]];
  bound[value_] := Which[
    FreeQ[value, tracked], zero,
    AtomQ[value], zero,
    Head[value] === Plus, Max @@@ Transpose[bound /@ List @@ value],
    Head[value] === Times, Total[bound /@ List @@ value],
    MatchQ[value, Power[_, _Integer?Positive]], value[[2]] bound[value[[1]]],
    MatchQ[value, Power[_, _Integer?Negative]] && KeyExistsQ[position, value[[1]]],
      ReplacePart[zero, position[value[[1]]] -> -value[[2]]],
    True, Throw[False, tag]
  ];
  Catch[orders = bound[expression]; Max[orders] <= 1, tag]
];

completionHigherPhysicalPoles[expression_, targets_List, external_List] := Module[
  {propagators, variables, body, rational, denominator, orders},
  propagators = DeleteDuplicates[Lookup[residueNormalizeChannel /@ targets, "Propagator"]];
  If[propagators === {}, Return[{}]];
  variables = Table[Unique["continuationPole"], {Length[propagators]}];
  body = residueCanonicalPropagators[expression, external] /. Thread[propagators -> variables];
  If[TrueQ[completionExplicitSimplePoleBoundQ[body, variables]], Return[{}]];
  rational = Cancel[Together[body]];
  denominator = Denominator[rational];
  If[!PolynomialQ[denominator, variables],
    Return[Failure["UnsupportedContinuationDenominator", <||>]]];
  orders = Exponent[denominator, #] & /@ variables;
  Pick[propagators, (# > 1 &) /@ orders]
];

completionContinuationCheck[source_, variant_, channel_Association,
    targets_List, rules_List, seed_Integer] := Module[
  {chart, result, equations, success, samples = {}, state, complete = True,
   tag = Unique["continuationCheck"]},
  Catch[
  Do[
    success = False;
    Do[
      chart = completionCutChart[channel, sample + 4 attempt, seed + 104729 attempt, rules];
      If[FailureQ[chart], Continue[]];
      result = PhysicalPoleResidue[variant - source, channel,
        "KinematicMap" -> chart["Map"], "KinematicKind" -> "Symbolic",
        "StructuralCoefficient" -> False,
        "UncutChannels" -> targets];
      If[!AssociationQ[result] || Lookup[result, "Status", None] =!= "PASS", Continue[]];
      equations = completionCoefficientEquations[result["PhysicalResidue"], chart["SpinVariables"]];
      If[FailureQ[equations], Continue[]];
      state = highEnergyZeroState /@ equations;
      If[MemberQ[state, "Nonzero"], Throw[<|"Status" -> "FAIL", "Samples" -> samples,
        "Scope" -> "ExactSampledSelectedCut", "Diagnostics" -> {
          "The reference continuation changes its selected channel residue."}|>, tag]];
      If[!AllTrue[state, # === "Zero" &], Continue[]];
      AppendTo[samples, <|"Sample" -> sample, "Chart" -> chart["Chart"],
        "ResidueDifference" -> 0|>]; success = True; Break[], {attempt, 0, 2}];
    If[!success, complete = False; Break[]], {sample, 2}];
  <|"Status" -> If[complete, "PASS", "UNRESOLVED"], "Samples" -> samples,
    "Scope" -> "ExactSampledSelectedCut", "Diagnostics" -> If[complete, {}, {
      "Regular exact cut samples did not establish preservation of this channel residue."}]|>, tag]
];

completionChannelContinuations[normalized_Association, model_List, rules_List,
    seed_Integer : 1729] := Module[
  {targets, poleTargets, externalRules = normalized["ExternalMassRules"], external, inventory,
   sources = {}, variants = {}, diagnostics = {}, recorded, source, propagators,
   ownKeys, ownRules, proposal, inferred, proposals, verification, accepted,
   higherPoles, ordinary, channelIndex = 0, rotationGroups, rotationCount,
   rotationLimit = 16, selection, rotated},
  targets = Select[completionTargets[normalized["Targets"]],
    TrueQ[Lookup[#, "Complete", False]] && KeyExistsQ[#, "StateSum"] &];
  poleTargets = Select[targets, !TrueQ[residueExactZero[#["StateSum"]]] &];
  external = Cases[externalRules, HoldPattern[Mass[i_Integer] -> _] :> i];
  inventory = ({Join[externalRules, {Mass[Multiparticle @@ #["Cut"]] -> #["Mass"]}], 0} &) /@ poleTargets;
  recorded = completionRecordedReferenceTables[normalized];
  Do[
    channelIndex++;
    source = residueCanonicalPropagators[channel["StateSum"]/channel["Propagator"], external];
    AppendTo[sources, source];
    If[FreeQ[source, Spinor["Xi", ___]], Continue[]];
    propagators = DeleteDuplicates[Cases[source, p_PropDen :> p, {0, Infinity}]];
    ownKeys = residuePropagatorKey[#, external] & /@ propagators;
    If[AnyTrue[ownKeys, MissingQ],
      AppendTo[diagnostics, <|"Cut" -> channel["Cut"], "Reason" -> "UnsupportedSourcePropagator"|>];
      Continue[]];
    ownRules = Join[externalRules,
      (Mass[Multiparticle @@ First[#]] -> Last[#] & /@ ownKeys)];
    proposals = {};
    inferred = preparationReferences[source, ownRules, model, inventory, "IndependentXi"];
    If[AssociationQ[inferred] && Lookup[inferred, "Status", None] === "COMPLETE",
      Do[
        proposal = completionAssignedReferences[source, inferred["Assignments"], table,
          externalRules, residueChannelKey /@ poleTargets, ownKeys];
        If[AssociationQ[proposal] && !FailureQ[proposal],
          AppendTo[proposals, Join[proposal, <|"Mode" -> "PreparedReferences"|>]],
          AppendTo[diagnostics, <|"Cut" -> channel["Cut"],
            "Reason" -> "UnavailablePreparedReferenceAssignment"|>]], {table, recorded}]];
    Do[
      proposal = preparationReferences[source, ownRules, model, inventory, mode];
      If[AssociationQ[proposal] && Lookup[proposal, "Status", None] === "COMPLETE",
        AppendTo[proposals, Join[proposal, <|"Mode" -> mode|>]];
        If[mode === "AllSpurious",
          rotationGroups = Lookup[proposal, "Choices", {}];
          If[rotationGroups =!= {},
            rotationCount = Max[Length /@ rotationGroups];
            (* Rotate all eligible lists together. This visits each single
               reference choice without their exponential Cartesian product. *)
            Do[
              selection = (#[[1 + Mod[rotation, Length[#]]]] &) /@ rotationGroups;
              rotated = preparationReferences[source, ownRules, model, inventory,
                "AllSpurious", selection];
              If[AssociationQ[rotated] && Lookup[rotated, "Status", None] === "COMPLETE",
                AppendTo[proposals, Join[rotated,
                  <|"Mode" -> "RotatedCyclic", "Rotation" -> rotation|>]]],
              {rotation, 1, Min[rotationCount, rotationLimit] - 2}];
            If[rotationCount > rotationLimit, AppendTo[diagnostics,
              <|"Cut" -> channel["Cut"], "Mode" -> "RotatedCyclic",
                "Reason" -> "ReferenceRotationLimit", "AvailableRotations" -> rotationCount,
                "RotationLimit" -> rotationLimit|>]]]],
        AppendTo[diagnostics, <|"Cut" -> channel["Cut"], "Mode" -> mode,
          "Reason" -> "UnavailableReferenceContinuation"|>]],
      {mode, DeleteDuplicates[Join[{"AllSpurious", "ReverseCyclic", "AllPhysical"},
        If[MemberQ[{"Xi", "IndependentXi", "Mixed"}, Lookup[normalized, "PolePreference", None]],
          {normalized["PolePreference"]}, {}]]]}];
    (* Keep the physical classification when a recorded assignment produces
       the same expression; compact basis selection depends on that mode. *)
    proposals = (First[SortBy[#, If[Lookup[#, "Mode", None] === "AllPhysical", 0, 1] &]] &) /@
      GatherBy[proposals, #["Expression"] &];
    Do[
      If[MemberQ[sources, proposal["Expression"]], Continue[]];
      ordinary = completionOrdinaryPairPoleSource[proposal["Expression"], externalRules];
      If[ordinary["Status"] === "REDUCED", proposal = Join[proposal,
        <|"Expression" -> ordinary["Expression"],
          "OrdinaryPoleNormalization" -> KeyDrop[ordinary, "Expression"]|>]];
      higherPoles = completionHigherPhysicalPoles[proposal["Expression"], targets, external];
      verification = Which[
        FailureQ[higherPoles], <|"Status" -> "UNRESOLVED", "Samples" -> {},
          "Reason" -> "UnsupportedContinuationDenominator", "Diagnostics" -> {
            "The continuation's physical denominator orders could not be established."}|>,
        higherPoles =!= {}, <|"Status" -> "UNRESOLVED", "Samples" -> {},
          "Reason" -> "UnsupportedHigherOrderPhysicalPoleContinuation",
          "HigherOrderPropagators" -> higherPoles, "Diagnostics" -> {
            "This continuation has uncanceled higher-order physical poles, outside the simple-pole correction solver's supported space."}|>,
        True, completionContinuationCheck[source, proposal["Expression"], channel,
          targets, rules, seed + 1987 channelIndex]];
      accepted = verification["Status"] === "PASS";
      AppendTo[variants, Join[<|"Cut" -> channel["Cut"], "Mass" -> channel["Mass"],
        "Mode" -> proposal["Mode"], "Assignments" -> proposal["Assignments"],
        "Expression" -> proposal["Expression"], "Accepted" -> accepted,
        "Verification" -> verification|>, KeyTake[proposal, {"Rotation", "OrdinaryPoleNormalization"}]]];
      If[accepted, AppendTo[sources, proposal["Expression"]]], {proposal, proposals}],
    {channel, targets}];
  <|"Sources" -> DeleteDuplicates[sources], "Variants" -> variants,
    "Diagnostics" -> DeleteDuplicates[diagnostics],
    "Scope" -> "BoundedReferenceContinuationsWithExactSampledSelectedCutChecks"|>
];

completionAutomaticBasis[normalized_Association, limit_Integer, references_ : None] := Module[
  {sources, terms = {}, expanded, external, exceeded = False},
  external = Cases[normalized["ExternalMassRules"], HoldPattern[Mass[i_Integer] -> _] :> i];
  sources = Join[{normalized["Expression"]},
    If[AssociationQ[references], Lookup[references, "Sources", {}],
      (#["StateSum"]/#["Propagator"] & /@ Select[normalized["Targets"],
        TrueQ[Lookup[#, "Complete", False]] && KeyExistsQ[#, "StateSum"] &])]];
  Do[
    expanded = residueCanonicalPropagators[expression, external];
    expanded = withProtectedPropagators[expanded, Expand];
    terms = Join[terms, If[Head[expanded] === Plus, List @@ expanded, {expanded}]];
    terms = completionNormalizeBasis[terms];
    If[Length[terms] > limit, exceeded = True; Break[]], {expression, sources}];
  If[exceeded, Failure["CorrectionSpaceLimit", <|
    "Terms" -> Length[terms], "Limit" -> limit|>], terms]
];

(* Whole channel reduction exposes directions hidden inside momentum chains.
   Keep diagram groups intact here; the literal termwise space remains a fallback. *)
completionReducedChannelBasis[normalized_Association, references_Association,
    limit_Integer, rules_List, seed_Integer] := Module[
  {variants, targets, external = normalized["ExternalMassRules"], sources = {},
   checks = {}, channel, reduced, verification, terms, groupedInputs, split,
   externalLegs, referenceFree, source, higherPoles, referenceFreeQ,
   selectedRules, selectedReduced, difference, groupedDirections = {}},
  (* An x factor or a surviving internal spinor is defined only on its own
     cut, even when no explicit Xi remains. It is not an off-cut direction. *)
  referenceFreeQ[expression_] := FreeQ[expression,
    _xFactor | _xTildeFactor | Spinor["Xi", ___] | SpinorHat["Xi", ___] |
      (Spinor | SpinorHat)[_, ("Angle" | "Square"), _Multiparticle, ___] |
      (Spinor | SpinorHat)[_, ("Upper" | "Lower"), ("Angle" | "Square"), _Multiparticle, ___]];
  variants = Select[Lookup[references, "Variants", {}],
    TrueQ[Lookup[#, "Accepted", False]] && Lookup[#, "Mode", None] === "AllPhysical" &&
      referenceFreeQ[#["Expression"]] &];
  targets = completionTargets[normalized["Targets"]];
  externalLegs = Cases[external, HoldPattern[Mass[i_Integer] -> _] :> i];
  (* A sewn channel may already contain no references, as with two known
     four-point amplitudes. It needs no reference variant to enter the space. *)
  referenceFree = Select[targets, TrueQ[Lookup[#, "Complete", False]] &&
    KeyExistsQ[#, "StateSum"] && !TrueQ[residueExactZero[#["StateSum"]]] &];
  Do[
    source = completionOrdinaryPairPoleSource[
      residueCanonicalPropagators[target["StateSum"]/target["Propagator"], externalLegs], external]["Expression"];
    If[referenceFreeQ[source],
      AppendTo[variants, <|"Cut" -> target["Cut"], "Mass" -> target["Mass"],
        "Mode" -> "ReferenceFree", "Expression" -> source|>]],
    {target, referenceFree}];
  If[variants === {}, Return[Missing["NoReducedPhysicalChannels"]]];
  Do[
    higherPoles = completionHigherPhysicalPoles[variant["Expression"], targets, externalLegs];
    If[FailureQ[higherPoles] || higherPoles =!= {},
      AppendTo[checks, <|"Cut" -> variant["Cut"], "Mass" -> variant["Mass"],
        "Mode" -> variant["Mode"], "Verification" -> <|"Status" -> "UNRESOLVED",
          "Reason" -> If[FailureQ[higherPoles], "UnsupportedContinuationDenominator",
            "UnsupportedHigherOrderPhysicalPoleContinuation"]|>|>]; Continue[]];
    reduced = TimeConstrained[completionExternalReduce[variant["Expression"], external],
      2, $TimedOut];
    If[!residueFiniteQ[reduced], Continue[]];
    channel = SelectFirst[targets,
      #["Cut"] === variant["Cut"] && residueExactZero[#["Mass"]^2 - variant["Mass"]^2] &,
      Missing["UnknownChannel"]];
    If[MissingQ[channel], Continue[]];
    verification = completionContinuationCheck[variant["Expression"], reduced,
      channel, targets, rules, seed];
    AppendTo[checks, <|"Cut" -> variant["Cut"], "Mass" -> variant["Mass"],
      "Mode" -> variant["Mode"], "Verification" -> verification|>];
    If[verification["Status"] =!= "PASS", Continue[]];
    sources = Join[sources, {reduced, variant["Expression"]}];
    (* A channel fixes only its selected cut. Keep the resulting off-cut
       change grouped, rather than expanding every new numerator term. *)
    selectedRules = Join[external,
      {Mass[Multiparticle @@ channel["Cut"]] -> channel["Mass"]}];
    selectedReduced = TimeConstrained[preparationReferenceTrial[
      preparationNumerators[variant["Expression"],
        Function[num, preparationReplaceMasses[ReduceSpinContractions[num], selectedRules]]],
      selectedRules, preparationDotRules[selectedRules, True]], 2, $TimedOut];
    If[!residueFiniteQ[selectedReduced], Continue[]];
    difference = selectedReduced - variant["Expression"];
    If[TrueQ[residueExactZero[difference]], Continue[]];
    higherPoles = completionHigherPhysicalPoles[selectedReduced, targets, externalLegs];
    If[FailureQ[higherPoles] || higherPoles =!= {}, Continue[]];
    verification = completionContinuationCheck[variant["Expression"], selectedReduced,
      channel, targets, rules, seed];
    AppendTo[checks, <|"Cut" -> variant["Cut"], "Mass" -> variant["Mass"],
      "Mode" -> "SelectedCutReduction", "SourceMode" -> variant["Mode"],
      "MassRules" -> selectedRules, "Verification" -> verification|>];
    If[verification["Status"] === "PASS", AppendTo[groupedDirections, difference]],
    {variant, variants}];
  If[sources === {}, Return[Missing["NoVerifiedReducedChannels"]]];
  split[expression_] := With[{expanded = withProtectedPropagators[expression, Expand]},
    If[Head[expanded] === Plus, List @@ expanded, {expanded}]];
  terms = completionNormalizeBasis[Flatten[split /@ sources, 1]];
  groupedInputs = Map[Function[record,
    Total[Select[If[Head[record["Expression"]] === Plus,
      List @@ record["Expression"], {record["Expression"]}], !FreeQ[Denominator[#], _PropDen] &]]],
    normalized["Records"]];
  groupedDirections = completionNormalizeBasis[groupedDirections];
  terms = completionNormalizeBasis[Join[terms, groupedInputs, groupedDirections]];
  If[Length[terms] > limit, Return[Missing["ReducedChannelSpaceLimit"]]];
  <|"Basis" -> terms, "Sources" -> DeleteDuplicates[sources],
    "GroupedDirections" -> groupedDirections,
    "Verification" -> checks,
    "Scope" -> "ReducedPhysicalAndReferenceFreeChannelsWithGroupedPoleBearingInputs"|>
];

(* A selected cut fixes the sum of its pair invariants, not any one pair.
   Each pivot defines a different numerator continuation away from that cut. *)
completionCutInvariantTrials[expression_, cut_List, cutMass_, externalRules_List] := Module[
  {rules, masses, pairs, products, constant, candidate, trials = {}, rule},
  If[Length[cut] < 2 || !VectorQ[cut, IntegerQ[#] && # > 0 &] || !DuplicateFreeQ[cut],
    Return[Missing["UnsupportedSelectedCut"]]];
  If[Length[cut] === 2, Return[{}]];
  rules = Cases[externalRules, rule : HoldPattern[Mass[_Integer] -> _] :> rule];
  masses = (Mass /@ cut) /. rules;
  If[!FreeQ[masses, _Mass], Return[Missing["MissingExternalMass"]]];
  pairs = Subsets[Sort[cut], {2}]; products = orderedDot @@@ pairs;
  constant = (cutMass^2 - Total[masses^2])/2;
  Do[
    rule = products[[index]] -> constant - Total[Delete[products, index]];
    candidate = preparationReduceDots[expression, {rule}];
    If[candidate =!= expression,
      AppendTo[trials, <|"Cut" -> cut, "Mass" -> cutMass, "PivotPair" -> pairs[[index]],
        "NumeratorRule" -> rule, "Expression" -> candidate|>]],
    {index, Length[pairs]}];
  trials
];

(* A broader optional space splits selected-cut-prepared channel numerators.
   Its certification preserves only that source's own residue, not its off-cut form. *)
DownValues[completionSelectedChannelBasis] = {};
completionSelectedChannelBasis[normalized_Association, references_Association,
    limit_Integer, rules_List, seed_Integer, seconds_ : 60, includeInvariantTrials_:True] := Module[
  {targets = completionTargets[normalized["Targets"]], external = normalized["ExternalMassRules"],
   externalLegs, variants, closedQ, source, channel, selectedRules, reduced,
   higherPoles, verification, checks = {}, sources = {}, terms = {}, split,
   originalSources = {}, originalFinished = False, originalIncomplete = False, invariantFinished = True,
   started = AbsoluteTime[], sourceSeconds,
   proposals, proposalTerms, diagnostics = {}, finished, tag = Unique["selectedChannelSpace"]},
  closedQ[expression_] := FreeQ[expression, _xFactor | _xTildeFactor |
    (Spinor | SpinorHat)[_, ("Angle" | "Square"), _Multiparticle, ___] |
    (Spinor | SpinorHat)[_, ("Upper" | "Lower"), ("Angle" | "Square"), _Multiparticle, ___]];
  externalLegs = Cases[external, HoldPattern[Mass[i_Integer] -> _] :> i];
  variants = Select[Lookup[references, "Variants", {}],
    TrueQ[Lookup[#, "Accepted", False]] && closedQ[#["Expression"]] &];
  Do[
    If[!TrueQ[Lookup[target, "Complete", False]] || !KeyExistsQ[target, "StateSum"] ||
        TrueQ[residueExactZero[target["StateSum"]]], Continue[]];
    source = residueCanonicalPropagators[target["StateSum"]/target["Propagator"], externalLegs];
    If[closedQ[source] && FreeQ[source, Spinor["Xi", ___] | SpinorHat["Xi", ___]],
      AppendTo[variants, <|"Cut" -> target["Cut"], "Mass" -> target["Mass"],
        "Mode" -> "ReferenceFree", "Expression" -> source|>]], {target, targets}];
  variants = SortBy[DeleteDuplicatesBy[variants,
    {#["Cut"], #["Mass"], #["Expression"]} &], LeafCount[#["Expression"]] &];
  If[variants === {}, Return[Missing["NoSelectedChannelSources"]]];
  split[expression_] := With[{expanded = withProtectedPropagators[expression, Expand]},
    If[Head[expanded] === Plus, List @@ expanded, {expanded}]];
  Catch[
    finished = TimeConstrained[Do[
      channel = SelectFirst[targets, #["Cut"] === variant["Cut"] &&
        residueExactZero[#["Mass"]^2 - variant["Mass"]^2] &, Missing["UnknownChannel"]];
      If[MissingQ[channel], Continue[]];
      higherPoles = completionHigherPhysicalPoles[variant["Expression"], targets, externalLegs];
      If[FailureQ[higherPoles] || higherPoles =!= {}, Continue[]];
      selectedRules = Join[external,
        {Mass[Multiparticle @@ channel["Cut"]] -> channel["Mass"]}];
      sourceSeconds = Min[Max[2, Ceiling[LeafCount[variant["Expression"]]/200]],
        If[seconds === Infinity, Infinity, Max[0.000001, seconds - (AbsoluteTime[] - started)]]];
      reduced = TimeConstrained[preparationReferenceTrial[
        preparationNumerators[variant["Expression"],
          Function[num, preparationReplaceMasses[ReduceSpinContractions[num], selectedRules]]],
        selectedRules, preparationDotRules[selectedRules, True]], sourceSeconds, $TimedOut];
      If[!residueFiniteQ[reduced],
        originalIncomplete = True;
        AppendTo[diagnostics, <|"Cut" -> channel["Cut"], "SourceMode" -> variant["Mode"],
          "Reason" -> If[reduced === $TimedOut, "SelectedCutReductionTimeout", "SelectedCutReductionUnavailable"],
          "TimeAllowance" -> sourceSeconds|>]; Continue[]];
      higherPoles = completionHigherPhysicalPoles[reduced, targets, externalLegs];
      If[FailureQ[higherPoles] || higherPoles =!= {}, Continue[]];
      verification = completionContinuationCheck[variant["Expression"], reduced,
        channel, targets, rules, seed];
      AppendTo[checks, <|"Cut" -> channel["Cut"], "Mass" -> channel["Mass"],
        "Mode" -> "SelectedCutAtomicReduction", "SourceMode" -> variant["Mode"],
        "MassRules" -> selectedRules, "Verification" -> verification|>];
      If[verification["Status"] =!= "PASS", Continue[]];
      proposalTerms = completionNormalizeBasis[Join[terms, split[reduced]]];
      If[Length[proposalTerms] > limit, Throw[Failure["CorrectionSpaceLimit",
        <|"Terms" -> Length[proposalTerms], "Limit" -> limit|>], tag]];
      terms = proposalTerms; AppendTo[sources, reduced];
      AppendTo[originalSources, <|"Expression" -> reduced, "Channel" -> channel,
        "SourceMode" -> variant["Mode"]|>], {variant, variants}];
    originalFinished = True;
    (* Keep the original certified sources before spending the remaining
       construction budget on optional general-cut continuations. *)
    If[TrueQ[includeInvariantTrials], Do[
      channel = originalSource["Channel"];
      proposals = TimeConstrained[completionCutInvariantTrials[
        originalSource["Expression"], channel["Cut"], channel["Mass"], external],
        2, $TimedOut];
      If[proposals === $TimedOut,
        invariantFinished = False;
        AppendTo[diagnostics, <|"Cut" -> channel["Cut"],
          "Reason" -> "CutInvariantEnumerationTimeout"|>]; Continue[]];
      If[!ListQ[proposals],
        invariantFinished = False;
        AppendTo[diagnostics, <|"Cut" -> channel["Cut"],
          "Reason" -> "CutInvariantEnumerationUnavailable", "Result" -> proposals|>]; Continue[]];
      Do[
        reduced = TimeConstrained[preparationSpinorProducts[proposal["Expression"], external],
          2, $TimedOut];
        If[!residueFiniteQ[reduced],
          invariantFinished = False;
          AppendTo[diagnostics, <|"Cut" -> channel["Cut"],
            "PivotPair" -> proposal["PivotPair"], "Reason" -> "CutInvariantReductionUnavailable"|>];
          Continue[]];
        higherPoles = completionHigherPhysicalPoles[reduced, targets, externalLegs];
        If[!ListQ[higherPoles],
          invariantFinished = False;
          AppendTo[diagnostics, <|"Cut" -> channel["Cut"], "PivotPair" -> proposal["PivotPair"],
            "Reason" -> "CutInvariantPoleClassificationUnavailable"|>]; Continue[]];
        If[higherPoles =!= {},
          AppendTo[diagnostics, <|"Cut" -> channel["Cut"], "PivotPair" -> proposal["PivotPair"],
            "Status" -> "REJECTED", "Reason" -> "CutInvariantHigherOrderPhysicalPoles",
            "HigherOrderPropagators" -> higherPoles|>]; Continue[]];
        verification = completionContinuationCheck[originalSource["Expression"], reduced,
          channel, targets, rules, seed];
        If[!AssociationQ[verification], verification = <|"Status" -> "UNRESOLVED",
          "Reason" -> "CutInvariantVerificationUnavailable"|>];
        AppendTo[checks, <|"Cut" -> channel["Cut"], "Mass" -> channel["Mass"],
          "Mode" -> "SelectedCutInvariantReduction", "SourceMode" -> originalSource["SourceMode"],
          "PivotPair" -> proposal["PivotPair"], "NumeratorRule" -> proposal["NumeratorRule"],
          "Verification" -> verification|>];
        If[!MemberQ[{"PASS", "FAIL"}, Lookup[verification, "Status", None]],
          invariantFinished = False;
          AppendTo[diagnostics, <|"Cut" -> channel["Cut"], "PivotPair" -> proposal["PivotPair"],
            "Reason" -> "CutInvariantVerificationUnresolved"|>]; Continue[]];
        If[verification["Status"] =!= "PASS", Continue[]];
        proposalTerms = completionNormalizeBasis[Join[terms, split[reduced]]];
        If[Length[proposalTerms] > limit,
          invariantFinished = False;
          AppendTo[diagnostics, <|"Cut" -> channel["Cut"], "PivotPair" -> proposal["PivotPair"],
            "Reason" -> "CutInvariantCorrectionSpaceLimit", "Terms" -> Length[proposalTerms],
            "Limit" -> limit|>]; Continue[]];
        terms = proposalTerms; AppendTo[sources, reduced], {proposal, proposals}],
      {originalSource, originalSources}]]; True,
      seconds, False];
    If[sources === {}, Return[Missing["NoVerifiedSelectedChannels"]]];
    <|"Basis" -> terms, "Sources" -> DeleteDuplicates[sources], "Verification" -> checks,
      "ConstructionStatus" -> If[TrueQ[finished && invariantFinished] && !originalIncomplete, "COMPLETE", "PARTIAL"],
      "OriginalSourcesComplete" -> TrueQ[originalFinished && !originalIncomplete],
      "InvariantContinuationsRequested" -> TrueQ[includeInvariantTrials],
      "InvariantContinuationsComplete" -> If[TrueQ[includeInvariantTrials],
        TrueQ[finished && invariantFinished], Missing["NotRequested"]],
      "ElapsedTime" -> AbsoluteTime[] - started,
      "Diagnostics" -> Join[diagnostics, If[TrueQ[finished], {}, {
        "The selected-channel construction clock expired; only already certified directions are retained."}]],
      "Scope" -> "SelectedCutPreparedChannelTermsWithUnchangedTargets"|>, tag]
];

(* Source-derived companions remove a declared null emission from a lower
   channel amplitude. This is a bounded correction space, not an identity or
   a new selected-cut continuation; every fitted result still needs all cuts. *)
completionPeeledChannelBasis[normalized_Association, continuations_Association,
    plan_Association, limit_Integer, rules_List, seed_Integer, seconds_ : 15,
    exposeDegrees_ : False] := Module[
  {external = normalized["ExternalMassRules"], legs, targets, knownKeys, variants,
   constructionLimit, proposals, regular = 0, core = 0, directions = {}, basis = {},
   checks = {}, mappings = {}, diagnostics = {}, finished, exceeded = False,
   inputCollected = False,
   source, channel, selected, anchor, emitted, selectedRules, dots, transformed,
   verification, groups, component, companion, projected,
   sourceMap, key, candidateKey, mass, eligible, sourceCount = 0,
   project, degree, degreeGroups, compareSources, index, peelPropagator, peel,
   simplePhysicalQ, available, tag = Unique["peeledChannelSpace"], started = AbsoluteTime[]},
  legs = Sort[DeleteDuplicates[Cases[external, HoldPattern[Mass[i_Integer] -> _] :> i]]];
  targets = completionTargets[normalized["Targets"]];
  knownKeys = residueChannelKey /@ targets;
  constructionLimit = Max[limit, Min[4096, limit Max[1, Lookup[plan, "Order", 1]]]];
  available = Select[Lookup[continuations, "Variants", {}],
    Lookup[#, "Mode", None] === "AllPhysical" && TrueQ[Lookup[#, "Accepted", False]] &&
      FreeQ[Lookup[#, "Expression", 0], _xFactor | _xTildeFactor |
        (Spinor | SpinorHat)["Xi", ___] |
        (Spinor | SpinorHat)[_, ("Angle" | "Square"), _Multiparticle, ___] |
        (Spinor | SpinorHat)[_, ("Upper" | "Lower"), ("Angle" | "Square"),
          _Multiparticle, ___]] &];
  eligible[variant_] := Module[{target, masses, massive, null},
    target = SelectFirst[targets, #["Cut"] === variant["Cut"] &&
      residueExactZero[#["Mass"] - variant["Mass"]] &, Missing["UnknownChannel"]];
    If[MissingQ[target] || Length[target["Cut"]] =!= 2, Return[False]];
    masses = Mass /@ target["Cut"] /. external;
    null = Pick[target["Cut"], residueExactZero /@ masses];
    massive = Complement[target["Cut"], null];
    Length[null] === 1 && Length[massive] === 1 &&
      residueExactZero[target["Mass"] - (Mass[First[massive]] /. external)]
  ];
  variants = Select[available, eligible];
  If[variants === {}, Return[Missing["NoEligibleSources"]]];
  project[value_] := completionCanonicalReduce[canonicalChains[
    If[Lookup[plan, "Order", 1] === 1, value, completionBoseProject[value, plan]]], external];
  degree[chain_SpinorChain] := Count[List @@ chain, _Mom];
  degree[trace_SpinorTrace] := Count[List @@ trace, _Mom];
  degree[product_Times] := Total[degree /@ List @@ product];
  degree[Power[value_, power_Integer?Positive]] := power degree[value];
  degree[_] := 0;
  degreeGroups[value_] := Module[{expanded, terms},
    If[rspSandwichExpansionCount[value] > constructionLimit, Return[$Failed]];
    expanded = preparationProtectedDenominators[value, Expand];
    terms = If[Head[expanded] === Plus, List @@ expanded, {expanded}];
    If[Length[terms] > constructionLimit, Return[$Failed]];
    GroupBy[terms, degree, Total]];
  (* Degree groups are fitted separately. A small displayed source can
     conceal useful lower-degree groups inside its momentum chains. *)
  compareSources[alternative_, current_] := Module[{newGroups, oldGroups},
    If[TrueQ[exposeDegrees],
      newGroups = degreeGroups[alternative]; oldGroups = degreeGroups[current];
      If[newGroups === $Failed, Return[False]];
      If[oldGroups === $Failed, Return[True]];
      If[Length[newGroups] =!= Length[oldGroups],
        Return[Length[newGroups] > Length[oldGroups]]]];
    preparationBetterQ[preparationRank[alternative], preparationRank[current]]];
  index[value_Multiparticle] := Module[{members = List @@ value},
    If[VectorQ[members, IntegerQ] && DuplicateFreeQ[members] &&
        SubsetQ[members, selected],
      members = DeleteCases[members, emitted];
      If[Length[members] === 1, First[members], Multiparticle @@ members], value]
  ];
  index[value_] := value;
  peelPropagator[prop : PropDen[Mom[compound_Multiparticle], exchanged_]] := Module[
    {members = Sort[List @@ compound], complement, sides, lowerSize, chosen},
    complement = Complement[legs, members];
    If[MemberQ[{members, complement}, selected], prop,
      lowerSize[side_] := Length[side] - If[SubsetQ[side, selected], Length[selected] - 1, 0];
      sides = SortBy[{members, complement}, {lowerSize, Length}]; chosen = First[sides];
      If[SubsetQ[chosen, selected],
        PropDen[Mom[Multiparticle @@ DeleteCases[chosen, emitted]], exchanged], prop]]
  ];
  peelPropagator[prop_] := prop;
  peel[value_] := Module[{props, replaced},
    props = DeleteDuplicates[Cases[value, _PropDen, Infinity]];
    sourceMap = Select[(# -> peelPropagator[#] & /@ props), First[#] =!= Last[#] &];
    replaced = value /. sourceMap;
    (* Propagators have their own representation-aware map. Momentum arguments
       and scalar-invariant labels are typed; external spinors are untouched. *)
    withProtectedPropagators[replaced, (# /. {
      Mom[label_Multiparticle] :> Mom[index[label]],
      MomProd[a_, b_] :> MomProd[index[a], index[b]],
      Mandelstahm[labels__Integer] :> With[{members = index[Multiparticle[labels]]},
        If[Head[members] === Multiparticle, Mandelstahm @@ List @@ members,
          Mass[members]^2]]}) &]
  ];
  simplePhysicalQ[value_] := Module[{props, keys, higher},
    (* Denominator[1/p + 1/q] is 1. Inspect inverse propagator factors
       inside the whole group instead of rejecting a sum of pole terms. *)
    If[FreeQ[value, Power[_PropDen, _Integer?Negative]], Return[False]];
    props = DeleteDuplicates[Cases[value, _PropDen, Infinity]];
    keys = residuePropagatorKey[#, legs] & /@ props;
    If[AnyTrue[keys, MissingQ] || !AllTrue[keys, MemberQ[knownKeys, #] &], Return[False]];
    higher = completionHigherPhysicalPoles[value, targets, legs];
    ListQ[higher] && higher === {}
  ];
  finished = TimeConstrained[Catch[
    proposals = completionInputProposals[normalized, constructionLimit];
    If[Lookup[proposals, "Status", None] =!= "AVAILABLE",
      diagnostics = Join[diagnostics, Lookup[proposals, "Diagnostics", {}]];
      exceeded = True; Throw[False, tag]];
    regular = proposals["RegularExpression"];
    inputCollected = True;
    component = SelectFirst[proposals["Proposals"], #["Mode"] === "InputOverlap" &,
      SelectFirst[proposals["Proposals"], #["Mode"] === "InputRescaling" &,
        <|"Direction" -> 0|>]];
    core = project[component["Direction"]];
    If[core =!= 0 && simplePhysicalQ[core], directions = {core}];
    Do[
      channel = SelectFirst[targets, #["Cut"] === variant["Cut"] &&
        residueExactZero[#["Mass"] - variant["Mass"]] &];
      selected = channel["Cut"];
      emitted = SelectFirst[selected, residueExactZero[Mass[#] /. external] &];
      anchor = First[Complement[selected, {emitted}]];
      selectedRules = Join[external, {Mass[Multiparticle @@ selected] -> channel["Mass"]}];
      dots = preparationDotRules[selectedRules, True]; source = variant["Expression"];
      transformed = preparationConservedMomentumChains[source, selectedRules, True, dots];
      transformed = preparationMasslessMomentumTrial[transformed, selectedRules, dots, {},
        compareSources];
      verification = completionContinuationCheck[source, transformed, channel, targets,
        rules, seed + sourceCount];
      AppendTo[checks, <|"Cut" -> selected, "Mass" -> channel["Mass"],
        "MassRules" -> selectedRules, "Verification" -> verification,
        "Scope" -> "SelectedCutSourceNormalizationOnly"|>];
      sourceCount++;
      If[verification["Status"] =!= "PASS", Continue[]];
      groups = degreeGroups[transformed];
      If[groups === $Failed, exceeded = True; Throw[False, tag]];
      Do[
        companion = peel[groups[key]]; projected = project[companion];
        candidateKey = <|"Cut" -> selected, "Anchor" -> anchor, "EmittedLeg" -> emitted,
          "MomentumDegree" -> key, "PropagatorMap" -> sourceMap,
          "SourceExpression" -> groups[key], "CompanionExpression" -> companion,
          "ProjectedExpression" -> projected, "PeelingIsIdentity" -> False|>;
        If[residueFiniteQ[projected] && simplePhysicalQ[projected],
          AppendTo[directions, projected]; AppendTo[mappings, candidateKey]];
        If[Length[directions] > constructionLimit, exceeded = True; Throw[False, tag]],
        {key, Keys[groups]}], {variant, variants}];
    basis = completionIndependentBasis[completionNormalizeBasis[directions],
      If[seconds === Infinity, 15, Max[0.000001, seconds - (AbsoluteTime[] - started)]]];
    True, tag], seconds, False];
  If[!TrueQ[finished], AppendTo[diagnostics, If[exceeded,
    "Peeled channel construction exceeded its bounded source-space size.",
    "Peeled channel construction exceeded its time budget; only completed sources remain."]]];
  If[basis === {} && directions =!= {}, basis = completionNormalizeBasis[directions]];
  If[!inputCollected || Length[basis] > limit || exceeded,
    exceeded = True;
    basis = Missing["PeeledChannelSpaceLimit"];
    AppendTo[diagnostics, "The complete peeled correction space does not fit MaxCorrectionTerms."]];
  <|"Basis" -> basis, "Core" -> core, "RegularExpression" -> regular,
    "SourceChecks" -> checks, "Mappings" -> mappings,
    "ConstructionStatus" -> If[TrueQ[finished] && !exceeded, "COMPLETE", "PARTIAL"],
    "RawDirectionCount" -> Length[directions], "ElapsedTime" -> AbsoluteTime[] - started,
    "Scope" -> "BoundedSourceDerivedCompanionsRequiringIndependentAllChannelValidation",
    "Diagnostics" -> DeleteDuplicates[diagnostics]|>
];

(* Alternative representations contribute directions, never new residue targets. *)
completionAlternativeChannelBasis[input_, normalized_Association, rows_List,
    model_List, rules_List, seed_Integer, limit_Integer, references_] := Module[
  {alternate, external, keys, targets, supplied, matched, checks = {}, verification,
   effective, continuations, reduced, basis, tag = Unique["alternativeChannels"]},
  Catch[
  alternate = completionNormalizeInput[input, rows, model];
  If[!AssociationQ[alternate] || FailureQ[alternate] ||
      alternate["ExternalMassRules"] =!= normalized["ExternalMassRules"],
    Throw[<|"Status" -> "UNRESOLVED", "Diagnostics" -> {
      "Alternative channels must describe the same external masses as the supplied channels."}|>, tag]];
  external = Cases[normalized["ExternalMassRules"], HoldPattern[Mass[i_Integer] -> _] :> i];
  keys = DeleteDuplicates[({canonicalPhysicalCut[List @@ #[[-3]], external], #[[-2]]} &) /@ rows];
  targets = completionTargets[normalized["Targets"]];
  supplied = Select[completionTargets[alternate["Targets"]],
    MemberQ[keys, residueChannelKey[#]] &];
  Do[
    matched = SelectFirst[targets, residueChannelKey[#] === residueChannelKey[channel] &,
      Missing["UnknownAlternativeChannel"]];
    If[MissingQ[matched] || !TrueQ[Lookup[matched, "Complete", False]] ||
        !TrueQ[Lookup[channel, "Complete", False]],
      Throw[<|"Status" -> "UNRESOLVED", "Verification" -> checks, "Diagnostics" -> {
        "An alternative channel has no complete matching supplied residue target."}|>, tag]];
    verification = completionContinuationCheck[matched["StateSum"]/matched["Propagator"],
      channel["StateSum"]/channel["Propagator"], matched, targets, rules, seed];
    AppendTo[checks, <|"Cut" -> channel["Cut"], "Mass" -> channel["Mass"],
      "Verification" -> verification|>];
    If[verification["Status"] =!= "PASS",
      Throw[<|"Status" -> "UNRESOLVED", "Verification" -> checks, "Diagnostics" -> {
        "Alternative channels did not preserve the supplied selected residues at the exact samples."}|>, tag]],
    {channel, supplied}];
  effective = Join[normalized, <|"Targets" -> Map[Function[channel,
    SelectFirst[supplied, residueChannelKey[#] === residueChannelKey[channel] &, channel]], targets]|>];
  continuations = If[references === Automatic,
    completionChannelContinuations[effective, model, rules, seed],
    <|"Sources" -> (#["StateSum"]/#["Propagator"] & /@ supplied), "Variants" -> {}|>];
  reduced = If[references === Automatic,
    completionReducedChannelBasis[effective, continuations, limit, rules, seed],
    Missing["NotRequested"]];
  basis = If[AssociationQ[reduced], reduced["Basis"],
    completionAutomaticBasis[effective, limit, continuations]];
  If[!ListQ[basis], Throw[<|"Status" -> "UNRESOLVED", "Verification" -> checks,
    "Diagnostics" -> {"Alternative channel directions exceed MaxCorrectionTerms."}|>, tag]];
  <|"Status" -> "COMPLETE", "Basis" -> basis, "Verification" -> checks,
    "ChannelContinuations" -> continuations, "ReducedChannelSpace" -> reduced,
    "Scope" -> "ExactSampledSelectedCutEquivalenceWithUnchangedResidueTargets",
    "Diagnostics" -> {}|>, tag]
];

(* These are candidate continuations, not identities for adding diagrams.
   Keep complete signed coefficients and preserve explicit regular input. *)
completionInputProposals[normalized_Association, limit_Integer : 4096] := Module[
  {external = normalized["ExternalMassRules"], records = normalized["Records"],
   expanded, terms, indexed, groups, repeated, regular, regularByRecord,
   poleBearingByRecord, direction, union, proposals},
  expanded = Map[Function[record, withProtectedPropagators[
    completionCanonicalReduce[record["Expression"], external], Expand]], records];
  terms = If[Head[#] === Plus, List @@ #, If[# === 0, {}, {#}]] & /@ expanded;
  If[Total[Length /@ terms] > limit, Return[<|"Status" -> "UNRESOLVED",
    "Reason" -> "InputTermCollectionLimit", "Terms" -> Total[Length /@ terms], "Limit" -> limit,
    "Proposals" -> {}, "Diagnostics" -> {"Input term collection exceeded its bounded size."}|>]];
  regularByRecord = Total[Select[#, FreeQ[Denominator[#], _PropDen] &]] & /@ terms;
  poleBearingByRecord = Total[Select[#, !FreeQ[Denominator[#], _PropDen] &]] & /@ terms;
  regular = Total[regularByRecord];
  indexed = Flatten[MapIndexed[Function[{row, index},
    {First[index], #} & /@ Select[row, !FreeQ[Denominator[#], _PropDen] &]], terms], 1];
  direction = normalized["Expression"] - regular;
  proposals = If[TrueQ[residueExactZero[direction]], {},
    {<|"Mode" -> "InputRescaling", "Direction" -> direction,
      "RepeatedTermGroups" -> 0, "RemovedCopies" -> 0|>}];
  groups = GatherBy[indexed, Last];
  repeated = Select[groups, Length[DeleteDuplicates[First /@ #]] > 1 &];
  If[Length[records] > 1 && repeated =!= {},
    union = Total[Last[First[#]] & /@ groups];
    If[!TrueQ[residueExactZero[union - direction]] && !TrueQ[residueExactZero[union]],
      AppendTo[proposals, <|"Mode" -> "InputOverlap", "Direction" -> union,
        "RepeatedTermGroups" -> Length[repeated],
        "RemovedCopies" -> Total[(Length[#] - 1 &) /@ repeated]|>]]];
  <|"Status" -> "AVAILABLE", "RegularExpression" -> regular,
    "RegularByRecord" -> regularByRecord, "PoleBearingByRecord" -> poleBearingByRecord,
    "Proposals" -> proposals, "Diagnostics" -> {}|>
];

(* Solve one coefficient against all channels, then validate fresh coherent
   spin charts and every parameter set. No quotient of residues is needed. *)
completionFitInputProposal[proposal_Association, regular_, normalized_Association,
    samples_Integer, validationSamples_Integer, seed_Integer, rules_List,
    validationSets_List, seconds_, callback_, enabled_] := Module[
  {coefficient = Unique["inputNormalization"], direction = proposal["Direction"],
   trial, constraints = <||>, solution = <||>, validations = {}, validation = Missing["NotChecked"],
   factor = Missing["NotDetermined"], amplitude, checked, finished, status = "UNRESOLVED",
   reason = "No unique validated input coefficient was established.", start = AbsoluteTime[], tag = Unique[]},
  trial = regular + coefficient direction;
  amplitude = normalized["Expression"];
  finished = TimeConstrained[Catch[
    constraints = completionResidueConstraints[trial, {coefficient}, normalized,
      samples, seed, rules, seconds, callback, enabled];
    If[constraints["Status"] =!= "COMPLETE",
      reason = "Input fitting could not obtain every required residue constraint."; Throw[True, tag]];
    solution = completionSolveLinear[constraints["Equations"], {coefficient},
      If[seconds === Infinity, 30, Max[0.000001, seconds - (AbsoluteTime[] - start)]]];
    If[solution["Status"] =!= "COMPLETE" || solution["FreeParameters"] =!= {},
      reason = "No single uniquely determined constant matches all input residues."; Throw[True, tag]];
    factor = coefficient /. solution["SolutionRules"];
    If[!NumericQ[factor] || !residueFiniteQ[factor],
      reason = "Input normalization was not a finite numerical constant."; Throw[True, tag]];
    Do[
      checked = completionSparseValidation[trial, {coefficient}, solution, {}, {},
        normalized, validationSamples, seed + 1000003, validationSet, seconds, callback, enabled];
      validation = checked["Report"];
      AppendTo[validations, <|"ParameterRules" -> validationSet, "RandomSeed" -> seed + 1000003,
        "Round" -> 0, "Report" -> validation|>];
      If[!completionPhysicalPassQ[validation, normalized["Targets"]] || !TrueQ[checked["FamilyPass"]],
        reason = "The input coefficient failed independent residue validation."; Throw[True, tag]],
      {validationSet, validationSets}];
    If[validationSets === {} || normalized["Targets"] === {},
      reason = "Input reweighting requires nonvacuous physical-channel validation."; Throw[True, tag]];
    amplitude = regular + factor direction;
    status = "COMPLETE"; reason = "A unique constant passed independent physical-channel validation.";
    True, tag], seconds, False];
  If[!TrueQ[finished], reason = "Input reweighting exceeded its bounded time budget."];
  Join[proposal, <|"Status" -> status, "Reason" -> reason, "NormalizationFactor" -> factor,
    "Coefficient" -> coefficient, "Amplitude" -> amplitude, "Trial" -> trial,
    "Constraints" -> constraints, "Solution" -> solution, "ValidationReport" -> validation,
    "ValidationReports" -> validations, "RegularExpression" -> regular,
    "ElapsedTime" -> AbsoluteTime[] - start|>]
];

(* Bounded two-null-leg deformations supply alternative channel continuations.
   Every accepted direction preserves its selected cut. No shifted sum or
   vanishing large-parameter boundary is assumed: all original channels are
   still fitted and validated simultaneously. *)
completionNullPairShift[expression_, variable_Symbol, pair : {_Integer, _Integer}, external_List] := Module[
  {shiftSquare = First[pair], shiftAngle = Last[pair], rankOne = Unique["nullPairMomentum"],
   tag = Unique["nullPairShiftFailure"], fail, kind, opposite, helicity, members,
   eta, twiceQDot, scalarParameterQ, linearTerms, linearEta, linearTwiceQDot, endpointChoices,
   momentumChoices, splitRankOne, shiftChain, shift},
  If[!DuplicateFreeQ[pair] || !DuplicateFreeQ[external] || !SubsetQ[external,pair],
    Return[Failure["InvalidNullPair", <||>]]];
  fail[reason_, data_: <||>] := Throw[Failure[reason, data], tag];
  scalarParameterQ[value_] := FreeQ[value, variable | rankOne] &&
    !residueUnmappedQ[value /. _Mass -> 1];
  kind[spinor_] := rspSpinorType[spinor];
  opposite[type_] := If[type === "Angle", "Square", "Angle"];
  helicity[type_, leg_] := Spinor["Helicity", type, leg];
  members[label_Integer] /; MemberQ[external, label] := {label};
  members[label_Multiparticle] := Flatten[members /@ List @@ label];
  members[label_] := fail["UnsupportedMomentumLabel", <|"Label" -> label|>];
  eta[label_] := Count[members[label], shiftSquare] - Count[members[label], shiftAngle];
  twiceQDot[label_] := Total[Function[leg,
      If[MemberQ[{shiftSquare, shiftAngle}, leg], 0,
        SpinorChain[helicity["Angle", shiftSquare], Mom[leg],
          helicity["Square", shiftAngle]]]] /@ members[label]];
  linearTerms[momentum_] := Module[{factors, vectors, coefficient, label},
    Which[
      momentum === 0, {},
      Head[momentum] === Mom && Length[momentum] === 1,
        label = First[momentum];
        If[IntegerQ[label] && MemberQ[external, label], {{1, momentum}},
          If[MatchQ[label, Multiparticle[__Integer]] &&
              AllTrue[List @@ label, MemberQ[external, #] &],
            ({1, Mom[#]} & /@ List @@ label),
            fail["UnsupportedMomentumLabel", <|"Label" -> label|>]]],
      Head[momentum] === Plus, Flatten[linearTerms /@ (List @@ momentum), 1],
      Head[momentum] === Times,
        factors = List @@ momentum; vectors = Select[factors, !scalarParameterQ[#] &];
        If[Length[vectors] =!= 1,
          fail["UnsupportedLinearMomentum", <|"Momentum" -> momentum|>]];
        coefficient = Times @@ Select[factors, scalarParameterQ];
        If[!scalarParameterQ[coefficient],
          fail["UnsupportedLinearMomentum", <|"Momentum" -> momentum|>]];
        ({coefficient First[#], Last[#]} & /@ linearTerms[First[vectors]]),
      True, fail["UnsupportedLinearMomentum", <|"Momentum" -> momentum|>]]];
  linearEta[momentum_] := Total[(First[#] eta[Last[#][[1]]]) & /@ linearTerms[momentum]];
  linearTwiceQDot[momentum_] := Total[(First[#] twiceQDot[Last[#][[1]]]) & /@ linearTerms[momentum]];
  endpointChoices[spinor_] := Which[
    spinor === helicity["Square", shiftSquare],
      {{1, spinor}, {variable, helicity["Square", shiftAngle]}},
    spinor === helicity["Angle", shiftAngle],
      {{1, spinor}, {-variable, helicity["Angle", shiftSquare]}},
    MatchQ[spinor, Spinor["Helicity", "Angle" | "Square", _Integer]] &&
        MemberQ[external, rspSpinorLeg[spinor]], {{1, spinor}},
    MatchQ[spinor, Spinor["Xi", "Angle" | "Square", _, ___]], {{1, spinor}},
    MemberQ[pair, rspSpinorLeg[spinor]],
      fail["UnsupportedShiftedMasslessSpinor", <|"Spinor" -> spinor|>],
    kind[spinor] =!= None && Head[spinor] === Spinor &&
        MemberQ[{"Spin", "Helicity"}, First[spinor]] &&
        MemberQ[external, rspSpinorLeg[spinor]] &&
        FreeQ[spinor, _SpinorHat], {{1, spinor}},
    True, fail["UnsupportedSpinorEndpoint", <|"Spinor" -> spinor|>]];
  momentumChoices[momentum_] := Flatten[Function[term,
      Join[{{First[term], Last[term]}},
        If[eta[Last[term][[1]]] === 0, {},
          {{First[term] variable eta[Last[term][[1]]], rankOne}}]]] /@ linearTerms[momentum], 1];
  splitRankOne[parts_List] := Module[{position, beforeKind, prefixEnd, suffixStart},
    position = FirstPosition[parts, rankOne, Missing["NoShiftMomentum"]];
    If[MissingQ[position], Return[SpinorChain @@ parts]];
    position = First[position];
    beforeKind = If[EvenQ[position - 2], kind[First[parts]], opposite[kind[First[parts]]]];
    {prefixEnd, suffixStart} = If[beforeKind === "Angle",
      {helicity["Angle", shiftSquare], helicity["Square", shiftAngle]},
      {helicity["Square", shiftAngle], helicity["Angle", shiftSquare]}];
    splitRankOne[Join[Take[parts, position - 1], {prefixEnd}]] *
      splitRankOne[Join[{suffixStart}, Drop[parts, position]]]];
  shiftChain[chain_SpinorChain] := Module[{parts = List @@ chain, slots, choices},
    If[Length[parts] < 2 || kind[First[parts]] === None || kind[Last[parts]] === None,
      fail["UnsupportedSpinorChain", <|"Chain" -> chain|>]];
    slots = Rest[Most[parts]];
    If[(kind[First[parts]] === kind[Last[parts]]) =!= EvenQ[Length[slots]],
      fail["UnsupportedSpinorChainParity", <|"Chain" -> chain|>]];
    choices = Join[{endpointChoices[First[parts]]}, momentumChoices /@ slots,
      {endpointChoices[Last[parts]]}];
    If[Times @@ (Length /@ choices) > 4096,
      fail["ShiftChainExpansionLimit", <|"Limit" -> 4096|>]];
    Total[(Times @@ (First /@ #)) splitRankOne[Last /@ #] & /@ Tuples[choices]]];
  shift[value_] := Which[
    AtomQ[value], value,
    Head[value] === SpinorChain, shiftChain[value],
    MatchQ[value, SpinorTrace[_, _]], With[{reduced = ReduceSpinorProducts[value]},
      If[reduced === value, fail["UnreducedSpinorTrace"], shift[reduced]]],
    Head[value] === SpinorTrace,
      fail["UnsupportedLongSpinorTrace", <|"Trace" -> value|>],
    Head[value] === PropDen && MemberQ[{2, 3}, Length[value]] &&
        scalarParameterQ[Rest[List @@ value]],
      value + variable linearEta[First[value]] linearTwiceQDot[First[value]],
    Head[value] === MomProd && Length[value] === 2,
      value + variable/2 (eta[value[[1]]] twiceQDot[value[[2]]] +
        eta[value[[2]]] twiceQDot[value[[1]]]),
    Head[value] === Mandelstahm && Length[value] === 2,
      value + variable (eta[value[[1]]] + eta[value[[2]]]) *
        (twiceQDot[value[[1]]] + twiceQDot[value[[2]]]),
    MatchQ[value, Power[_Mom, _Integer?EvenQ]],
      (First[value]^2 + variable linearEta[First[value]] linearTwiceQDot[First[value]])^(value[[2]]/2),
    FreeQ[value, _Mom | _MomHat | _MomQ | _MomProd | _Mandelstahm |
      _Spinor | _SpinorHat | _SpinorChain | _SpinorTrace | _PropDen |
      _xFactor | _xTildeFactor], value,
    MemberQ[{Plus, Times, Power}, Head[value]], Map[shift, value],
    True, fail["UnsupportedShiftedStructure", <|"Expression" -> value|>]];
  Catch[shift[expression], tag]
];


completionNullPairChoices[normalized_Association] := Module[
  {external = normalized["ExternalMassRules"], labels, null, targets, evidence, weights, pairs, preferred},
  labels = Sort[Cases[external, HoldPattern[Mass[i_Integer] -> _] :> i]];
  null = Select[labels, TrueQ[(Mass[#] /. external) === 0] &];
  If[Length[null] < 2, Return[{}]];
  targets = completionTargets[normalized["Targets"]];
  evidence = SelectFirst[Lookup[targets, "StateSum", {}], # =!= 0 && !MissingQ[#] &, 0];
  weights = completionExternalSpinWeights[evidence, external];
  pairs = Select[Tuples[null, 2], DuplicateFreeQ];
  preferred = If[ListQ[weights], Select[pairs,
    weights[[First[FirstPosition[labels, First[#]]]]] > 0 &&
      weights[[First[FirstPosition[labels, Last[#]]]]] < 0 &], {}];
  Take[Join[preferred, Complement[pairs, preferred]], UpTo[4]]
];

completionNullPairReferences[expression_, pair_List, massRules_List] := Module[
  {metadata, null, assignments = <||>, excluded, kinds, preferred, selected},
  metadata = referenceExpressionMetadata[expression];
  null = Sort[Cases[massRules, HoldPattern[Mass[i_Integer] -> 0] :> i]];
  Do[
    excluded = Lookup[metadata["ReferenceLegs"], id, {}];
    kinds = DeleteDuplicates[Cases[expression, Spinor["Xi", kind_, reference_, ___] /;
      reference === id :> kind, Infinity]];
    preferred = If[kinds === {"Square"}, Reverse[pair], pair];
    selected = SelectFirst[DeleteDuplicates[Join[preferred, null]],
      !MemberQ[excluded, #] &, Missing["NoNullReference"]];
    If[MissingQ[selected], Return[Failure["NoRegularNullReference", <|"Reference" -> id|>]]];
    AssociateTo[assignments, id -> selected], {id, metadata["References"]}];
  <|"Expression" -> (expression /. Spinor["Xi", kind : ("Angle" | "Square"), id_, ___] :>
      Spinor["Helicity", kind, assignments[id]]), "Assignments" -> assignments|>
];

completionNullPairChannels[normalized_Association, pair : {_Integer, _Integer},
    rules_List, seed_Integer, limit_Integer, seconds_] := Module[
  {started = AbsoluteTime[], external, massRules = normalized["ExternalMassRules"], targets,
   variable = Unique["nullPairParameter"], sources = {}, records = {}, diagnostics = {},
   cut, eta, slope, assigned, shifted, direction, verification, available, finished,
   zeroBrackets, tag = Unique["nullPairCatalog"], exceeded = False},
  external = Sort[Cases[massRules, HoldPattern[Mass[i_Integer] -> _] :> i]];
  targets = completionTargets[normalized["Targets"]];
  If[!DuplicateFreeQ[pair] || !SubsetQ[external, pair] ||
      !AllTrue[pair, TrueQ[(Mass[#] /. massRules) === 0] &],
    Return[<|"Status" -> "UNAVAILABLE", "Basis" -> {}, "Pair" -> pair,
      "Diagnostics" -> {"A null-pair continuation requires two distinct declared massless external legs."}|>]];
  zeroBrackets[value_] := value /. HoldPattern[SpinorChain[
    s : Spinor["Helicity", "Angle" | "Square", _Integer], same_]] /;
      s === same :> 0;
  finished = TimeConstrained[Catch[
    Do[
      If[!TrueQ[Lookup[channel, "Complete", False]], Continue[]];
      cut = channel["Cut"];
      eta = Count[cut, First[pair]] - Count[cut, Last[pair]];
      If[eta === 0, Continue[]];
      slope = eta Total[Function[leg, If[MemberQ[pair, leg], 0,
        SpinorChain[Spinor["Helicity", "Angle", First[pair]], Mom[leg],
          Spinor["Helicity", "Square", Last[pair]]]]] /@ cut];
      If[slope === 0, Continue[]];
      assigned = completionNullPairReferences[channel["StateSum"], pair, massRules];
      If[FailureQ[assigned], AppendTo[diagnostics, assigned]; Continue[]];
      If[!FreeQ[assigned["Expression"], _xFactor | _xTildeFactor |
          Spinor[_, _, _Multiparticle, ___]],
        AppendTo[diagnostics, <|"Cut" -> cut, "Reason" -> "UnsupportedCompositeSpinorOrXFactor"|>];
        Continue[]];
      shifted = zeroBrackets[completionNullPairShift[
        zeroBrackets[assigned["Expression"]], variable, pair, external]];
      If[FailureQ[shifted], AppendTo[diagnostics, <|"Cut" -> cut, "Failure" -> shifted|>]; Continue[]];
      direction = zeroBrackets[(shifted /. variable -> (-channel["Propagator"]/slope))/
        channel["Propagator"]];
      If[!residueFiniteQ[direction] || !FreeQ[direction, variable],
        AppendTo[diagnostics, <|"Cut" -> cut, "Reason" -> "NonfiniteShiftedContinuation"|>]; Continue[]];
      available = Max[0.000001, seconds - (AbsoluteTime[] - started)];
      verification = TimeConstrained[completionContinuationCheck[
        channel["StateSum"]/channel["Propagator"], direction, channel, targets, rules, seed],
        Min[4, available], <|"Status" -> "UNRESOLVED", "Diagnostics" -> {"Selected-cut verification timed out."}|>];
      AppendTo[records, <|"Cut" -> cut, "Mass" -> channel["Mass"], "Pair" -> pair,
        "OriginalChannel" -> channel["StateSum"]/channel["Propagator"],
        "ReferenceAssignments" -> assigned["Assignments"], "VirtualitySlope" -> slope,
        "ShiftRoot" -> -channel["Propagator"]/slope,
        "Verification" -> verification|>];
      If[verification["Status"] =!= "PASS", Continue[]];
      AppendTo[sources, direction];
      If[Length[sources] > limit, exceeded = True; Throw[False, tag]], {channel, targets}]; True,
    tag], seconds, False];
  If[exceeded, sources = {}; AppendTo[diagnostics,
    "The shifted channel space exceeds its bounded intermediate source count."]];
  <|"Status" -> Which[exceeded, "UNAVAILABLE", sources === {}, "UNAVAILABLE",
      TrueQ[finished], "AVAILABLE", True, "PARTIAL"],
    "Basis" -> sources, "Pair" -> pair, "SourceChecks" -> records,
    "BoundaryAtInfinityAssumed" -> False, "OriginalTargetsRetained" -> True,
    "ElapsedTime" -> AbsoluteTime[] - started, "Diagnostics" -> diagnostics|>
];

completionCompactExchangeProject[expression_, plan_Association] := Module[
  {result = completionBoseProject[expression, plan], factors, sums, coefficient},
  factors = If[Head[result] === Times, List @@ result, {result}];
  sums = Select[factors, Head[#] === Plus &];
  If[Length[sums] === 1,
    coefficient = result/First[sums];
    If[NumericQ[coefficient], Return[Total[coefficient (List @@ First[sums])]]]];
  result
];

completionNullPairSupport[normalized_Association, model_List, requested_] := Module[
  {external = normalized["ExternalMassRules"], labels, null, massive, targets, evidence,
   weights, pairs, preferred, names, masslessRows, scalarLegs = {}, rows, position, reason},
  labels = Sort[Cases[external, HoldPattern[Mass[i_Integer] -> _] :> i]];
  null = Select[labels, TrueQ[(Mass[#] /. external) === 0] &];
  massive = Complement[labels, null];
  pairs = completionNullPairChoices[normalized];
  If[requested === True, Return[<|"Status" -> If[pairs === {}, "UNAVAILABLE", "AVAILABLE"],
    "Pairs" -> pairs, "Scope" -> "ExplicitGenericAttempt", "Diagnostics" -> {}|>]];
  If[Length[null] < 3 || Length[massive] > 2,
    Return[<|"Status" -> "UNAVAILABLE", "Pairs" -> {},
      "Diagnostics" -> {"Automatic shifted continuations require at least three null and at most two massive external legs, matching the current compound-pole checker support."}|>]];
  targets = completionTargets[normalized["Targets"]];
  evidence = SelectFirst[Lookup[targets, "StateSum", {}], # =!= 0 && !MissingQ[#] &, 0];
  weights = completionExternalSpinWeights[evidence, external];
  If[!ListQ[weights], Return[<|"Status" -> "UNAVAILABLE", "Pairs" -> {},
    "Diagnostics" -> {"Automatic shifted continuations require homogeneous external spin weights."}|>]];
  preferred = Select[pairs, weights[[First[FirstPosition[labels, First[#]]]]] > 0 &&
    weights[[First[FirstPosition[labels, Last[#]]]]] < 0 &];
  If[preferred =!= {}, Return[<|"Status" -> "AVAILABLE", "Pairs" -> preferred,
    "Scope" -> "OppositeNullSpinWeightsWithinDiagnosticSupport", "Diagnostics" -> {}|>]];
  names = Lookup[normalized, "ExternalParticles", Automatic];
  Do[
    position = First[FirstPosition[labels, leg]];
    rows = If[ListQ[names] && Length[names] === Length[labels],
      Select[model[[1]], MemberQ[#[[{2, 3}]], names[[position]]] &],
      Select[model[[1]], TrueQ[#[[6]] === 0] &]];
    If[rows =!= {} && AllTrue[rows, TrueQ[#[[5]] === 0] &] && weights[[position]] === 0,
      AppendTo[scalarLegs, leg]], {leg, null}];
  preferred = Select[pairs, SubsetQ[scalarLegs, #] &];
  <|"Status" -> If[preferred === {}, "UNAVAILABLE", "AVAILABLE"], "Pairs" -> preferred,
    "Scope" -> "NullScalarsWithinDiagnosticSupport", "Diagnostics" -> If[preferred === {}, {
      "Automatic shifted continuations leave same-sign or unidentified null spin states to the established completion routes."}, {}]|>
];

completionFitShiftedChannels[regular_, basis_List, normalized_Association,
    samples_Integer, validationSamples_Integer, seed_Integer, rules_List,
    validationSets_List, refinements_Integer, seconds_, callback_, enabled_] := Module[
  {fitSamples = If[TrueQ[$completionAutomaticFitSamples],
     amplitudeAutomaticFitSamples[amplitudeResourceMetrics[regular, normalized, Automatic, Length[basis]]], samples],
   started = AbsoluteTime[], unknowns = Table[Unique["shiftedChannelCoefficient"], {Length[basis]}],
   trial, constraints = <||>, solution = <||>, feedback = <||>, validation = Missing["NotChecked"],
   validations = {}, history = {}, allEquations = {}, allSamples = {}, free = {}, weights,
   candidate = regular, family = regular, remaining = {}, status = "UNRESOLVED", diagnostics = {},
   completed, validationSeed, validationCount, roundReports, familyPass, checked, zeroFree},
  If[basis === {} || validationSets === {} || normalized["Targets"] === {} ||
      !AllTrue[completionTargets[normalized["Targets"]],
        TrueQ[Lookup[#, "Complete", False]] && !MissingQ[Lookup[#, "StateSum", Missing[]]] &],
    Return[<|"Status" -> "UNRESOLVED", "Diagnostics" -> {
      "Shifted-channel fitting requires nonempty complete original targets, correction directions and validation parameter sets."}|>]];
  trial = regular + unknowns.basis;
  completed = TimeConstrained[
    constraints = completionResidueConstraints[trial, unknowns, normalized, fitSamples, seed,
      rules, seconds, callback, enabled];
    If[constraints["Status"] === "COMPLETE",
      allEquations = constraints["Equations"]; allSamples = constraints["Samples"];
      Do[
        completionProgress[callback, enabled, <|"Stage" -> "Solving shifted channel continuations",
          "Round" -> round, "Unknowns" -> Length[unknowns], "EquationCount" -> Length[allEquations]|>];
        solution = completionSolveLinear[allEquations, unknowns,
          Max[0.000001, seconds - (AbsoluteTime[] - started)]];
        If[!MemberQ[{"COMPLETE", "UNDERDETERMINED"}, solution["Status"]],
          diagnostics = Join[diagnostics, solution["Diagnostics"]]; Break[]];
        free = solution["FreeParameters"]; validationSeed = seed + 1000003 + 10000019 round;
        validationCount = validationSamples (round + 1); roundReports = {}; familyPass = True;
        feedback = <|"Status" -> "COMPLETE", "Equations" -> {}, "Samples" -> {}, "Diagnostics" -> {}|>;
        Do[
          checked = completionSparseValidation[trial, unknowns, solution, free, {}, normalized,
            validationCount, validationSeed, assignment,
            Max[0.000001, seconds - (AbsoluteTime[] - started)], callback, enabled];
          validation = checked["Report"]; familyPass = familyPass && TrueQ[checked["FamilyPass"]];
          feedback = <|"Status" -> If[feedback["Status"] === "COMPLETE" &&
              checked["Feedback"]["Status"] === "COMPLETE", "COMPLETE", "UNRESOLVED"],
            "Equations" -> Join[feedback["Equations"], checked["Feedback"]["Equations"]],
            "Samples" -> Join[feedback["Samples"], checked["Feedback"]["Samples"]],
            "Diagnostics" -> Join[feedback["Diagnostics"], checked["Feedback"]["Diagnostics"]]|>;
          AppendTo[roundReports, <|"ParameterRules" -> assignment, "RandomSeed" -> validationSeed,
            "Round" -> round, "Report" -> validation|>], {assignment, validationSets}];
        validations = Join[validations, roundReports];
        AppendTo[history, <|"Round" -> round, "FitSeed" -> seed,
          "ValidationSeed" -> validationSeed, "ValidationSamples" -> validationCount,
          "EquationCount" -> Length[allEquations], "Rank" -> solution["Rank"],
          "FreeParameters" -> free, "RemovedZeroDirections" -> 0,
          "Status" -> If[familyPass && AllTrue[roundReports,
            completionPhysicalPassQ[#["Report"], normalized["Targets"]] &], "COMPLETE", "NeedsRefinement"]|>];
        If[history[[-1]]["Status"] === "COMPLETE",
          weights = unknowns /. solution["SolutionRules"];
          candidate = regular + (weights /. Thread[free -> 0]).basis;
          remaining = Function[parameter, (Coefficient[#, parameter] & /@ weights).basis] /@ free;
          zeroFree = Pick[free, (# === 0 &) /@ remaining];
          free = Pick[free, (# =!= 0 &) /@ remaining]; remaining = DeleteCases[remaining, 0];
          family = candidate + If[free === {}, 0, free.remaining]; status = "COMPLETE";
          history[[-1]] = Join[Last[history], <|"FreeParameters" -> free,
            "RemovedZeroDirections" -> Length[zeroFree]|>]; Break[]];
        If[feedback["Status"] =!= "COMPLETE" || round === refinements, Break[]];
        allEquations = Join[allEquations, feedback["Equations"]];
        allSamples = Join[allSamples, feedback["Samples"]], {round, 0, refinements}];
      constraints = Join[constraints, <|"Equations" -> allEquations, "Samples" -> allSamples|>],
      diagnostics = Join[diagnostics, constraints["Diagnostics"]]]; True,
    seconds, False];
  If[!TrueQ[completed], status = "UNRESOLVED";
    AppendTo[diagnostics, "The bounded shifted-channel proposal fit exceeded its time budget."]];
  <|"Status" -> status, "FitSamples" -> fitSamples, "Amplitude" -> candidate, "FamilyAmplitude" -> family,
    "RemainingBasis" -> remaining, "FreeParameters" -> free, "CorrectionBasis" -> basis,
    "ConstraintData" -> <|"FitSeed" -> regular, "FitVariables" -> unknowns,
      "Fit" -> constraints, "LinearSolution" -> solution, "Validation" -> feedback|>,
    "ValidationReport" -> validation, "ValidationReports" -> validations,
    "RefinementHistory" -> history, "ElapsedTime" -> AbsoluteTime[] - started,
    "Diagnostics" -> diagnostics|>
];

CompleteFactorization::usage = CompleteFactorization::usage <>
  " ShiftedChannelContinuations -> Automatic also tries up to four source-derived two-null-leg continuation proposals after cheap input/remainder routes, before wide correction spaces. Automatic requires at least three null and at most two massive external legs, matching the current compound-pole checker, and prefers opposite nonzero spin weights or identified null scalars. False or None disables this route; True permits a generic attempt beyond Automatic's support preference, with all original and final checks still required. Each direction is verified on its own original cut, then exact compact signed exchange averages are fitted against every original residue simultaneously. No shifted-sum formula or vanishing large-parameter boundary is assumed. Existing regular input pieces stay fixed; InputReweighting -> Automatic may fit the pole-bearing input core alongside the channel directions. Details retain ShiftedChannelContinuations, source checks, eligibility reasons, ShiftedChannelAttempts and ShiftedChannelFit. Unsupported, over-budget or nonclosing proposals fall back to the established routes.";

Options[CompleteFactorization] = {"CorrectionBasis" -> Automatic,
  "ParameterRules" -> Automatic, "Samples" -> Automatic, "ValidationSamples" -> Automatic,
  "ValidationParameterRules" -> Automatic, "ChannelReferences" -> Automatic,
  "AlternativeChannels" -> {}, "BoseSymmetryGroups" -> Automatic, "FermionSymmetryGroups" -> Automatic,
  "ExternalParticles" -> Automatic, "InputReweighting" -> Automatic,
  "RepresentativeSelection" -> Automatic, "PolePreference" -> Automatic, "ChannelCompanions" -> Automatic,
  "PreparationRemainders" -> Automatic, "ShiftedChannelContinuations" -> Automatic,
  "MaxRefinements" -> 3,
  "RandomSeed" -> Automatic, "TimeConstraint" -> Automatic, "MaxCorrectionTerms" -> Automatic,
  "Parallelization" -> Automatic, "MaxKernels" -> Automatic,
  "ProgressReporting" -> True, "ProgressFunction" -> Automatic,
  "ReturnDetails" -> False, "Output" -> "Amplitude"};

CompleteFactorization[input_, channelInput : (_List | _Association), model_List, opts : OptionsPattern[]] :=
  ConstructiveDiagrams`Private`amplitudeAutomaticFactorization[input, channelInput, model, {opts}];

(* Admit an already built complete union without repeating its construction.
   The dynamic ceiling is granted only by the public Automatic-cap wrapper. *)
ConstructiveDiagrams`Private`completionSourceConstructionLimit[limit_Integer, order_Integer] :=
  If[order === 1, limit, Max[limit, Min[4096, limit order]]];

ConstructiveDiagrams`Private`completionMaterializedBasisCap[basis_, requestedBasis_, limit_Integer, ceiling_] := Module[
  {count = If[ListQ[basis], Length[basis], 0], next = limit, changes = {}},
  If[requestedBasis === Automatic && ListQ[basis] &&
      FreeQ[basis, _Failure | _Missing | $Failed | $Aborted | $TimedOut] &&
      IntegerQ[ceiling] && limit < count <= ceiling,
    next = Min[ceiling, 2^Ceiling[Log[2, count]]];
    changes = {<|"From" -> limit, "To" -> next,
      "ObservedProjectedDirections" -> count, "Operation" -> "ReuseCompleteExchangeUnion"|>}];
  <|"EffectiveMaxCorrectionTerms" -> next, "CapChanges" -> changes|>
];

ConstructiveDiagrams`Private`completionFactorizationCore[input_, channelInput : (_List | _Association), model_List, opts : OptionsPattern[CompleteFactorization]] := Block[{$completionParallelSettings = <|
    "Parallelization" -> OptionValue["Parallelization"], "MaxKernels" -> OptionValue["MaxKernels"]|>,
    ConstructiveDiagrams`Private`$rspCanonicalProductBasis = True}, Module[
  {output = OptionValue["Output"], details = OptionValue["ReturnDetails"],
   basisOption = OptionValue["CorrectionBasis"],
   references = OptionValue["ChannelReferences"], alternatives = OptionValue["AlternativeChannels"],
   inputReweighting = OptionValue["InputReweighting"],
   representativeOption = OptionValue["RepresentativeSelection"],
   polePreference = OptionValue["PolePreference"],
   companionOption = OptionValue["ChannelCompanions"],
   remainderOption = OptionValue["PreparationRemainders"],
   shiftedOption = OptionValue["ShiftedChannelContinuations"],
   channelRows, channelPreparation = <||>,
   boseGroups = OptionValue["BoseSymmetryGroups"], fermionGroups = OptionValue["FermionSymmetryGroups"],
   exchangePlan, processNames, processSources,
   constructionLimit, project, projectedSeed, unionAdmission, unionCapChanges = {},
   projectedSeedNormalization = Missing["NotRequested"], projectedNormalizationMetrics, projectedNormalizationBudget,
   refinements = OptionValue["MaxRefinements"],
   rules = residueParameterRules[model, OptionValue["ParameterRules"]], samples = OptionValue["Samples"],
   validationSamples = OptionValue["ValidationSamples"],
   seed = amplitudeResolveRandomSeed[OptionValue["RandomSeed"]],
   validationRules = OptionValue["ValidationParameterRules"], validationSets, validationReports = {},
   seconds = OptionValue["TimeConstraint"], limit = OptionValue["MaxCorrectionTerms"],
   enabled = OptionValue["ProgressReporting"], callback = OptionValue["ProgressFunction"],
   normalized, support, checkRows, original, candidate, family, remaining = {}, basis = {}, unknowns = {},
   constraints, solution, validation, initial, report, finished, start = AbsoluteTime[], free = {},
   diagnostics = {}, status = "UNRESOLVED", continuations = <||>, history = {},
   trial, allEquations = {}, allSamples = {}, feedback = <||>, roundReports, round,
   validationSeed, validationCount, familyPass, zeroFree, cleaned, cleanup, fastPath, sparseValidation,
   weights, familyMaterialized = False, fittedPointCheckpoint = Missing["NotFitted"],
   reducedChannels = Missing["NotRequested"], selectedChannels = Missing["NotRequested"],
   space = "NotRequired", fallbackBasis, literalBasis, channelLiteralBasis, groupedBasis,
   budgetSpaces = {}, inputProposals, inputAttempt, inputAttempts = {}, inputFitStart, inputFitBudget,
   representative = <|"Status" -> "UNCHANGED", "Reason" -> "No free family was selected."|>,
   postStarted, postBudget, ordinaryCompaction,
   physicalSpace = Missing["NotRequested"], physicalFit = Missing["NotRequested"],
   conservationSpace = Missing["NotRequested"], conservationFit = Missing["NotRequested"],
   conservationStarted, conservationBudget, conservationBuildBudget,
   physicalStarted, physicalBudget, physicalBuildBudget, physicalFitSeed,
   reducedPhysicalSpace = Missing["NotRequested"], reducedPhysicalFit = Missing["NotRequested"],
   physicalSourceAttempts = {}, acceptPreferredFit, reducedPhysicalBudget,
   structuredMetrics, structuredEligibility = Missing["NotRequested"], structuredSpace = Missing["NotRequested"],
   structuredFit = Missing["NotRequested"], structuredStarted, structuredBudget, structuredCapChanges = {},
   structuredPresentation, structuredCatalog,
   physicalSelected = Missing["NotRequested"], physicalReferences,
   companionSpace = Missing["NotRequested"], companionFit = Missing["NotRequested"],
   companionStarted, companionBudget, companionBuildBudget, companionFitSeed,
   ordinaryCompanionAttempted = False, compactEmissionCompanions,
   remainderSpace = Missing["NotRequested"], remainderFit = Missing["NotRequested"],
   remainderStarted, remainderBudget, remainderFitSeed, remainderProbe = Missing["NotRequested"],
   shiftedSpace = Missing["NotRequested"], shiftedFit = Missing["NotRequested"],
   shiftedAttempts = {}, shiftedPairs, shiftedStarted, shiftedBudget, shiftedInput,
   shiftedCatalog, shiftedBasis, shiftedCore, shiftedSeed, shiftedFitSeed,
   shiftedSupport, shiftedProjected, shiftedVariants, shiftedMode,
   referenceAttempts = {}, retainedReference, retainedReferenceBasis,
   fallbackReport, fallbackOptions, remainingSeconds, attemptSummary, alternativeSpace},
  If[!MemberQ[{"Amplitude", "Expression", "Details"}, output] || !MemberQ[{True, False}, details] ||
      !(basisOption === Automatic || ListQ[basisOption]) || !completionParameterRulesQ[rules] ||
      !IntegerQ[samples] || samples < 1 ||
      !IntegerQ[validationSamples] || validationSamples < 1 || !IntegerQ[seed] ||
      !MemberQ[{Automatic, True, False}, OptionValue["Parallelization"]] ||
      !(OptionValue["MaxKernels"] === Automatic ||
        IntegerQ[OptionValue["MaxKernels"]] && OptionValue["MaxKernels"] >= 1) ||
      !MemberQ[{Automatic, None}, references] || !MemberQ[{Automatic, None}, inputReweighting] ||
      !MemberQ[{Automatic, None}, representativeOption] ||
      !MemberQ[preparationReferenceChoices, polePreference] || !MemberQ[{Automatic, None}, companionOption] ||
      !MemberQ[{Automatic, None}, remainderOption] ||
      !MemberQ[{Automatic, True, False, None}, shiftedOption] ||
      !IntegerQ[refinements] || refinements < 0 ||
      !ListQ[alternatives] || !AllTrue[alternatives, preparationChannelQ] ||
      !(validationRules === Automatic || (ListQ[validationRules] &&
        AllTrue[validationRules, completionParameterRulesQ])) ||
      !(seconds === Infinity || TrueQ[NumericQ[seconds] &&
        Element[seconds, Reals] && 0 < seconds < Infinity]) ||
      !IntegerQ[limit] || limit < 1 || !MemberQ[{True, False}, enabled] ||
      !(callback === Automatic || MatchQ[callback, _Function | _Symbol]) ||
      Complement[First /@ {opts}, First /@ Options[CompleteFactorization]] =!= {},
    Message[CompleteFactorization::args]; Return[$Failed]];
  If[TrueQ[details], output = "Details"];
  If[AssociationQ[channelInput],
    If[!completionPreparedChannelsQ[channelInput], Message[CompleteFactorization::args]; Return[$Failed]];
    channelPreparation = channelInput;
    channelRows = channelInput["OriginalAmplitudes"], channelRows = channelInput];
  normalized = TimeConstrained[completionNormalizeInput[input, channelRows, model], seconds,
    Missing["CompletionInputTimeout"]];
  If[MissingQ[normalized], Return[completionFormat[<|"Stage" -> "Factorization",
    "Status" -> "UNRESOLVED", "Amplitude" -> completionInputExpression[input],
    "OriginalInput" -> input, "Correction" -> 0, "FreeParameters" -> {},
    "RandomSeed" -> seed,
    "Diagnostics" -> {"Input preparation exceeded TimeConstraint; the original input is retained."}|>, output, False]]];
  If[!AssociationQ[normalized] || FailureQ[normalized],
    Message[CompleteFactorization::args]; Return[$Failed]];
  polePreference = completionPolePreference[polePreference, input, channelPreparation];
  normalized = Join[normalized, <|"PolePreference" -> polePreference|>];
  processSources = DeleteCases[{OptionValue["ExternalParticles"],
    Lookup[normalized, "ExternalParticles", Automatic],
    Lookup[channelPreparation, "ExternalParticles", Automatic]}, Automatic];
  If[Length[DeleteDuplicates[processSources]] > 1,
    Return[Failure["InconsistentExternalParticles", <|"MessageTemplate" ->
      "The amplitude and channel process labels disagree."|>]]];
  processNames = If[processSources === {}, Automatic, First[processSources]];
  If[processNames =!= Automatic,
    processNames = preparationExternalParticleNames[processNames, normalized["ExternalMassRules"], model];
    If[FailureQ[processNames], Return[processNames]];
    normalized = Join[normalized, <|"ExternalParticles" -> processNames|>]];
  exchangePlan = completionExchangePlan[normalized, model, boseGroups, fermionGroups, processNames];
  If[FailureQ[exchangePlan], Return[exchangePlan]];
  constructionLimit = completionSourceConstructionLimit[limit, exchangePlan["Order"]];
  project[value_] := If[exchangePlan["Order"] === 1, value,
    Expand[canonicalChains[residueCanonicalPropagators[completionBoseProject[value, exchangePlan],
      Cases[normalized["ExternalMassRules"], HoldPattern[Mass[i_Integer] -> _] :> i]]]]];
  original = normalized["Expression"]; candidate = original; family = original;
  projectedSeed = original;
  checkRows = completionCheckChannelRows[normalized, channelRows];
  validationSets = completionValidationRuleSets[model, OptionValue["ParameterRules"], validationRules];
  initial = Missing["NotChecked"]; validation = Missing["NotChecked"];
  constraints = <||>; solution = <||>;
  cleanup[value_] := Module[{reduced, factored, best = value},
    factored = withProtectedPropagators[value, rspCommonScalarContent];
    If[residueFiniteQ[factored] && preparationBetterQ[preparationRank[factored], preparationRank[best]],
      best = factored];
    reduced = TimeConstrained[completionExternalReduce[value, normalized["ExternalMassRules"]],
      2, value];
    If[residueFiniteQ[reduced] && !FailureQ[reduced] &&
        preparationBetterQ[preparationRank[reduced], preparationRank[best]], reduced, best]];
  completionProgress[callback, enabled, <|"Stage" -> "Checking initial factorization"|>];
  finished = TimeConstrained[
    If[exchangePlan["Order"] > 1,
      completionProgress[callback, enabled, <|"Stage" -> If[exchangePlan["FermionGroups"] === {}, "Averaging identical boson labels",
        If[exchangePlan["BoseGroups"] === {}, "Antisymmetrizing identical fermions",
          "Applying boson and fermion exchange symmetry"]],
        "Total" -> exchangePlan["Order"]|>];
      projectedSeed = project[original];
      (* Use the actual number of implicit massive-spin legs, rather than the
         deliberately capped resource equation-count heuristic. The audited
         identity helper itself decides eligibility of each algebraic sector. *)
      projectedNormalizationMetrics = amplitudeResourceMetrics[normalized, normalized, processNames];
      If[Length[Lookup[projectedNormalizationMetrics, "CoherentSpinLegs", {}]] >= 6,
        projectedNormalizationBudget = If[seconds === Infinity, 20,
          Min[20, Max[0.000001, seconds - (AbsoluteTime[] - start)]/3]];
        completionProgress[callback, enabled,
          <|"Stage" -> "Normalizing complete exchanged amplitude"|>];
        projectedSeedNormalization = preparationMultilinearIdentityNormalize[projectedSeed,
          normalized["ExternalMassRules"], True, projectedNormalizationBudget];
        If[AssociationQ[projectedSeedNormalization] &&
            Lookup[projectedSeedNormalization, "Status", None] === "IMPROVED" &&
            residueFiniteQ[projectedSeedNormalization["Amplitude"]],
          projectedSeed = projectedSeedNormalization["Amplitude"]]];
      candidate = projectedSeed; family = projectedSeed];
    initial = If[exchangePlan["Order"] > 1,
      completionSparseValidation[projectedSeed, {}, <|"SolutionRules" -> {}|>, {}, {},
        normalized, validationSamples, seed + 1000003, rules, seconds, callback, enabled]["Report"],
      CheckAmplitudes[{normalized["ExternalMassRules"], projectedSeed}, checkRows, model,
      "ParameterRules" -> rules, "Samples" -> validationSamples,
      "RandomSeed" -> seed + 1000003, "TimeConstraint" -> seconds, "Tolerance" -> 0,
      "KinematicMap" -> Automatic, "KinematicKind" -> "Sample",
      "SpuriousPoles" -> {}, "HighEnergyCheck" -> False, "ReferenceCheck" -> False,
        "Parallelization" -> OptionValue["Parallelization"], "MaxKernels" -> OptionValue["MaxKernels"],
      "Output" -> "Details"]];
    fastPath = (basisOption === Automatic || basisOption === {}) &&
      completionPhysicalPassQ[initial, normalized["Targets"]];
    If[fastPath,
      status = "COMPLETE"; familyMaterialized = True;
      Do[
        validation = If[exchangePlan["Order"] > 1,
          completionSparseValidation[candidate, {}, <|"SolutionRules" -> {}|>, {}, {},
            normalized, validationSamples, seed + 1000003, validationSet,
            seconds, callback, enabled]["Report"],
          CheckAmplitudes[{normalized["ExternalMassRules"], candidate},
          checkRows, model, "ParameterRules" -> validationSet,
          "Samples" -> validationSamples, "RandomSeed" -> seed + 1000003,
          "TimeConstraint" -> seconds, "Tolerance" -> 0, "SpuriousPoles" -> {},
          "KinematicMap" -> Automatic, "KinematicKind" -> "Sample",
          "HighEnergyCheck" -> False, "ReferenceCheck" -> False,
          "Parallelization" -> OptionValue["Parallelization"], "MaxKernels" -> OptionValue["MaxKernels"],
          "Output" -> "Details"]];
        AppendTo[validationReports, <|"ParameterRules" -> validationSet,
          "RandomSeed" -> seed + 1000003, "Round" -> 0, "Report" -> validation|>];
        If[!completionPhysicalPassQ[validation, normalized["Targets"]],
          status = "UNRESOLVED";
          AppendTo[history, <|"Round" -> 0, "Status" -> "InitialParameterValidationFailed"|>];
          Break[]], {validationSet, validationSets}]];
    If[status =!= "COMPLETE" && basisOption === Automatic && references === Automatic &&
        inputReweighting === Automatic,
      inputFitStart = AbsoluteTime[];
      inputFitBudget = If[seconds === Infinity, 30,
        Min[30, Max[0, seconds - (inputFitStart - start)]/5]];
      inputProposals = TimeConstrained[completionInputProposals[normalized],
        Min[2, Max[0.000001, inputFitBudget/4]], <|"Status" -> "UNRESOLVED", "Proposals" -> {},
          "Diagnostics" -> {"Input term collection exceeded its bounded time budget."}|>];
      If[inputProposals["Status"] =!= "AVAILABLE",
        AppendTo[inputAttempts, <|"Mode" -> "InputCollection", "Status" -> "UNRESOLVED",
          "Diagnostics" -> inputProposals["Diagnostics"]|>],
        Do[
          remainingSeconds = inputFitBudget - (AbsoluteTime[] - inputFitStart);
          If[remainingSeconds <= 0.01, Break[]];
          completionProgress[callback, enabled, <|"Stage" -> "Trying input reweighting",
            "Operation" -> proposal["Mode"], "Unknowns" -> 1|>];
          inputAttempt = TimeConstrained[completionFitInputProposal[
            Join[proposal, <|"Direction" -> project[proposal["Direction"]]|>],
            project[inputProposals["RegularExpression"]], normalized,
            samples, validationSamples, seed, rules, validationSets, remainingSeconds, callback, enabled],
            remainingSeconds, <|"Mode" -> proposal["Mode"], "Status" -> "UNRESOLVED",
              "Reason" -> "Input reweighting exceeded its bounded time budget."|>];
          AppendTo[inputAttempts, inputAttempt];
          If[inputAttempt["Status"] === "COMPLETE",
            candidate = inputAttempt["Amplitude"]; family = candidate;
            basis = {inputAttempt["Direction"]}; unknowns = {inputAttempt["Coefficient"]};
            constraints = inputAttempt["Constraints"]; solution = inputAttempt["Solution"];
            validation = inputAttempt["ValidationReport"];
            validationReports = Join[validationReports, inputAttempt["ValidationReports"]];
            history = {<|"Round" -> 0, "Status" -> "COMPLETE", "InputFit" -> inputAttempt["Mode"],
              "NormalizationFactor" -> inputAttempt["NormalizationFactor"], "FreeParameters" -> {},
              "RemovedZeroDirections" -> 0, "Rank" -> 1,
              "EquationCount" -> Length[constraints["Equations"]]|>};
            space = inputAttempt["Mode"]; status = "COMPLETE"; familyMaterialized = True; Break[]],
          {proposal, inputProposals["Proposals"]}]]];
    (* Try grouped emission sources before the wide physical space when
       one null leg radiates from exchange-related massive fermion lines.
       The existing large-job policy and late fallback remain available. *)
    compactEmissionCompanions = polePreference === "AllPhysical" &&
      exchangePlan["FermionGroups"] =!= {} &&
      Count[Last /@ normalized["ExternalMassRules"], 0] === 1 &&
      AnyTrue[normalized["Targets"], Function[target, Length[target["Cut"]] === 2 &&
        MemberQ[Mass /@ target["Cut"] /. normalized["ExternalMassRules"], 0] &&
        !residueExactZero[target["Mass"]]]];
    If[status =!= "COMPLETE" && basisOption === Automatic && references === Automatic &&
        companionOption === Automatic && (compactEmissionCompanions ||
          TrueQ[$completionAutomaticPoleSearch] &&
            (Length[normalized["Records"]] >= 12 || Length[normalized["Targets"]] >= 10)),
      ordinaryCompanionAttempted = !compactEmissionCompanions;
      completionProgress[callback, enabled, <|"Stage" -> "Trying compact automatic correction sources"|>];
      If[!compactEmissionCompanions,
        continuations = completionChannelContinuations[normalized, model, rules, seed]];
        If[companionOption === Automatic,
          companionStarted = AbsoluteTime[];
          companionBudget = If[seconds === Infinity, Max[60, 10 Length[normalized["Targets"]]],
            Min[Max[60, 10 Length[normalized["Targets"]]],
              Max[0, seconds - (companionStarted - start)]/3]];
          companionBuildBudget = Min[Max[15, 3 Length[normalized["Targets"]]], companionBudget/2];
          completionProgress[callback, enabled, <|"Stage" -> "Preparing compact channel companions"|>];
          companionSpace = TimeConstrained[
            If[compactEmissionCompanions,
              continuations = completionChannelContinuations[normalized, model, rules, seed]];
            completionPeeledChannelBasis[
              normalized, continuations, exchangePlan, limit, rules, seed, companionBuildBudget,
              compactEmissionCompanions],
            Max[0.000001, companionBuildBudget], Missing["CompanionConstructionTimeout"]];
          remainingSeconds = companionBudget - (AbsoluteTime[] - companionStarted);
          If[AssociationQ[companionSpace] && ListQ[Lookup[companionSpace, "Basis", None]] &&
              companionSpace["Basis"] =!= {} && remainingSeconds > 0.01,
            completionProgress[callback, enabled, <|"Stage" -> "Fitting compact channel companions",
              "Unknowns" -> Length[companionSpace["Basis"]]|>];
            fallbackOptions = Join[Association[Options[CompleteFactorization]], Association[{opts}],
              <|"CorrectionBasis" -> companionSpace["Basis"], "BoseSymmetryGroups" -> {}, "FermionSymmetryGroups" -> {},
                "InputReweighting" -> None, "ChannelCompanions" -> None,
                "RepresentativeSelection" -> None, "AlternativeChannels" -> {},
                "ReturnDetails" -> True, "TimeConstraint" -> remainingSeconds|>];
            companionFit = TimeConstrained[CompleteFactorization[
              {normalized["ExternalMassRules"], project[companionSpace["RegularExpression"]]},
              checkRows, model, Sequence @@ Normal[completionChildResourceOptions[fallbackOptions]]], remainingSeconds,
              Missing["CompanionFitTimeout"]];
            If[AssociationQ[companionFit] && companionFit["Status"] === "COMPLETE" &&
                (!compactEmissionCompanions || TrueQ[companionFit["AchievedPhysicalDenominators"]]),
              candidate = companionFit["Amplitude"]; family = companionFit["FamilyAmplitude"];
              remaining = companionFit["RemainingBasis"]; free = companionFit["FreeParameters"];
              basis = companionFit["CorrectionBasis"];
              constraints = companionFit["ConstraintData"]["Fit"];
              solution = companionFit["ConstraintData"]["LinearSolution"];
              unknowns = companionFit["ConstraintData"]["FitVariables"];
              companionFitSeed = companionFit["ConstraintData"]["FitSeed"];
              feedback = companionFit["ConstraintData"]["Validation"];
              validation = companionFit["ValidationReport"];
              validationReports = Join[validationReports, companionFit["ValidationReports"]];
              samples = Lookup[companionFit, "FitSamples", samples];
          history = companionFit["RefinementHistory"];
              space = "PeeledChannels"; status = "COMPLETE"; familyMaterialized = True]]];

    ];
    (* Prefer a source-derived physical representation when requested by
       preparation. This is a bounded proposal, fitted against every original
       residue, not an assertion that diagram continuations are identities. *)
    If[status =!= "COMPLETE" && basisOption === Automatic && references === Automatic &&
        polePreference =!= None,
      physicalStarted = AbsoluteTime[];
      physicalBudget = If[seconds === Infinity,
        Max[90, 30 Length[normalized["Targets"]]],
        Min[Max[90, 30 Length[normalized["Targets"]]],
          3 Max[0, seconds - (physicalStarted - start)]/4]];
      acceptPreferredFit[fit_Association, proposal_Association] := If[fit["Status"] === "COMPLETE",
        physicalSpace = proposal; physicalFit = fit;
        candidate = fit["Amplitude"]; family = fit["FamilyAmplitude"];
        remaining = fit["RemainingBasis"]; free = fit["FreeParameters"];
        basis = fit["CorrectionBasis"]; constraints = fit["ConstraintData"]["Fit"];
        solution = fit["ConstraintData"]["LinearSolution"];
        unknowns = fit["ConstraintData"]["FitVariables"];
        physicalFitSeed = fit["ConstraintData"]["FitSeed"];
        feedback = fit["ConstraintData"]["Validation"];
        validation = fit["ValidationReport"];
        validationReports = Join[validationReports, fit["ValidationReports"]];
        samples = Lookup[fit, "FitSamples", samples]; history = fit["RefinementHistory"];
        space = If[polePreference === "AllPhysical", "PhysicalChannels", "PreferredReferences"];
        status = "COMPLETE"; familyMaterialized = True];
      (* Several coherent massive-spin legs benefit from correlated numerator
         blocks before broad channel/reference enumeration. Eligibility is a
         measured work-size policy, not a model or particle-name restriction. *)
      structuredMetrics = amplitudeResourceMetrics[normalized, normalized, processNames];
      structuredEligibility = <|"SourceRecords" -> Length[normalized["Records"]],
        "CoherentComponents" -> Lookup[structuredMetrics, "CoherentComponents", 1],
        "Eligible" -> (Length[normalized["Records"]] >= 12 &&
          Lookup[structuredMetrics, "CoherentComponents", 1] >= 16)|>;
      If[polePreference === "AllPhysical" && TrueQ[structuredEligibility["Eligible"]],
        structuredStarted = AbsoluteTime[];
        structuredBudget = Min[Max[90, 12 Length[normalized["Targets"]]],
          Max[0.000001, (physicalBudget - (structuredStarted - physicalStarted))/2]];
        structuredCatalog = None;
        Do[
          remainingSeconds = structuredBudget - (AbsoluteTime[] - structuredStarted);
          If[remainingSeconds <= 0.01 || status === "COMPLETE", Break[]];
          completionProgress[callback, enabled, <|"Stage" ->
            If[structuredPresentation === "Original", "Preparing original physical source blocks",
              "Preparing normalized physical source blocks"]|>];
          structuredSpace = completionStructuredPhysicalSourceBasis[
            If[remainderOption === None, KeyDrop[normalized, "RemainderData"], normalized], channelPreparation,
            exchangePlan, constructionLimit, limit, Min[60, remainingSeconds/3],
            structuredPresentation, structuredCatalog];
          If[AssociationQ[structuredSpace],
            structuredCapChanges = DeleteDuplicates[Join[structuredCapChanges, Lookup[structuredSpace, "CapChanges", {}]]];
            If[AssociationQ[Lookup[structuredSpace, "CompleteSourceCatalog", None]] &&
                Lookup[structuredSpace["CompleteSourceCatalog"], "Status", None] === "COMPLETE",
              structuredCatalog = structuredSpace["CompleteSourceCatalog"]]];
          If[AssociationQ[structuredSpace] &&
              IntegerQ[Lookup[structuredSpace, "EffectiveMaxCorrectionTerms", None]] &&
              IntegerQ[$completionAutomaticCorrectionTermCeiling] &&
              limit < structuredSpace["EffectiveMaxCorrectionTerms"] <= $completionAutomaticCorrectionTermCeiling,
            limit = structuredSpace["EffectiveMaxCorrectionTerms"];
            constructionLimit = completionSourceConstructionLimit[limit, exchangePlan["Order"]]];
          remainingSeconds = structuredBudget - (AbsoluteTime[] - structuredStarted);
          structuredFit = Missing["StructuredPhysicalFitNotAttempted"];
          If[AssociationQ[structuredSpace] && structuredSpace["Status"] === "AVAILABLE" && remainingSeconds > 0.01,
            completionProgress[callback, enabled, <|"Stage" ->
              If[structuredPresentation === "Original", "Fitting original physical source blocks",
                "Fitting normalized physical source blocks"], "Unknowns" -> Length[structuredSpace["Basis"]]|>];
            fallbackOptions = Join[Association[Options[CompleteFactorization]], Association[{opts}],
              <|"CorrectionBasis" -> structuredSpace["Basis"], "MaxCorrectionTerms" -> limit,
                "PolePreference" -> polePreference, "BoseSymmetryGroups" -> {}, "FermionSymmetryGroups" -> {},
                "InputReweighting" -> None, "ChannelCompanions" -> None, "PreparationRemainders" -> None,
                "AlternativeChannels" -> {}, "ReturnDetails" -> True, "TimeConstraint" -> remainingSeconds|>];
            structuredFit = TimeConstrained[CompleteFactorization[
              {normalized["ExternalMassRules"], project[structuredSpace["RegularExpression"]]},
              checkRows, model, Sequence @@ Normal[completionChildResourceOptions[fallbackOptions]]],
              remainingSeconds, Missing["StructuredPhysicalFitTimeout"]];
            If[AssociationQ[structuredFit], acceptPreferredFit[structuredFit, structuredSpace]]];
          AppendTo[physicalSourceAttempts, <|"CandidateMode" -> "StructuredPreparedPhysicalBlocks",
            "SourcePresentation" -> structuredPresentation, "Eligibility" -> structuredEligibility,
            "Construction" -> structuredSpace, "Fit" -> If[AssociationQ[structuredFit],
              KeyTake[structuredFit, {"Status", "ElapsedTime", "Diagnostics", "RefinementHistory"}], structuredFit]|>],
          {structuredPresentation, {"Original", "Normalized"}}]];
      (* Try the original reduced channel sources before enumerating additional
         selected-cut continuations. This is a complete smaller proposal, not
         a truncation of the larger union. Its fit still tests every original
         channel, all retained affine directions and independent samples. *)
      If[status =!= "COMPLETE" && polePreference === "AllPhysical" &&
          (AnyTrue[normalized["Targets"], Length[#["Cut"]] > 2 &] ||
            Lookup[structuredMetrics, "CoherentComponents", 1] <= 4),
        completionProgress[callback, enabled,
          <|"Stage" -> "Preparing compact physical source terms"|>];
        reducedPhysicalBudget = Min[Max[90, 12 Length[normalized["Targets"]]], physicalBudget/2];
        reducedPhysicalSpace = TimeConstrained[
          If[!KeyExistsQ[continuations, "Variants"],
